  ('zcrm_1579374000156381249', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091382002', 'Kathleen Walek', NULL, '01.09.2025 Kathleen called to log into her MPB Portal. She proceeded to explain she was over charged due to her advisor sending the information over to billing unknown to Whitney, that it was WAY passed the timeline, passed 3pm ET. It sounds like Whitney send it in an hour and a half delay, which resulted in Kathleen being overcharged $45.
