She was also concerned about Privacy Policy. Do we have options on that, outside of HIPAA.
In MPB Portal 
Legacy page: 1enrollment.com/information/5000.cfm?page=profile (wondering if we could remove this page) It is confusing. 
STEPS:
Logged in
Next to ID > menu
View your information = wrong information
However if she clicked on Product information, she will get the right information. 
 NT 
PHONE call = 54 min', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-09 16:27:13', '2025-01-10 11:26:54'),
