  ('zcrm_1579374000156310021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129625123', 'Casey Zahorik', NULL, '1-8-25 Kim called to see how to access UC Health for Case after a serious dog bite! She will ask her dr. friends what they think about Select Health and call me back. She knows of the 15th deadline.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-08 11:02:02', '2025-01-08 11:02:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156311043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081119002', 'Azeem Tajani', NULL, '01.08.2025 Alice called to confirm that they still have coverage with us. They had called Planstin from their card, and got worried when Planstin informed them that they are no longer insured by them. I concurred, and explained that several emails were sent out to Azeem''s email informing of the transition ahead of time, as well as the information of the card and process as a whole. I resent them letter and card to both Azeem and Alice. 
