  ('zcrm_1579374000156310013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130526354', 'Sondra Blanchard', NULL, '1-8-25 Sondra is considering the Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 7200, per the above notes. She has some menopause issues and HRT she needs help with. However, some doctors are telling her she might need a hysterectomy!  She''s going to seek out some other opinions since she''s already had an invasive surgery that she now thinks wasn''t necessary. She was inquiring about MCS again and I sent her the Premium Care and HAB information. However, I forgot that she''s also paying for Madeleine''s plan on her account as well. So, she''s pay $1 for her and the rest is for her own plan. So, going to MCS might not be helpful bc then she''ll be paying the full price for Madeleine instead plus the full price for MCS. She will run some numbers and decide by Friday to enroll.  However, if she were to add HAB she does all of the wellness visits, dental, vision, gym, nutrition, mental health and often needs the follow up ultrasound for mammos. So, HAB would be excellent for her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-08 10:35:51', '2025-01-08 10:37:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156283079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155243111', 'Simona Tolan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Added secondary email as well.  Put in request to Kelly to send out welcome packet. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-08 10:34:42', '2025-01-08 11:19:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156301089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462222', 'Ann Apfelbeck', NULL, '1/8/25: Ann called unable to get into member portal and looking for help finding a chiropractor. I emailed her her portal credentials. We discussed the new ARM vendor since she seemed unaware. I advised her to fill out an appointment request for us to perform a search for a chiropractor in her area. If nothing comes up in her area, she said she prefers the west side of Denver or sill drive to Evergreen, Avon or even Vail if need be. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-08 10:18:19', '2025-01-08 10:18:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156311003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132899338', 'Larry Parsley', NULL, '01.08.2025 Has not received the physical card from ARM card. RESENT the one in the email and copied Retha on it.
Shareable with Limitations on the sharing request - CPE - Items still not paid - saying that the bills are not being fully shared.
We did a 3-way call with Zion, Ulysees answered, after verifying the PHI form, he shared that she needs to fulfill IUA - receipts were uploaded YESTERDAY, but Retha said she uploaded them in December. Ulysees says claims he sees items uploaded YESTERDAY, but Retha shares she uploaded all that she has back in December. 
Ulysees recommended we speak with the Processor, and transferred us. We were in luck, b/c we got to speak to him (I did not catch his name). He looked over the sharing request. 
$773 - 1st Document was a shot and they paid for it 
$1253 - 2nd Document was another shot that they paid for
