  ('zcrm_1579374000156174072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153961021', 'Patricia Lenz', NULL, '1-7-24 Patti can''t cancel or pause her membership since Patty L didn''t request to do so until 1-4-25. She can only make changes to Premium Care moving forward. However, HAB had this response to her request to pause or cancel until further notice, "Hi Patty,

I received good news for the Health Access membership. Here''s the response to your request.

"I am going to make an exception and cancel it retro back to effective date of 1/1/25 as if it never took place and issue a refund as well.

I am doing this because if I cancel it for 2/1/25 and she ends [up] reinstating in the future, then the penalty fee will apply upon restarting the membership, which will equal to the monthly fee times the number of months they had placed it on pause. 

Thank you, 
Ursula"

So, this part has been cancelled successfully. If you want to add this back, you''ll need to re-apply by the 20th of the month for the next month''s start date.

I hope that helps!

Best wishes,
Ursula"

So, this is done until further notice from Patty. She wants her women''s health issues to be included immediately with no pre-x which isn''t possibly with MCS. It''s not included in wellness since it''s treating something, not just screening for something.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-07 14:24:26', '2025-01-07 14:24:26'),
