  ('zcrm_1579374000156140177', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097899002', 'Amy Jones', NULL, 'Member called in upset about the price increase.  I advised that Members were notified via email and the dates they were sent out.   She asked if we were working with any other Health Shares and I told her that we worked with Sedera and to contact Jane to talk about her options', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-01-07 14:12:03', '2025-01-07 14:12:03'),
