  ('zcrm_1579374000156159235', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476142', 'Michael Dee', NULL, '01.07.2025 I heard back from Lori with the following information to share with Randy:
".. I can see other providers listed as contracted at the address of Dr. Randy Pinto.
The member should keep his appt and we will see how the provider bills (with physician NPI or a practice NPI)."
I will text Michael to inform him to keep his appointment, and allow ARM to view the claim, but MAKE sure it is coded preventive and billed directly to the address on the card to ARM. 
