  ('zcrm_1579374000156159167', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109598001', 'Nathan Bertsch', NULL, '01.07.2025 Nathan called to change his payment information due to his present information, experiencing a fraud incident. I led him to our forms, and confirmed the receipt of his submission for updating form of payment with MPB. 
