  ('zcrm_1579374000156159113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142862002', 'Victoria Shavlik', NULL, '01.06.2025 Queen Valley Hospital  called to learn how Victoria''s PT will be paid. I could not speak in detail, but  did share there is a process that Victoria needs to call us to learn about, there''s a max of how much would be paid out by Zion. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-06 16:21:01', '2025-01-06 16:21:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156174023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156186015', 'Noah Burleson', NULL, '1-6-25 Noah asked many more great questions. His wife had pregnancy related high blood pressured connected to post-partum pre-eclempsia. I let him know that part will likely be considered pre-x. They know not to get pregnant before their Feb. 1st effective date. They know the price is the same for 1 or more kids. They know they can change their IUA upon annual renewal 1x per year. His wife doesn''t have health ins at the moment. She was on her parent''s insurance and they decided it no longer made sense to include her. So, she''s without anything for Jan. They asked about R & R Dental Care in San Luis Obispo, 93405 which is showing in to be in the Dental Accces / Aetna network for 1Dental. Dr. Rene Bravo and Allison Borgsmiller are their Pediatricians. I couldn''t find them in the network but told him to call them to check. They don''t show what insurance they allow on their website either. He will do that. He enrolled in Secure HSA $2500/$638 EF and HAB $107 EO for his wife only to allow her to continue on with her psychiatrist. He''s also possibly interested in 1Dental at some point down the road but not today. He completed MPB and HAB applications and he used Bank Acct for HAB and submitted change for to Update Payment to ACH for MPB. He didn''t see the 3% per month charge when he completed the application. I cc''ed Patti giving her a forewarning. There should be plenty of time to process the change before billing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-06 16:16:11', '2025-01-06 16:55:38'),
