  ('zcrm_1579374000156159044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151449002', 'Betsy Todd', NULL, '01.06.2025 Betsy messaged back via text on GoTo requesting to proceed on helping her access her MPB Portal. I sent her the URL, a few steps to follow to get to the log in page, her username and passcode. I was able to access her portal with us, successfully. Waited to hear back from her to learn the same. 
She responded that she already has her portal set up WITH US, and needs to get set up with Zion''s portal. I guided her on that, to call them directly and what to ask for. I have her their number and extension OR to call us and we will do a 3 way. Betsy decided to call them directly, on her own. 
Betsy asked how would she pay for the MRI the doctor requested. I guided her to upload that bill to the sharing request that she will open with Zion today, and while she has them on the phone, to ask them how long it would take to share that bill. The other suggestion I gave her was to try to pay as close as possible to her IUA, on that MRI bill, so her IUA is fulfilled. I opened a CRM task. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-06 12:58:27', '2025-01-06 13:08:17'),
