  ('zcrm_1579374000156097183', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362044', 'Therese Antonino', NULL, '1/6/25: Mark called asking about the fact that they no longer have planstin anymore. They ended up calling planstin and was told they are no longer members and haven''t heard anything about any changes. I explained that the MEC vendor is changing and why. Put out a message on teams asking for help figuring out why they aren''t getting emails or how to check on that. Called ARM to ask about their card since it''s not in files. Dave had a record of member and is emailing the cards. Checked mailchimp to verify they are getting emails and noticed they were manually added 12/18/24 - Kelly stated they received and opened notifications about vendor change. Will let Mark know via email when I send ARM card and with a phone call. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-06 12:41:20', '2025-01-06 14:36:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156183003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131234002', 'Lauralyn Johnson', NULL, '01.06.25 - Lauralyn called getting ready for delivery of her daughter. Confirmed that she needs to submit the membership change form, with child''s SSN within 30 days of delivery. Some of the child medical bills will be part of the delivery, some will not be depending on the maternity guidelines. Lauralyn will have to use her ARM card for childhood immunizations. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-01-06 12:38:42', '2025-01-06 12:38:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156174008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, '1-6-25 Kristen called bc her PCP preventive wellness visit to Aspen Valley Medical wasn''t covered by Planstin and she received a $578 bill. She still had the Planstin MEC at the time of the visit 10/31/24. She knew to make sure they coded it as wellness but is calling them to make sure they followed through on that. I also told her to call the MPB Concierge Team for help in any tricks to get this to go through and paid for by Planstin, not billed to her. She will do that and was super appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-06 12:36:01', '2025-01-06 12:36:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156097178', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993452', 'Holly Wiese', NULL, '1/6/25: Recently opened sharing request for hand issues. Referred to see specialist who recommended otc braces and creams for hand and Greg is wondering if this can be included in his sharing request. I replied that usually over the counter items are not, but since he has a written recommendation - I suggested asking zion directly and transferred over. Will follow up tomorrow. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-06 12:35:17', '2025-01-06 12:35:17'),
