  ('zcrm_1579374000156174003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096033002', 'Carl Loven', NULL, '1-6-24 Mary was surprised by the price change bc it was going to carl''s email not hers. He didn''t see them or warn her but she saw the new amount on her statement. Mary is turning 65 in May and I will connect her with Andrea. She will change her email address to the primary email. We shouldn''t move them to the Premium memberships bc they each had a health event this year. She had a terrible reaction to fire ants and went to the ER and they treated her with an epi pen and she now carries one with her. Carl had hip pain and went through PRP therapy which seems to be working incredibly well!  These 2 needs went super smoothly with Zion. She said the customer service was excellent!  Their price went from $650 to $733. I gave her the $2500 IUA amounts and she will keep the $1000. However, they don''t use wellness except Carl may need to do his colonoscopy sometime soon. If she can get him to do it by May, we can drop the MEC when she has to move to Medicare in May 2025. Then he can have CARE+ since she says they don''t do the other wellness stuff or fund their HSA. She has an HSA account but hasn''t funded it for the past 2 years. I let her know she can still fund it for 2024, I believe. She can ask a tax professional. She also wants the ACA wellness benefits link which I will send.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-06 12:28:39', '2025-01-06 12:28:39'),
