  ('zcrm_1579374000156097155', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079573002', 'Jason Mihalick', NULL, '1/6/25: Jason called. He went in for his annual wellness checkup and the dr is wanting him to wear a heart monitor and see a cardiologist. The cardiologist providing the heart monitor said they do not work with Health Shares. I advised him to tell them that he is self pay - or he can present his MEC since it is attached to his wellness check up, let them run it through there and apply PPO discount, then pay the balance. He said he would try that and give us a call back if it didn''t work. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-06 11:48:53', '2025-01-06 11:48:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156159018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107844002', 'CHANDRASEKAR RAGHUNANDANAN', NULL, '01.06.2025 Downloaded the app, trying to log in, but it is saying that it cannot find him. I helped him by changing his username to his email, to match the sign in to his MPB portal. I also reset his passcode. He reset it on his end as well, successfully. 
