Was on hold for 5 minutes, till I pressed 2 to leave a courtesy call back. I left them a message, with my name, the company I''m calling from, our number and extension, and the reason why I''m calling. 
2nd entity: One Community Health: Hood River location. 5 minutes. She put him on a waiting list till end of March. I will notify him via GoTo and continue calling.
3rd entity: Is also One Community Health. He already is on the wait list for them

I went ahead and generated another list for him via internal medicine. 
Med Columbia Med Center: 541-506-6920 - has an appt with a urologist at the end of March. 
Sierra will mail  new patient paperwork to his physical address.
Earliest for an appointment - Morning 9am check-in at 8:45am on the 24th.
I texted Jon via GoTo with the above details, and requested confirmation and made sure he follows through with his paperwork. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-06 11:15:04', '2025-01-06 14:57:25'),
