  ('zcrm_1579374000156016043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151980002', 'Ryan Awerkamp', NULL, '01.03.2024 Ryan called initially to connect with the welcome call. He will reschedule. He also asked about his membership and how to use it. I did explain that his membership does have 3 major parts: Several services in the ESSENTIALS part (one being the telehealth), his preventive with ARM, and health sharing with Zion. We went into semi details on how to maneuver CirrusMD and preventive care. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-03 12:16:05', '2025-01-03 15:43:55'),
