  ('zcrm_1579374000156018033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139351002', 'Debra Rankin', NULL, '01.03.24 - Debra called inquiring about MRI''s. Explained IUA, suggested she fills out the custom quote request. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-01-03 11:07:50', '2025-01-03 11:07:50'),
