  ('zcrm_1579374000156011084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151980002', 'Ryan Awerkamp', NULL, 'No response. Not able to leave message. Mailbox not set up yet. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-03 11:04:13', '2025-01-03 11:04:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155996053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102741010', 'James Schrock', NULL, 'Member submitted following changes  (12/27) after the change deadline for 1/25. 1) remove spouse 2) remove children 3) Update address 4) Add Spouse.  Then on 12/30 Submitted cancellation eff 2/25.  I will just process the cancellation.  No changes will be processed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-01-03 11:00:47', '2025-01-03 11:00:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156011071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153977001', 'Maria Koger', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to send out welcome packet. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-03 10:57:03', '2025-01-03 10:57:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156016018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939464', 'Krista Irmischer', NULL, '01.03.2025 Krista called in to 3way call with Zion, but first she needed to be in the clear as to what bills does she need to put in the sharing request. SO we called Planstin first, spoke with Kaitlyn, who went down the line of all the bills that made it through to Planstin, which ones did not get covered to send over to Zion. She sent her all of the EOB''s MINUS the one that came through on 12/4/2024. It has not been processed yet.
I kept asking Krista why do they keep sending Planstin the claims, and she repeats that she''s had several conversations with them to STOP doing that, but they continue to.
We then had a 3way with Zion, spoke with Isabella, to give me permission to help Krista on her behalf with the bills and sharing request. Isabella sent her the form and guided her to put my 1st and last name and check the appropriate boxes. It was a little hard to hear Isabella as the connection was crackling. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-03 10:42:18', '2025-01-03 11:11:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155996048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058265053', 'Mary Jo Wood', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update I will process.  Other methods deleted.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-01-03 10:41:16', '2025-01-03 10:41:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156016008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107048002', 'Peter Coddington', NULL, '01.03.2024 Tried calling Peter again at this number: (603) 550-3200 - same one I used yesterday that had  a VM attached to it. The number would not offer a dial tone, no ring tone at all....just silence. I will email Peter TODAY. I stayed on for 1 minute and 25 seconds, before I hung up. Emailing via CRM. 
*****************************************************************************
Peter was able to text me back on GoTo saying that my calls DID come through, but I could not hear him, or any sound for that matter. He asked if he could call in at THAT moment, but I was on with another members that lasted another 35 minutes, with note documentation.
I messaged him back to let him know that I am ready for his call,
*****************************************************************************
two quick questions:
1- has all the records for the incident 3/2024, fainting spell at the car dealership. $3500~ has been spent. Last time got serviced was 4/29/2024
2- Pretty significant eye operation
3- Digestive health issues
4- Do any of our clients have other insurances
5- How to get preventive care through our membership?

Transferred to Zion to open a portal. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-03 10:15:15', '2025-01-03 11:57:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156018023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148499402', 'Matthew Fisher', NULL, '01.03.24 - Matthew called asking to process a cancelation. Sending the link. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-01-03 10:12:31', '2025-01-03 10:12:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156011061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152571038', 'Ian Fallenius', NULL, 'Spoke to member he needed to reschedule welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-03 10:03:24', '2025-01-03 10:03:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156029033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155863302', 'Kymberli Collins', NULL, '1-3-25 Left vm for Bill and Kymberli on Bill''s phone to update him on the status of the 1-1-25 start date. It was denied by C4HCO bc there were no technical errors and no attempt to enroll before the deadline. There are no exceptions. I''m looking for an indemnity plan that starts immediately. GAC starts on 1st of next month. Haven''t found one yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-03 10:00:46', '2025-01-03 10:00:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156011038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154387002', 'Jeanne Kinkade-Moses', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Not a very pleasant person. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-03 09:48:33', '2025-01-03 09:58:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156018018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109186002', 'Zachary Larson', NULL, '01.03.24 - Zachary called to get his member ID and find out the process for coloscopy plus procedure. Let him know his IUA and if the bills move past the IUA, we will assist with opening a sharing request. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-01-03 09:47:02', '2025-01-03 09:47:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156029028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650228', 'Tom Schramer', NULL, '1-2-25 Leslie and Tom are very interested in HAB and dropping Redirect. They''ve had struggles with Redirect''s debit card not working and taking forever to get reimbursed. It''s been a challenge. They like the idea of HAB. They are paying $1382.28 EF / $500. If they drop Redirect it will be $1058.65 + $250 = $1308.65. They can also increase their IUA to $1000 and save about $300 per month. At $1000 IUA, it''s $781.65 + $250 = $1031.65. They will think it over and will let me know by Jan. 17th at the latest for a Feb. 1st effective date. Leslie wants to get a colonoscopy sometime soon. She knows of the 6 month wait. I also let her know she can get it through Sedera but she will want to make 100% certain that''s true since the guidelines continue to evolve. She agreed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-03 09:29:27', '2025-01-03 09:29:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156031043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128921001', 'Jenna Sezionale Basilicato', NULL, '1/3
log in credentials AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-03 09:21:48', '2025-01-03 09:21:48');
