  ('zcrm_1579374000156031003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121219002', 'David Alvarez', NULL, '1/3
David called seeking clarification regarding his bills from a recent wellness check for his children. He specifically mentioned bloodwork and an echocardiogram, expressing frustration that Planstin did not cover these services and that the repricing was incorrect. He argued that the echocardiogram should be considered preventative care, especially since his son was born with a bicuspid heart condition. I explained that, unfortunately, Planstin adheres strictly to the ACA guidelines and will only cover services that are explicitly included. At that point, our conversation became repetitive without resolving his concerns.AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-03 08:26:46', '2025-01-03 08:26:46'),
