  ('zcrm_1579374000156018008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155312083', 'Alexander Mishchuk', NULL, '01.03.24 - Alex called concerned that he did not receive any enrollment information. Informed Kelly, Ace, and Vanessa to reach out to him and correct the plan to Premium HSA. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-01-03 07:46:44', '2025-01-03 07:46:44'),
