  ('zcrm_1579374000156018003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135605001', 'Olena Gorodisskiy', NULL, '01.03.24 Olena called with a concern about the mole on her back causing pain. Local derm was not able to give an estimate on price. Suggested telehealth as the first step, followed by a pcp. She stated she goes to her OBGYN for her physicals. I could not provide accurate info if her current DR would be able to assist and suggested she calls the practice, same info provided for annual physical - as long as her Dr codes it as preventive. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-01-03 07:43:02', '2025-01-03 07:43:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155996013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155423018', 'molly douglas', NULL, 'Member had not been billed for 1/25 since she enrolled after hours on 12/20.  Adam to contact member to ok billing.  Adam spoke to member and ok to bill', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-01-03 07:33:34', '2025-01-03 12:45:01'),
