  ('zcrm_1579374000155916026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155863360', 'Paula Jessen', NULL, '11-25-24  
Hi Wendy,

I got your name from Andrea Hinman, who helped me with an individual health insurance plan in Colorado back in 2021. We are currently living in Chicago, and planning to move back to Colorado some time this winter. My husband is starting a new job with the Colorado state public defenders office and they have yet to give us an official start date, so I’m not sure when we’ll be moving/switching to Colorado insurance. I just wanted to connect with you ahead of time to see if this is something you’ll be able to help me with. We are currently using BCBS of IL individual insurance and will need a family plan for myself, my husband, and our 5 month old baby.

Please let me know if you think you’ll be able to help me, and how much lead time I should plan on for setting up the CO health insurance.

Thank you so much!
Paula


1-2-25 

