Happy new year! 

We just found out that we’ll be getting to Colorado February 2, and my husband’s employer based health insurance will begin on February 1. So it turns out we won’t need to purchase it after all. But if we ever do, I will definitely be reaching out to you! So thank you again!

Best,
Paula', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-02 20:13:30', '2025-01-02 20:14:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155916021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155863302', 'Kymberli Collins', NULL, '1-2-24 Bill called and was rip roaring mad bc his wife''s plan was never chosen and he''s blaming me for not returning their call. He says he left the long detailed vm with the plan name in it that they wanted. I said I don''t have any calls that I haven''t returned and that set him on fire. He had already spent an hour on the phone with C4 to select a plan for his wife which will go into effect 2-1-25. He said he never makes mistakes. He dots his i''s and crosses his t''s. He said he ran a company and Never makes mistakes. I just reiterated that I''m happy to help him and he calmed down. C4 told them to have an Agent submit a request for 1-1-25 start date. He finally shared that Kymberli has a Dr. appt on 1-13-24 and has ongoing medications that will help to push this request through faster. I found they selected me as their agent on 11-7-24. I can''t find any missed calls from them. I don''t have any vm''s from them with the requested plan, like he claims. I have one old VM from the first call he made to me which I returned. So, I''m baffled about what happened.  I don''t have any emails from them either. He might have called a wrong #. He also blamed me for not just calling them, even if I didn''t hear from him.  Either way, I submitted the request for a 1-1-25 start date. I had to call him back and get the Case ID # which was 172581 X6D6W7.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-02 18:29:46', '2025-01-02 18:29:46'),
