  ('zcrm_1579374000155824981', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921312', 'Martin Dempsey', NULL, '12-31-24 Jennifer sent me an email at 1:45 MST today asking to cancel for Chip and the kids bc they have other ins. I sent her the cancellation form and let her know it will take effect Feb. 1st, 2025.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-31 15:14:26', '2024-12-31 15:14:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155905058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '12.31.2024 Michael emailed me the spreadsheet he shared with Zion to show how everything broken down and where Zion is placing each cost of Kyle''s medical issues.
