REGARDING the Labs - Wendy DID tell them to contact us PRIOR to getting the labs done to talk to the concierge. They did not do that. I will explain a possible solution to implement, once the sharing request ordeal has been divided and organized.
They were able to get to go see this doctor, otherwise it would have been months to wait to get their son taken care of. He moved quickly with the lab requests and such.
Side notes: This could possibly be vaccine injury and the medical system might be making it harder than it needs to be.
