  ('zcrm_1579374000155824023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130212001', 'Ryan Olson', NULL, '12.27.2024 Ryan called inquiring, as a new member to the List Bill, how to access a sort of dashboard for his employees to view any details. It seems as though Ryan is just setting up all that he needs to be aware of, with this new element for his business.
