- Can he access all the details about the List Bill from Admin? Yes, he can see employee''s enrollments (Accounting)
- He can not manage the employees on the dash board, he would need to email the accounting department. Needs to email accounting if changes are required. (Accounting)
- For payment method - it''ll need to be updated through cognito. Yes (Accounting). 

I called Ryan at the stated number and left him a detailed message, per his request. He was expecting me to share a username and passcode, BUT INSTEAD what he needs is the above information. I will send a text as well - to the number on the profile. Ryan confirmed receipt of the information via text. 
