  ('zcrm_1579374000155824008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152191002', 'John Gulstrom', NULL, '12.27.2024 Deborah called to learn how to present at her daughter''s doctor visit to be tested for Strep Throat. I checked in with Julia on Teams chat, and she confirmed there isn''t any benefit towards urgent care, and they usually apply the PPO discounts for cash pay visits. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-27 10:50:39', '2024-12-27 10:50:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155824003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131650010', 'Neil Goldsmith', NULL, '12.27.2024 Neil called asking if he''s used up his annual physical for the year. I told him, after looking him up, that his MEC company would be able to let him know if a claim for such service made it to them. 
I did mention that ARM will be his new MEC company starting January 1st, 2025. He had some questions on differences and I answered generally, with ARM having slightly more preventive care than Planstin. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-27 10:38:50', '2024-12-27 10:38:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155770060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120746001', 'Jennifer Zrubek', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to know why she was not cancelled.  I could not find a Cancellation form for her.  I will send her out link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-12-27 10:22:57', '2024-12-27 10:22:57'),
