  ('zcrm_1579374000155770050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848047', 'Aine Carlisle', NULL, 'I spoke to member who had left after hours vm re: cancellation.  She was told by Wendy that she was granfathered in.  By this she took this to mean that her price would never go up.  I explained that she was fortunate that her price hadn''t gone up in 4 yrs and that other members received a price increase every year.   She has obtained other coverage.  s/he submitte cancellation 12/26 after hours and was on the phone following up next morning.  I will process refund &amp; cancel her membership', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-12-27 09:36:04', '2024-12-27 09:36:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155770045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091256', 'Cynthia Shiko', NULL, 'Member was billed in error after being cancelled by me due to Aging into Medicare.  I will refund her the monies that she was billed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-12-27 09:05:52', '2024-12-27 09:05:52'),
