  ('zcrm_1579374000155770009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128765002', 'Gabrielle Chernis', NULL, 'Member charged for MF $1000 IUA Secure should have bee $5000 IUA.  Difference is $265 I will refund member', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-12-27 07:40:41', '2024-12-27 07:40:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155730419', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108735001', 'Jamie Winsand', NULL, '12.26.2024 Jamie called in inquiring about benefits on taking Ozempic for weight loss.
I looked up weight loss in the Zion''s guidelines and they''ve changed AO 01.01.2025
"Weight Reduction
Expenses related to weight reduction are considered pre-membership medical conditions
and are subject to the sharing phase-in period. Expenses are considered eligible for sharing if
prescribed by a licensed medical provider and approved by Zion HealthShare, up to $3,000
per sharing request. "
I looked up how much it costs via RXGO, as well as Wegovy. Ozempic came up almost $1K and Wegovy came up to be less than $350.
Jamie had additional questions about Zion sharing or offering savings, so I suggested we do a 3way call with them. Jamie said he''ll call them to learn more of what could be shared. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-26 16:55:11', '2024-12-26 17:15:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155730119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070976050', 'Colleen Glenn-Wilson', NULL, '12.26.2024 Colleen was transferred from Planstin, wanting to proceed with cancellation due to her aging out.
