  ('zcrm_1579374000155730114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848047', 'Aine Carlisle', NULL, '12.26.2024 Responded to Aine''s message requesting if her cancellation request was received. I confirmed that indeed it was and sent her the template to review us via CRM. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-26 15:17:58', '2024-12-26 15:17:58'),
