  ('zcrm_1579374000155740003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848047', 'Aine Carlisle', NULL, '12.26.24 Aine called concerned about the price increase, as she was grandfathered in. She explained to me the legal definition of what it means and was concerned the ethical practices of MPB. Since she opted out from receiving email notifications from MPB, she was never notified of the increases (Per Kelly F.) Aine hung up on me, sent her information to Wendy to ensure she is in the best plan for her financial needs. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-12-26 14:35:02', '2024-12-26 14:35:23');
