  ('zcrm_1579374000155732003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123142002', 'Admira Adovic', NULL, '12.26.24 - Admira called inquiring about PT sharing for her two sons. She was unable to receive assistance last year due to it being the first year of her membership. I explained the pre-x clause and how it could have affected the decision. She disagreed, stating there were no symptoms prior to diagnosis. Would like to start sessions this year for both of her children. 

Inquired about ARM and keeping her OBGYN provider. Last year the provider was not in network with Planstin PHCS, but with ARM the provider is network. Explained the RBP and advised to fill out the APPT request form for our Concierge to schedule the appt for her since she had a negative experience in the past. 

Also inquired about mental health sessions for couples, will send information on how to log in and schedule. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-12-26 11:43:40', '2024-12-26 11:43:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155730031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105156012', 'Liju Kurian', NULL, '12.26.2024 Liju inquiring about the price increase from $715 to $1018 premium. He did not receive any of the correspondence MPB has send out to al the members, according to him.
