  ('zcrm_1579374000155730008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115751002', 'Rocio Borzage', NULL, '12.26.2024 William called to learn how to get his preventive family visits (children) covered. With all the vaccines done, the bill is over $1300. He wanted to guide the provider on who to send the bill to. I guided HIM to the back of him card and where to send the claims to Alt Risk Mgmnt.
