  ('zcrm_1579374000155478054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124246002', 'Terry Flood', NULL, '"12.23.2024 After briefing with Julia and Acelyn, and learning about the price increase dilemma, and sending off the wrong email of switching health sharing companies, I called Terry to discuss the details and options that he has.
Wanda answered and put Terry on speaker for permission aspects. I went over the price increase and the reason for that. Terry and Wanda were understanding but wanted to learn about their options. They mentioned changing health sharing companies and prices on other memberships. I strongly recommended that they speak with Mike Montes on those topics for more accurate details. However, I did coach them to be sure to keep in mind how longevity affects pre-membership conditions sharing. 
We went over in detail how the IUA works and what tiers are available to choose from.
They are reaching out to Mike Montes to learn more about their options, and how they can decrease their premium.  NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-23 12:48:33', '2024-12-23 13:31:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155478049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939464', 'Krista Irmischer', 'Krista is VERY GREEN and REQUIRES DETAILED Guidance', '12.23.2024 Called Krista to follow up on the status of her experience with Zion.
