We did a 3-way call with Zion, and spoke with Daisa. She said her sharing request needs to go over to the extended care sharing request department, because it is under Breast Cancer Sharing Request. Daisa wanted to transfer us to Krista''s processor, to further discuss the details of the sharing request status, but Ces was gone for the day. Krista wanted to have a real conversation WITH ME, so the solution (b/c Zion is not allowed to call out on certain services/situations) was for Krista to leave the processor a VM to call her back (since she could never catch her live and is always leaving a VM), and when she does, Krista will then conference me in.

I will wait for this conference on Thursday, after Christmas. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-23 12:47:54', '2024-12-23 17:45:34'),
