  ('zcrm_1579374000155459051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026122744', 'Kimberly Payes', NULL, '12-23-24 Kimberly Payes and I planned to talk on Friday to make a change to her membership. She got in a car accident and was tied up for the rest of the day/night filling working with the police. She''s thankfully totally fine. Her plan was to change to Premium Care. She completed the change form now and she also completed an address change form. She was planning to cancel and go directly to Zion otherwise. So, I was able to save the client. She just can''t afford the new price at $419. Instead it will be $285. Thanks!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-23 11:47:51', '2024-12-23 11:47:51'),
