Terry called because he had received a confusing email from his advisor about changing his plan before a price increase. The email mentioned a deadline of 3 pm that day for making changes, which left Terry concerned. Initially, Terry had spoken with the sales department because the concierge department was in a meeting, and unfortunately, the concierge team was not informed of this issue in time. 

