  ('zcrm_1579374000155385105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144228001', 'Cynthia Franceus', NULL, '12-20-24 Cynthia was shocked by her plan going from $50+ to $213 since she just  joined in Oct. Once I explained how it works, she decided to leave well enough alone. Her income will be about the same in 2025. Next she wants a dental plan for some major dental work. She''s been chewing on one side of her mouth for many months now and really wants to take care of it. She wants Dr. Bruce Wetmore in Broomfield. His site doesn''t show any insurance that they accept. She says she used to have Aetna but 1Dental''s network with Aetna doesn''t show him in network. I told her to call them to find out who they accept for individuals, not groups. She will let me know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-20 21:09:50', '2024-12-20 21:09:50'),
