  ('zcrm_1579374000155385092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001196081', 'Kate Hamilton', NULL, '12-20-24 Kate is still in CA. She just had abdominal surgery for endometriosis and she was in a car accident this past year. So, she has definite pre-x that she''s dealing with She still needs a lot of PT and other stuff. She''s not a good candidate for MCS or AC since she was hospitalized within the past year. She''s paying $775 and gets a small APTC through Covered CA. I called Robin to see if there''s anything better and she said no, definitely not to her knowledge.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-20 17:43:21', '2024-12-20 17:43:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155355514', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100491002', 'Michelle Faciana', NULL, '12.20.2024 I called Zion today to learn if they would share in on Celiac issues. The rep said that it would be considered a pre-membership condition, and the tiers would apply.
