  ('zcrm_1579374000155355469', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078309046', 'Jack Weber', NULL, '12.20.24:  Called - l/m to c/b. Explained the 2025 price change situation for Jack &amp; his family. The only plan that would be less than his current or future payment for Secure is Care+ w/an IUA of 2500 = $550/mo. or an IUA of $5000 = $480/mo.  I told him he can make a change for 2/1/25 since he missed the 12/20 deadline. Asked him to call me w/any questions.  JSP', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-20 13:51:13', '2024-12-20 13:51:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155380093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098254002', 'Angela McGuire', NULL, '12/20
