  ('zcrm_1579374000155355425', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103628010', 'Hunter Stirm', NULL, '12.20.2024  Hunter called sharing that his son is struggling with Tonsils and adenoids, and they are planning on getting them removed, according to the ENT''s recommendation. Wants to know if the procedure will be shared.
Called Zion since I could not find anything in their guidelines. Zion rep was informative. She saw there was an already sharing request on this exact situation, she suggested he reopen it. He did.
While on the phone, he was able to refresh and reopen that need.
The date available for him to choose as to when the procedure would be, was only giving him TODAY. The Zion representative, said she will put that glitch in the notes so they know it did not allow him to choose a date. HOWEVER, the physician has not set a date yet anyways. Zion Rep did say they can put the ENT specialist''s name, from the telehealth session, as the initial visit. 
According to the Zion Rep, she did see the submission of the request live as we were on the phone. She did share a brief timeline of what to expect once they start reviewing the need. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-20 13:32:27', '2024-12-20 13:53:06'),
