  ('zcrm_1579374000155352083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105959012', 'Dino Clathis', NULL, 'On 12/18/24 this member submitted a Change Form to add dependent eff 1/1/25.  This dependent would have turned 26 in 4/25.  The difference between the MS rates & the MF rates would be $288 ($733 vs $1018).  I reached out to the advisor and suggested since the dependent would age out of the member in 4 mos, why didn''t he enroll him in the Care + membership that he could get for $185- ($2500 IUA) or $160 ($160 IUA).  Advisor told me to leave it the way it was that he didn''t have time to address this.  The next day this member ended up cancelling his membership due to price.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-12-20 10:24:24', '2024-12-20 10:24:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155355208', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046217082', 'Aaron Martin', NULL, '12.20.2024 Closed Aaron''s CRM task. After speaking with Leo, he completely understood the situation and wants to keep the MEC regardless of the price increase. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-20 10:15:32', '2024-12-20 10:15:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155382078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083771001', 'Robert Godfrey', NULL, '12/20/24: Robert called because his wife is pregnant and this is their first sharing request. I educated the member on how to open their Zion portal and requesting a global package from his wife''s OBGYN, their IUA and what would be included within the maternity request. Transferred to Zion to open portal and get the process started. Set FU for 1/3/25. Txt review link. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-20 10:14:29', '2024-12-20 10:16:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155355203', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, '12.20.24:  Called Denise. Discussed her options. She thinks she will stay with her current plan as is but will read my email to think about the options and will let me know her decision.  JSP
