  ('zcrm_1579374000155380013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939464', 'Krista Irmischer', NULL, '12/05 krista responded to Nahlas email with the following:

Hello Nahla and Ces, 

Thanks for your help on this, Nahla. I''m including Ces in this email, because she is the one overseeing the payment of all the charges. 

Per our conversation last Monday, several bills have wrongfully been sent to Planstin despite me very clearly explaining I''m a self-pay patient with no insurance. Planstin keeps re-populating in their computer system despite several conversations I''ve had with the billing departments to correct this. 

Per your request, I''m forwarding all the bills I''ve submitted to Zion. I''ve called on all of them to be rebilled at the self-pay rate, and have since learned many of them are also in the Planstin system. I appreciate all of your help to get it sorted, and let me know what you need from me.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-20 08:42:20', '2024-12-20 08:42:20'),
