  ('zcrm_1579374000155266224', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131540068', 'Shoshana Kressler', NULL, '12-19-24 Shoshana is 44 and Sam is 44. They had a fine experience with Cigna. It was good for getting their vaccines, well checks, etc. They were paying $800 in 2024 but are looking at facing $1400 in 2025 now that their income has increased. Shoshana is facing peri-menopause and hoping to get support on that front. She might want to get some labs done. So, she will press to do that now while on Cigna since it will be deemed pre-x with MCS. She also is taking an SSRI for mental health. Sam has gout that he treats with diet and exercise. Between CirrusMD, Life Care and HAB she will have tons of support for her mental health, mild anxiety and possible support for women''s health. After a long conversation with many questions answered they are ready to enroll tomorrow in Premium Care + HAB. I''m forget which IUA level they want.  It will be for EF, Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-19 20:13:36', '2024-12-19 20:13:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155303077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '12-19-24 I was able to change their account and show Kyle as an independent filing his own taxes, making no money since he''s at CU part-time and tending to his vax injury. He should qualify for Medicaid. They are also getting help from Zion now to break out the Need into clear different Needs for sharing. They are much more calm. Zion''s email was sent to Kyle not Michael, so it got lost.  They will join HAB tomorrow morning with me on the phone.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-19 17:48:48', '2024-12-19 17:48:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155294040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139165008', 'Kelvin Yip', NULL, '12.19.2024 After reciprocating with the Yip family (Kelvin, Kesinee and Katie) via outlook concierge email, on proceeding schedule their appointments (gathering their proper names, separate phone numbers and availabilities), I called Carbon Health in san fran. CA: 
