Kelvin confirmed right away the first two days they were available next week: Monday and Tuesday ALL DAY. I needed confirmation to proceed with them, so I message Katie and Kesinee via GoTo. Kesinee responded - later. I lost most of the slots by the time I heard back from Kesinee. However TWO were still available those days: 10am Monday (Kesinee confirmed she will take that one), and 11:45 Tuesday (Due to Kelvin''s open availability, I booked that one for him). I am still waiting on Katie to respond so I can proceed. 
I did confirm via GoTo messaging and concierge email, the two slots mentioned and scheduled. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-19 17:45:25', '2024-12-19 17:45:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155303072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130802017', 'Bruce Maleski', NULL, '12-19-24  She will review Premium Care + HAB $463+$200 = $663 or Premium HSA $2500/$587 or keep Secure HSA $633/$2500. She will decide and let me know before the deadline tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-19 17:44:38', '2024-12-19 17:44:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155303067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130802017', 'Bruce Maleski', NULL, '12-19-24 Their price is now $550 and should increase to $633/$2500 IUA. Just left them a vm to give her the new pricing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-19 17:16:28', '2024-12-19 17:16:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155303062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155322082', 'Valerie Reynolds', NULL, '12-19-24 She received a Cobra letter and got nervous that she wasn''t allowed the APTC since she''s offered Cobra. I reassured her that she is eligible for C4 since no job and doesn''t have to accept Cobra at full cost. She''s happy and all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-19 16:38:36', '2024-12-19 16:38:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155303049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155265018', 'Brian Loften', NULL, '12-17-24 Brian is an ASHI member, 52 and lives in AL. Currently has BC/BS with an employer group but he''s switching away from it. He''s healthy, no meds, no tobacco, no pre-x. Paying about $550 per month which includes dental and vision. His ded is $600 and doesn''t know mop. But, that won''t be available for him moving forward. He''s also interested in HAB for wellness, skin checks, dental, vision, labs, colonoscopy. Not for mental health, nutrition, has gym in complex and no vax. Wants Premium Care $1000/$285 and $107 HAB = $392.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-19 15:39:33', '2024-12-19 15:43:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155294023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141229002', 'Jessica Giles', NULL, '12.19.2024 Jessica called trying to figure out how to pull up the pharmacy sites on the MPB App, to clip some coupons. I am not sure how to address the app technical part, so I reached out to Julia via teams chat on that. 
Then I offered to do the search for  Jessica, and offered her the sites that we use, b/c she was asking if the app is the only way to do this task. I explained it is not, we would be happy to do the search and clip the coupons, if she wishes. She was happy to be equipped with the resources, so I guided her to a few of the savings sites for scripts. She will call us if she has anymore questions. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-19 15:38:27', '2024-12-19 15:38:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155303044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056904243', 'Samantha Camerino', NULL, '12-19-24 I spoke with Dan and they got a C4 plan. He didn''t know I could help them on that as well. He would have worked with me if he had known. They used another agent. So, I just let him know I''m here if anything changes down the road. He was very appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-19 15:22:49', '2024-12-19 15:22:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155303036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990073', 'Danna Hinz', NULL, '12-19-24 Will forgo HAB for this year. She''s all set with IUA and vision as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-19 15:15:35', '2024-12-19 15:17:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155303031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155284054', 'Amos Shuman', NULL, '12-19-24 Amos enrolled today for 1/1/25. We had him the primary bc Jennifer might get a new job sometime this year. In case they give her benefits, we can remove her without disrupting Amos and Wyatt. He''s already cancelled Medishare. They didn''t like having a $6K AUA before benefits kicked in and same with ACA plans. They are happy and ready to roll. He put each membership on a different cc to gain points since he travels a lot for work and can benefit from that. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-19 15:13:20', '2024-12-19 15:13:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155303021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155284054', 'Amos Shuman', NULL, '12-18-24 Amos was referred by Kara Weld. Jennifer is 49 and Amos is 42, Wyatt is 7. Jennifer is turning 50 in Oct. 2025. So, we decided it was best to put them on Premium Care and HAB. Lived in Ashville, NC for 25 years and managed to avoid the hurricane better than most. Jennifer has a tweaked back and peri-menopause as pre-x.  They''ve been using Medishare $600+ but not loving it. They have a high AUA of $6K.  Chose $2500/$680 and HAB for $250 for Jan. 1st start date. Amos is asthmatic which is minor and just has an inhaler for maintenance when needed. They will use wellness, gym, dental, mental health, skin check, pap, mammo, labs, vax. Nobody uses tobacco. I need to send overview and video.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-19 15:08:05', '2024-12-19 15:08:05'),
