  ('zcrm_1579374000155266179', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, '12.19.24:  Called Mary Ann. She didn''t read my email. Discussed her options, re-sent her my email. She decided to keep her current plan and IUA since she''ll be aging out next October.  She said Jaime would continue on the plan after she ages out.  We can re-visit the plan and IUA according to his needs at that point. She doesn''t need to take any action as she will be automatically transitioned to the DIRECT plan at a $2500 IUA.  JSP', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-19 13:40:28', '2024-12-19 13:40:28'),
