  ('zcrm_1579374000155294013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038076', 'Willow Aureala', NULL, '12.19.2024 Willow requested an RX coupon for compounded scripts. I sent her the following in the concierge email:
"I hope you are having a wonderful day.
Thank you for reaching out to us to find you savings for the following compound medications:
 - Triest Cream: BIEST 80/20/P4/TEST 4/50 (2mg/ml) - 90 Days
 - T4/T3: T4 (130 mcg) T3 (40 mcg) - 180 Days
Unfortunately, we cannot clip coupons or search for customized compound scripts. It has come to our attention that each medication is completely different, so finding universal savings is not possible. 
 
From what we know today; compounded medications aren''t usually included in what insurance will pay for, because they are made expressly for the individual and are not in the formularies.  I don''t know if any of the compounding pharmacies even offer discounts on these formulations. I could research further on this and see if that''s a possibility, at one point. We can then include this information in our newsletter ?.

If you would still like to further discuss this matter, please do not hesitate to contact us here at the concierge line. We are here M-F, 9-8pm, ET. "                                 NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-19 12:49:56', '2024-12-19 12:49:56'),
