  ('zcrm_1579374000155303003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, '12-19-24 Finally connected with Kath and she was considering moving to a $5K IUA for an $85 savings per month. However, she has a possible new Need coming up for herself that she hasn''t tended to. Fred has an open Need already for surgery on his neck. So, neither of them should move to another membership. Changing their IUA won''t save them money. They would lose $1500 if Kath proceeds with her health issue and creates a new Need. The increase in price is tough on them now but they need to get through these medical issues first.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-19 10:07:41', '2024-12-19 10:07:41'),
