  ('zcrm_1579374000155122073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127019002', 'Donna Baker', NULL, '12-18-24 Thank you Wendy! I really appreciate all the information you gave us. I don''t think my son is going to go with any of the plans you offered. It is still more than he was wanting to spend. I think he found a share program for $120 a month (with a higher deductible).

