  ('zcrm_1579374000155122058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990073', 'Danna Hinz', NULL, '12-18-24 Danna joined this for vision as well:

Call 844-833-8440 or go to https://directvisioninsurance.com

Dear Danna Hinz,

Congratulations on purchasing a Direct Vision plan!

Please take the time to review your order details as well as our terms of service. If you have any questions, call us at 844-833-8440 or e-mail us at info@directbenefits.com.

Do not respond to this confirmation email. Allow 5-7 business days for your application to be processed. Your cards and plan information will be delivered electronically or mailed in 7 to 10 working days to the address you provided in the Primary Enrollment Information section.  

