  ('zcrm_1579374000155122018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154678003', 'Derek Friday', NULL, '12-18-24 Derek joined Premium Care for 1/1/25. He did all of his wellness last year already including his colonoscopy. Everything came out clear, no pre-x, no tobacco and he''s an athlete. He''s self-employed so his income was allowing him to get an subsidy. But, the Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 7200 was going to cost him $303 per month with a $7200 ded and $9200 mop. Premium Care is $1500/$254. He is considering adding wellness in a year from now but he''s all set now.  He''s thrilled not to have the high ded and mop. He''s also managing a tooth extraction but somehow he''s qualifying for low income to have financial help with that. So, he asked me to cancel both the medical Cigna and dental Anthem $9.11. I cancelled both for Jan. 1st, 2025 and sent him the screen shot. He just did those while under pressure for the deadline before he was able to explore these options. He''s happy and appreciative. Premium Care will begin 1/1/25.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-18 13:30:52', '2024-12-18 13:30:52'),
