  ('zcrm_1579374000155121023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120977018', 'Kimberly Alvarado', NULL, '12.18.2024 Kimberly connected with us on SalesIQ, but she needed sensitive information, so I asked her to call in to give it to her.
