  ('zcrm_1579374000155121018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139165008', 'Kelvin Yip', NULL, '12.18.2024 Kelvin called requesting to make an annual appointment for his son Aiden. He provided me with his contact information, so I will send him the network I generated, he will choose his top 5 for me to call and make an appt with. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-18 10:58:31', '2024-12-18 10:58:31'),
