  ('zcrm_1579374000155118023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154754002', 'Kelly Brown', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online welcome call after start date of January 1, 2025. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-18 10:48:34', '2024-12-18 10:48:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155121008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129638010', 'Douglas Merrifield', NULL, '12.18.2024 Douglas called to share Kimberly''s, his wife who has type1 diabetes, experience the last day or so. His daughter, who is a nurse took her to a walk in, cz of Kimberly''s high sugar, they then recommended that she go to the ER.
She is now in the hospital. Keto-acidosis, is the phrase he shared twice over the phone, of what they called what she is going through. 
Wife is also fighting a "bug", but with his daughter there, he believes she is in good care.
I recommended that the call us back, once they are back home and settled, so we can open a sharing request with Zion. I will create a CRM task to follow up, in case they forgot. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-18 10:42:05', '2024-12-18 10:42:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155122003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127019002', 'Donna Baker', NULL, '12-18-24 Left vm with Donna to help her. Just barely missed her call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-18 10:41:06', '2024-12-18 10:41:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155118013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148592002', 'Dawn Yeager', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Nahla spoke to Joseph at Zion confirming there is no waiting period to conceiving, once a membership is started. As long as the conception happened on or after the start of the membership. Left vm to member in regards to this. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-18 10:36:07', '2024-12-18 10:36:07'),
