  ('zcrm_1579374000155117003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129877009', 'Diana Miller', NULL, '12/18/24: Alex called wanting to submit bills they''ve accumulated this year. I explained how their healthshare worked and that it is issue specific, and advised him to submit anything that might end up exceeding his IUA bc there is a 6 month deadline, but it''s only for large medical expenses. We also discussed using MEC for preventive services billing. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-18 10:23:14', '2024-12-18 10:23:14'),
