  ('zcrm_1579374000155077033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111395009', 'Eric Hove', NULL, '12/18/24: Returned Aimee''s call, sent email and LVM. Her VM stated: I''m just trying to get clarity on my membership. I have, I guess, a minimal essential coverage plan along with a health care plan, and I have to go to the urgent care, and I''m curious, is that all cash pay, or is that covered under the minimal essential coverage? That''s what I''m trying to understand. Anyway, if you could call me back ASAP, because I''m headed to the urgent chair now, that''d be great. Thank you.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-18 09:35:03', '2024-12-18 09:38:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155051058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154707021', 'Kathleen Neben', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after start date of January 1, 2025. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-18 09:29:39', '2024-12-18 09:29:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155062018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154907040', 'Barry Friedman', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-12-18 09:28:54', '2024-12-18 09:29:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155077028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139165008', 'Kelvin Yip', NULL, '12/18/24: Kelvin called stating that he is unable to find a pcp that accepts PHCS. I advised him to fill out an appointment setting form and let us try and help. He also asked if he''ll get anything showing he''s paid in to this for his taxes - yes, since he lives in CA, he''ll receive a 1095 form. Let him know I would follow up with him about finding a primary care doctor. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-18 09:24:26', '2024-12-18 09:24:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155077023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148609002', 'Yaron Shvets', NULL, '12/18/24: Sent Regina the following email per previous request: 
According to Lori at ARM, while Dr. Craig isn’t listed in the PHCS network, other OB-GYNs at the same address are in-network. This could mean the practice might submit your claim using their practice NPI rather than Dr. Craig’s individual NPI, which would allow you to receive discounts through PHCS.
She recommended keeping your January 15th appointment and discussing the insurance change with Dr. Craig’s office when you’re there. If for some reason the claim doesn’t process under PHCS, Lori ensured us that a discount through Zelis would be applied. 
AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-18 09:19:46', '2024-12-18 09:19:46'),
