  ('zcrm_1579374000155007008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083369001', 'Melanie Lamere', NULL, '12/18/24: Melanie emailed in asking for an ARM card for her husband. I let her know that only the primary account holder will be listed on the card, however if they require an additional physical card, they can contact ARM as they issue those directly from their office. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-18 07:27:21', '2024-12-18 07:27:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154980006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881429', 'Robin Emond', NULL, 'Jan has contacted me about this member and the transition to the new pricing.  I explained that this member does not have the MEC , that it had been cancelled in 2021.  Jan &amp; member are aware that she will not have any preventative and that she will have Zion only.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-12-18 07:19:02', '2024-12-18 07:19:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000155007003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130562001', 'Philip Ender', NULL, '12/18/24: Esther emailed asking if her ARM card is an annual replacement of other. Replied with the following: The card you''ve received is part of our initiative to ensure all members have the most up-to-date version reflected in our system records. While it may not be a direct replacement, this updated card helps to ensure your membership details are current.
