  ('zcrm_1579374000154939003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149568002', 'Joel Dunn', NULL, '12.17.24 - Joel called asking for instructions on how to schedule his annual wellness visit. Instructed him to ask if the practice is in the PHCS network and if not to call the Concierge and we will work with ARM to ensure he is able to keep is provider. Also, reminded him that if he receives labs to check with Concierge regarding pricing before proceeding if diagnostic code. A', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-12-17 13:25:12', '2024-12-17 13:25:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154873028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154937002', 'Kimberly Gallagher', NULL, '12-17-24 Kim is enrolling in Care+ $2500/$530 EC. She''s choosing to skip HAB for now. Maryjean Starr referred her to me. All set for Jan. 1st, 2025.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-17 13:11:46', '2024-12-17 13:20:57'),
