  ('zcrm_1579374000154873023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155863141', 'Lynn Schulte', NULL, '12-17-24 Lynn is 56 and son Justin is 22. Healthy, no meds, no tobacco, no pre-x. Lynn had a breast cancer scare that turned out to be totally benign. No issues! No treatment. She''s been with Kaiser and paying $900 a month and has a $10K ded. Her ded was $10K and her cost turned out to be $9,995! So, she got no benefits from Kaiser on that. She likes the connectivity of Kaiser but truly prefers alternative treatments such as acupuncture, etc. and now wants to stay out of the medical system as best as possible.  Lives in Longmont, CO. She''s a Physical Therapist and sees her clients that have these memberships. She wishes she did this sooner. It would have saved her a lot of money. But, she''s joining Premium Care $1500/$474 EC and HAB $200 = $674 plus $125/$25. All set for Jan. 1st, 2025.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-17 12:50:42', '2024-12-17 12:50:42'),
