  ('zcrm_1579374000154856008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130216002', 'Montanah Matthies', NULL, '12-17-24 Montanah chose to increase her IUA from $1000 to $2500. She wants to keep MEC for HSA and added HAB for wellness and mental health therapy. She goes often and pays $115 each time. So, HAB will be a huge benefit to her. She will now pay $276/$2500 and $107 = $383 total moving forward. She also moved from Fruita to GJ. She updated her address via the Change Form as well. HAB is for Jan. 1st, 2025. Her friend Kristen had told her to review with me bc of HAB that she didn''t know about.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-17 10:28:57', '2024-12-17 10:28:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154856003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447407', 'Elizabeth Friedlander', NULL, '12-17-24 Liz chose to change her IUA to $2500 and add HAB for $107. She wants to continue to fund her HSA and get the other benefits. She also now realizes to contact MPB Concierge for pricing out meds. She was prescribed Paxlovid for covid and it was going to cost $1474. However on Pharmacy Checker it shows at $144!  She didn''t take it and was fine. She will use me as a resource more often as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-17 10:20:49', '2024-12-17 10:20:49'),
