  ('zcrm_1579374000154756063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155206002', 'Kellie Matticks', NULL, '12-16-24 Kellie chose not to create a C4 account bc she wants to join MCS. I shared Premium Care and HAB with her at $1000 and $1500 IUA $285+$107= $392 or $1500/$254 + $107 = $361 and $125/$25. She watched the video. I explained pre-x clause and MCS pays to her and then to provider. I also explained all benefits of HAB. She''s seeing the value of both and just wants to think it over. We have the next meeting in 2 days. She knew of LHS and Medishare. I explained my knowledge and experience with them.  I need to ask who referred her to me. I forget.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-16 22:11:10', '2024-12-16 22:11:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154756058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155206002', 'Kellie Matticks', NULL, '12-13-24 Kellie is 56 DOB 1/22/68. Lives in Aurora, 80015 and earns about $98K. She pays $682 and doesn''t get ins through work. She has hypothyroid and depression meds. She sometimes takes migraine meds. She''s been with Kaiser but understands she''d have to find new drs. I sent her instructions to create a C4 account if that''s the direction she wants and to compare to MCS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-16 22:07:59', '2024-12-16 22:07:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154756048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199001', 'Carey Reynolds', NULL, '12-16-24 Carey asked again if her membership will be cancelled. I see Patti noted she will process and I looked in Admin123 and it shows Future Inactive for 12/31/24. So, I let Carey know one final time it''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-16 16:49:12', '2024-12-16 16:49:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154756043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124216002', 'Bradon Erickson', NULL, '12-16-24 I left a vm for Brady to properly add his wife and/or baby. He didn''t complete the form properly.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-16 16:07:15', '2024-12-16 16:07:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154756038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126944001', 'Daniel Kimble', NULL, '12-26-24 Daniel''s income is lower than before. He''s self-employed and now qualifies for a subsidy with ACA in CA. He had already completed his cancellation form. He''s all set. He knows if his income increases that he will have to pay more money back in taxes. He''s good to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-16 15:52:08', '2024-12-16 15:52:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154756033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, '12-16-24 Tania is struggling with Zion bc they continue to make her jump through hoops to get some back and hip Needs shared. They are breaking it into multiple needs and asking for more and more information ongoing since June. They are making it very difficult for her and dragging their feet. They are also saying that she has arthritis so she''s worried they won''t share in the costs at a later date. She has done cortisone shots and already spend the $5K cap and worried about the cost if she needs another one in the future. I just connected her with Dr. Brad Vilims to see if he can possibly help her long-term. As for wellness, she funds her HSA and has already done many of the wellness items with HAB. She''s due for a colonoscopy soon and doesn''t want to blow the $4500 on that one visit. Also she gets labs at the local health fair for $200+ for most of what she wants.  She decided to stay with MEC and maybe join HAS next year. She always maxes out her HSA. She might join the 1Dental but only two options locally Mountain Family Healthcare and Comfort Dental.  Vision has only 1 provider as well. She will research them to see if its worth the $99 and $20.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-16 15:46:50', '2024-12-16 22:12:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154755449', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087734002', 'Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, '12.16.24:  Emailed Jocelyn to ask if she''s made a decision as to whether she wants to change her plan to the Zion plan as opposed to staying with Direct. Told her if she isn''t yet ready for that decision, she can hold off and accept the price change until she make her decision.  If she is ready I asked if she would be free either tomorrow or Wednesday.  JSP', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-16 15:24:12', '2024-12-16 15:24:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154748105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148858973', 'Karl Hill', NULL, '12/16/24: Karl called. He needs to submit a bill for reimbursement, but said the Sedera member portal is not intuitive. I ended up transferring him over to Sedera for assistance. Karl called back - his bill was for preventive. After a bit of digging, realized Karl had Health Access and gave him the info for submitting to them. He said he would also reach out to Wendy for a refresher. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-16 14:46:15', '2024-12-16 15:06:45'),
