  ('zcrm_1579374000154748079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130073002', 'Nathan Carden', NULL, '12/16/24: Audra left the following VM:
Hi, my name is Audra Carden. My husband''s name is Nathan. He''s the card member or whatever. I just have a question about the new billing and that my daughter is 21 and she would need her own card. So my number is 303-847-8772. Thank you.

