  ('zcrm_1579374000154743167', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082048002', 'Maginel Galt', 'New Membership eff 1/1/25', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Premium Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-12-16 13:26:02', '2024-12-16 13:26:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154756028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027924354', 'Darrin Hallman', NULL, '12-16-24 Darrin had bought reg insurance when he needed a pacemaker back in Jan. of 2022. He got it just for himself only. His ins paid $120K for the surgery and Sedera paid his ded of $7K. All went well!  He was curious if it was prudent to cancel his reg ins now. He will need it replaced in 5-6 years. I let him know that he should be ok to cancel ins since they''ve been members since 2019. So, they are well beyond an pre-x clause. His wife had an allergic reaction to some medication which sent her into stage 5 kidney failure!  She''s fine now and Sedera shared the entire cost above their IUA. So, he now sees how well it works. He will cancel his ins for the new year. Per the replacement of the pace maker at that time, I told him to check in advance since the Guidelines Change. So, it''s best to be sure before he does that surgery. That''s a long ways away.  All set and super pleased with Sedera and MPB.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-16 13:25:54', '2024-12-16 13:25:54'),
