  ('zcrm_1579374000154743149', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779530', 'Jaelynne Lay', NULL, 'This member ended up re-enrolling in A123 under Leo''s guidance.  Back story around this member she was a member of the original Sedera Select Group and was retained in the transition due to having to have surgery and waiting the 3yrs due to Pre Ex.  She had been being billed out of FTNI and after 4yrs we were not collecting enough monies.  Due to the fact that she is not dealing with any Pre Ex and she is lives in CA, I advised to enroll her the Zion Secure.  Shae is now in A123 and is accessible to all team members.  I will cancel her out of Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-12-16 13:14:39', '2024-12-16 13:14:39'),
