  ('zcrm_1579374000154748038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129608002', 'Theresa Green', NULL, '12/16/24: Theresa called to see if the annual allotted amount for yearly preventive would pay for bloodwork alone since she didn''t see a physician this year. I wasn''t sure and brought Zion into the call. 
