Walked her through the process, what to expect and what to adhere to: IUA, 6 month deadline and organizing her documents. I transferred her to ZIon, and gave her their number. I will open a CRM Tash. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-13 12:22:46', '2024-12-13 15:20:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154689046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046217082', 'Aaron Martin', NULL, '12.13.2024 After messaging Julia for an update, it was suggested that I follow up with an email as well, as I did, via CRM. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-13 12:13:33', '2024-12-13 12:13:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154640096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152070028', 'Delia Gray', NULL, '12-13-24 Delia didn''t want to talk for our scheduled meeting yet again. Rather than rescheduling, I let her know we have a deadline to meet. So, she''s deciding to decline the life ins and Secure HSA membership for now. She doesn''t want a plan that has a pre-x clause. All set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-13 12:11:39', '2024-12-13 12:39:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154651028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118317002', 'Jared Becker', NULL, 'Member called into remove his spouse due to divorce.  I will send out the Change Form link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-12-13 12:10:40', '2024-12-13 12:10:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154640091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154678003', 'Derek Friday', NULL, '12-13-24 Derek and Megan are splitting up. So, Derek is looking for an option for him only. He''s never been involved in this decision and didn''t even know what he had. He didn''t know he''s good through the end of the year. Megan cancelled the membership and is getting a subsidy via C4 on her own. They were married for 28 years!  He did a colonoscopy last year and that''s all set. Otherwise, he''s healthy and never sees a dr. I sent him the video to learn and we''ll determine the best option for him for next year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-13 12:04:48', '2024-12-13 12:04:48'),
