  ('zcrm_1579374000154689031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130432', 'Desiree Smith', NULL, '12.13.2024 SalesIQ chatted to confirm we received her cancellation form and when will she receive language confirmation that it has been cancelled. I responded and sent a review link, via CRM. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-13 11:50:58', '2024-12-13 11:50:58'),
