  ('zcrm_1579374000154689026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148858973', 'Karl Hill', NULL, '12.13.2024 Karl messaged us requesting guidance on how to submit preventive bills to Sedera.
"Hi There :
I need help with submitting a medical expense for an annual exam and lab work( i.e. blood analysis). Where do I go on the site to do that ? Also, with my plan I get a $250/yr allowance for a health & fitness membership. Where do submit for that too ? 
Best Regards, 
Karl Hill
Max Investments LLC dba Mile High IM , Owner
Max Investments LLC dba Mile High IM
Ph# 303 928-9928
Denver, CO 80237
http://www.milehighim.com"

I called him back, but he was driving and could not take notes down. He will call back when he''s not driving. 
PREVENTIVE that is SHAREABLE"
- Screening Colonoscopy: Shareable without an IUA up to a maximum of $2,500
- Screening Mammograms: Shareable without IUA up to a maximum of $600
- If a Member demonstrates medical indication of high risk for a future
diagnosis of Cancer and elects to undergo preventive surgery to reduce this risk, the costs associated with this surgery are generally - Shareable, up to 75% after the IUA.                                  NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-13 11:35:56', '2024-12-13 11:35:56');
