  ('zcrm_1579374000154659273', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154601002', 'Robert Torres', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure HSA. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2024-12-13 11:35:35', '2024-12-13 11:35:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154640066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044575094', 'Doug Klof', NULL, '12-13-24 Doug''s leaving his job at the end of the year. His wife is scheduled for a surgery in Feb to remove an ovary bc of her BRACA 2 genetic disorder. He wants to keep her with UC Health. Select Health is the only option. He called UCH and made sure their entire system will accept Select Health and they told him Yes! So, he can get a Select Health Gold plan at full cost for $536. With a family of 6 and $180K income they would gain a $500 APTC if they all enrolled. In that case they would still pay $1000-$1400 for the plan they would want for the entire family and still have a $16K mop. So, he will go with Premium Care for MC $1500 IUA $474 and Select Health for $536. He will try to use up the HMA. I will discuss wellness with him when we talk next. I sent him the video and overview and he knows of the deadlines for each.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-13 11:31:17', '2024-12-13 11:31:17'),
