  ('zcrm_1579374000154659083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104128', 'Lindsay Tollefson', NULL, '12.13.24:  Emailed Lindsay re: 2025 price change for her Secure plan from $375/mo w/a $1000 IUA to $419/mo.  Options: change IUA to 2500/$369/mo.; change to Direct - IUA 2500/$350/mo.; change to Premium HSA - IUA 1000/$349/mo.; change to Premium Care - IUA 1000/$285/mo.; IUA 1500/$254/mo. Included links to Member Change form and my website. Told her to contact me w/any questions.  JSP

