  ('zcrm_1579374000154579036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081460002', 'Hollie Snow', NULL, '12.12.2024 Called Hollie to reassure her that she has been reinstated and does not need to worry about her bills, as of now. She can open the sharing request and start uploading her bills and other pertinent information for her kidney stones.
