  ('zcrm_1579374000154579031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762035', 'Traci Hoops', NULL, '12-12-24 Traci is solo on her membership now and wanted to find out what membership will be best moving forward. No pre-x other than Mohs surgery to remove a spot. She has troubles with colonoscopy 3 or so years ago with billing and polyp removal. But, did another one and no polyps. She paid $1000 and Zion paid the rest which was only about $300 she said. She recognizes his is way better than the crazy ins prices. She loves HAB concept to have full freedom of care again as self-pay patient. She said Yes to all wellness stuff except nutrition bc her trainer helps with that and no vax other than covid. The rest she already pays for, so she''s excited. I shared Care+ and Premium Care and she wants Premium Care at $285+$107 HAB = $392. She''s thrilled. We will complete the change form tomorrow and remove the MEC too. She doesn''t fund an HSA either, so that''s not a concern. She prefers alternative Drs for her wellness visits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-12 11:27:14', '2024-12-12 11:27:14'),
