  ('zcrm_1579374000154422935', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120543002', 'Alex Friedman', NULL, '12.11.2024 Alex called trying to get access into his MPB member portal. Once I gave him his username, which is his email, he gained access. He asked if I actually could see the passcode out in the open, and I said yes. It is in our database. 
