  ('zcrm_1579374000154448128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155322082', 'Valerie Reynolds', NULL, '12-11-24 Valerie is all set for now with her new plan. However, she will start a seasonal job in April and they do offer her health insurance. She will likely need to accept their insurance since she won''t qualify for an APTC at that time. She''s now realizing that Bev never inquired about her new job and insurance benefits. So, she''s concerned that she will have to pay back her APTC for 8 months or so in 2024!  It looks like that was $2K per month!  She will talk with her CPA. Anyhow, she''s all set for now for 2025. She discovered the Gold plan also has the CSR and is slightly better than the Silver plan. I have never seen a Gold plan include the CSR. Not sure if it''s different in Montrose area with how the tax credits are applied.  But, she has a great plan for only $3.80 for at least Jan-March.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-11 16:36:49', '2024-12-11 16:37:55'),
