  ('zcrm_1579374000154424105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081878009', 'Linda Pearce', NULL, '12.11.24:  Emailed Linda re 2025 price change from Care+ @ $315/mo. with a $1000 IUA to $352/mo. Options: change  IUA to $2500/$300/mo.; change from Care+ to Premium Care w/an IUA of $1000/$285/mo.. or an IUA of $1500/$254/mo. Included links to Member Change forms and my website. Told her to contact me w/any questions.  JSP', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-11 13:34:09', '2024-12-11 13:34:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154424091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017815001', 'Monica Rankin', 'Member Aging into Medicare eff 1/25', '10-29-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em
12/11-2nd notice sent to member member cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-12-11 13:07:22', '2024-12-11 13:07:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154422298', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144941008', 'Scott Stier', NULL, '12.11.2024 Scott called to help his wife with her ER bills from 2 months ago.
Amy went to the ER, and now need to open a Zion medical need.
Scott had numerous questions, including how to navigate the MPB app, which I went in with him and guided him, while he was on the phone. 
I proceeded to go into detail about the process of opening a medical need with Zion, what are the requirements, what to expect and what the member is responsible for: IUA and 6 month deadline adhering.
Scott was very receptive, and was even interested in wanting to connect to the medical advocacy team at Zion and wanting to know how long will it take for them to start sharing the bills.
I did coach him sure that they presented as cash pay patients, and collected all of their receipts and bills. I transferred him to Zion. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-11 13:04:22', '2024-12-11 13:24:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154424086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072425023', 'Lior Moshe', NULL, '12.11.24:  Emailed Lior &amp; Adria re: 2025 price change from $736.45 ($715 for plan, the rest for 3% c.c.) w/a $1000 IUA to $780/mo.  Options: change Secure IUA to $2500/$658; change to Premium Care w/an IUA of $1500/$741/mo. or $2500 IUA/$680; change to Direct at a $1000 IUA/$755 or $2500 IUA/$700/mo. Included links to Member Change form and my website. Told them to contact me w/any questions. JSP', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-11 13:03:49', '2024-12-20 11:38:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154422293', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096327002', 'Lucas Battista', NULL, '12.11.2024 I missed Lucas'' call. I called him back. He said he did submit the change form to change his birthday, but It was not showing up in our database. 
I sent him the link straight from MPB.Health instead, today. Just in case the other one is not leading to the correct database, with all the changes made to the forms.
He filled it out over the phone, changing his address, but forgot to mention the birthday. .....I checked both platforms and it is not showing up.
I asked him to fill it out again and make sure his birthday change request is added in the comments section, since there isnt one for it on the form. He said he will do so.
After 30 minutes or so, it still is not showing up in the database. 
Here are the links I shared with him to fill out:
1-https://www.cognitoforms.com/mpoweringbenefits1/rxlabsimagingcustomquoterequest2024
2- https://mpb.health/membership-changes/                                     

I messaged the team via Teams Chat - NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-11 13:02:51', '2024-12-11 13:30:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154424081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056557001', 'Anders Rasker', 'Member Aging into 30 Age Band eff 1/25', '12/11-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-12-11 12:30:53', '2024-12-11 12:30:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154482008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125135002', 'Allison Brim', NULL, 'Thanks y''all! I filled out the form yesterday--did you receive it? Anything else I need to do? 
