  ('zcrm_1579374000154422267', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122612001', 'Jennifer Speed', NULL, '12.11.2024 Jennifer needed to upload bills onto her sharing request  with Zion - but was trying to do it in the MPB portal. I gave her the credentials for the MPB portal, regardless, and urged her NOT to change the passcode. I then guided her to upload any bills (she confirmed she already has a need open with Zion), onto Zion''s sharing request. She logged in there, while were on the phone.  Jennifer had just forgotten which portal to go to, but she is set. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-11 11:49:20', '2024-12-11 11:49:20'),
