  ('zcrm_1579374000154422239', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023086', 'Lisa Schuster', NULL, '12.11.2024 After a few reciprocated messages via Teams chat, Catherine came to the conclusion that the information provided to Lisa, was correct, but also very irrelevant. 
