  ('zcrm_1579374000154422224', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151449002', 'Betsy Todd', NULL, '12.11.2024 Betsy called to better learn how preventive appointments work, prescriptions, getting shared for back issue and getting an epidural and how the IUA applies.
At first Betsy wanted to learn if the doctor she sees is in the ARM network, pract. & Anc. After searching, the doctor did not come up. So we talked about the RBP model and to make sure: 
- provider bills ARM directly
- Code it preventive
- maintain the ACA guidelines
Once they write a prescription, it is diagnostic, so to ask the provider to separate it from the preventive appointment.
We called Zion to get her member portal set up, but she did not come up in their system. I will connect with IT to include her in the integration file to Zion. 
I sent her the preventive information via CRM. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-11 11:01:19', '2024-12-11 11:01:19'),
