  ('zcrm_1579374000154277126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171948292', 'Jemletta Padua', NULL, '12-9-24 Jemletta is Bev''s client and 32. She has an Off-Exchange Anthem plan for $465.99 and $9450 MOP. She''s healthy, no pre-x, no meds (I think). I found her in the Anthem portal. She''s not in C4. Not sure of her income. I sent her the video to watch. We will meet again on Thursday, Dec. 12th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-10 20:53:46', '2024-12-10 20:53:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154277121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114123001', 'Narit Trairatnobhas', NULL, '12-10-24 I explained the entire membership to Narit. He''s 36 and Laura''s son. Laura will be paying for his membership. His only pre-x is mental health stuff which he takes 3 meds, lemotrigine, hydroxizine and 1 other. Premium Care is best at the $1500 IUA / $254. No wellness which I explained except items he''s not old enough to need yet. HAB isn''t worth the cost for him. I waived the $100 fee per Laura''s blessing since they are paying for it anyhow. So, they will just get the $100 back either way. He''s all set for Jan. 1st, 2025.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-10 20:48:49', '2024-12-10 20:48:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154277111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154937002', 'Kimberly Gallagher', NULL, '12-10-24 Kim came referred by Maryjean Starr. She is on Medishare and has heard amazing things about MPB/Zion. She''s paying $520 with a $9K max sharing amount. I quoted her Care+ $1000/$672 or $2500/$550 and possible HAB for 1, 2 or 3 family members. Yes, to naturopathic drs., dental, vision but no to nutrition, gym, mental health. She wants to know about maternity bc they just paid $14K for their first baby who''s about to turn one in a few weeks. Kim is 39 and husband is 41. So, even at the $2500 IUA level the maternity will be way more affordable. They also have a major problem with the network through Medishare in Cotopaxi. So, MEC won''t be helpful to them. She already gets her supplements at a discount through full scripts. She''s very interested in this and will discuss it with her husband. She''ll get back to me quickly but knows the deadline.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-10 19:32:51', '2025-01-30 14:51:01'),
