  ('zcrm_1579374000154277093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154367025', 'Denise Kraal', NULL, '12-10-24 Denise 12/13/67 and Mark is on Medicare 1/15/1959 and they live in Montrose and came to me via Bev. They are estimating $47K, 10K for investment income and $37K from SS. Zip is 81403. Denise just got citizenship just the other day after many years and a lot of money! She wants to be able to see Dr. Podhajsky in FC and PCP and Dr. Andrew Beard in Montrose. They want to review Dental discount plan network. They dentist Graff and Peterson Dental doesn''t show up in either network. They were super sweet and appreciative. Denise had set up a new account for just her which wasn''t working. I had access to her original account which was working. So, we used that one and got everything all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-10 16:04:18', '2024-12-10 16:04:18'),
