  ('zcrm_1579374000154371044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145910011', 'Benjamin Cooper', NULL, '12/10/24: Called Benjamin back re his VM: Hi, my name is Benjamin Cooper and I am wanting to Learn the process for getting my son evaluated who is having some Behavioral issues, please. Give me a call at nine four zero seven zero three eight four seven zero. Thanks

Advised him to reach out to MSEAP to access a therapist in his area and if he needed a psychiatrist or other option, to give us a call back and we could perform a search for him. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-10 15:42:40', '2024-12-10 15:42:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154321449', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096327002', 'Lucas Battista', NULL, '12.10.2024 Called Lucas back today but it was after the end of my shift. Left a detailed message. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-10 15:22:58', '2024-12-10 15:22:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154371036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091091002', 'Christian Tonsberg', NULL, '12/10/24: Returned Christian call. He needs a 1095 form for filing 2023 taxes. Let him know I''d have once sent to him tomorrow. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-10 15:19:01', '2024-12-10 15:28:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154321421', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131712002', 'Grant Zabielski', NULL, '12.10.2024 Milynn called and LVM. Called inquiring about the price increase. The cap of IUA max per year. I explained the cap on the IUA''s, I explained to her the maternity sharing request process, the MEC change and their PHCS networks, and how to stay covered through her MEC plan.
I gave her Zion''s number and coached her on steps.
I sent her two emails via CRM: the Preventive resources and the MAP Orientation guidance. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-10 14:44:56', '2024-12-10 15:07:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154321413', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151449002', 'Betsy Todd', NULL, '12.10.2024 Per admin''s request, resent ARM''s new card via CRM. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-10 14:35:07', '2024-12-10 14:35:07'),
