  ('zcrm_1579374000154321393', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126671002', 'Jeana Babcock', NULL, '12.10.2024 Jeremy called trying to get a prescription filled. He was referred to us, with our concierge number, by CirrusMD, right after they shared that the behavioral department usually can prescribe the medication he is seeking to be refilled. Unsure why they offered our number, but I requested that he try them again, and speak to a new person and share his experience for clarification. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-10 14:25:56', '2024-12-10 14:25:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154321388', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151451002', 'William Madsen', NULL, '12.10.2024 William and his mom called hoping to reach, CirrusMD for a refill. I helped William H, the son, to register for CirrusMD, but his credentials were not recognized.
I went ahead and put in a ticket for CirrusMD for help with that. I explained to William that he should receive instructions and confirmation from CirrusMD shortly, sharing that he is registered and the steps to get him set up, to start using the service. I will follow up in an hour (or Angee).
I also sent him an rx script form to fill out. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-10 14:20:04', '2024-12-10 14:39:49'),
