  ('zcrm_1579374000154277088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064277064', 'Jose Hernandez', NULL, '12-10-24 I quoted Premium Care and HAB. No pre-x. He''s been a member before. I gave him a full refresher. He does not fund an HSA. He probably doesn''t need HAB. Premium Care $1000/$285 or $1500/$254. He''s 59. He will review the information and touch base in a few days with his decision.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-10 13:58:06', '2024-12-10 13:58:06'),
