  ('zcrm_1579374000154343023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087060131', 'Emily Hubbard', NULL, '12.10.24:  Emailed Emily re: 2025 Plan price change, which would be increased from $240/mo. to $273. Provided options: Change her Care+ plan IUA from 1000 to 2500 for $205/mo. or change to Premium Care w/a 1500 IUA for $254/mo. Told her to contact me w/any questions.  JSP', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-10 13:03:14', '2024-12-10 13:03:14'),
