  ('zcrm_1579374000154371031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061161060', 'Lauren Wagner', NULL, '12/10/24: Lauren called. We brought Zion into conversation to A) Correct her PHI form and grant me full access to speak to ZIon about her sharing requests, and B) Ask about expediting the reimbursement for statement Lauren submitted today ($6,677.33 for Humira). 
Chalice informed us that the processing time is still 4-6 weeks from when statement is submitted. I asked if there is anything we could do for Lauren similar to how a maternity request works with a global package since the price of med doesn''t change and she''ll be getting it shared through March?
Chalice said the the issue with why she can''t get a cc is that the pharmacy is attached to a grocery store and the issue lies with the "merchant code" being used for billing. She said if Lauren switched her pharmacy to a Walgreens or CVS, then she can call Zion 3-4 days prior to picking it up and they will issue her a prepaid credit card to pay for it. 
Lauren''s next pick up date will be around December 27th. 
Will call Chris tomorrow to see about fast tracking her current check - let Lauren know status.
Will follow up about how the cc works later in December. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-10 12:43:02', '2024-12-10 12:43:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000154321218', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134092002', 'Karen Thompson', NULL, '12.10.2024 Angee forwarded an INFO email from the webForm that Karen filled out asking 
"Subject: follow-up with my Dr. after using Cirrus MD over the weekend
I have a virtual appointment with my primary care physician on Friday after using Cirrus MD on Saturday for back pain.  Is there anything I should know or do when preparing for the appointment?  They are asking about insurance and I want to answer correctly.  Thanks for your help.
Karen Thompson
671 Westlake Drive
