  ('zcrm_1579374000154277083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124216002', 'Bradon Erickson', NULL, '12-10-24 Brady called bc he wants to add his wife and inquire about maternity. My email I sent yesterday went to spam. He found it and it shows the price, maternity guide, text from sharing guidelines. So, he''ll discuss it with his wife. She was on traditional ins and they wound up paying 2 deductibles. They broke it out 1 for mom and 1 for baby for regular birth. They paid about $15K!  With MCS at the $2500 IUA level worst case is $5K but most likely without complications it will be $2500 all said and done. He has the link to do it on his own and will call me if he needs help. All set and super appreciatve.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-10 12:35:16', '2024-12-10 12:35:16'),
