  ('zcrm_1579374000154184059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124142012', 'Trudi Sorensen', NULL, '12.09.2024 Trudi called through Planstin, Carmen transferred her, to learn how to get shared on physical therapy. Trudi has been to the doctor and he prescribed her to get PT for lower back issues
