  ('zcrm_1579374000154184013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097264002', 'Marilyn Negley', NULL, '12.09.2024 Marilyn called concerned about the bills getting shared, cz she has not heard back from Zion, even though she''s paid her $1000 IUA.
We spoke with Daisa at Zion, she said that Zion is waiting on documents like: representation of fulfilling the IUA, or other receipts and invoices. 
There''s only 1 statement (ER exam $400~) is all that is presently showing up in her sharing request.
It turns out Zion had a different email for Marilyn in their system, so Daisa corrected it to: marilynrnegley@sbcglobal.net, which is what we have. For some reason, the emails from Daisa is not reaching her, and that is because Daisa had a ''d'' instead of a ''b''.
Member@zionhealthshare.org is what Daisa decided to have Marilyn send her bills to.
It also looks like a lot of reciprocation has been reaching John, her husband''s email instead.
I stayed on till Daisa was able to see Marilyn email come through to her, before we disconnected.
Daisa did share the 5-6 weeks processing wait time. Daisa will speak to the processor regarding the experience of the tech issue, and in hopes that they could expedite the process to help with billing and due dates. 
PER DAISA: Making payments COULD delay sharing bills, due to the parallel of NEW balance to the present balance that is in the sharing request.  NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-09 13:14:12', '2024-12-09 13:39:27'),
