  ('zcrm_1579374000153984074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081460002', 'Hollie Snow', NULL, '12.06.2024 Called Hollie to do a 3-way call with Zion, spoke with Daisa and she helped Hollie with opening a member portal. 
