  ('zcrm_1579374000153984061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002724127', 'Paul DeFelice', NULL, '12.06.2024 Called PHCS'' number, according to William''s guidance. I did tried to bypass the automated response system, but it kept looping to options that did not match our concern for the call. I let go of speaking to PHCS, and then I call Karen directly to 860-214-7147. 
