I will send them both an email with the above. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-06 15:34:53', '2024-12-06 15:34:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153917114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026122744', 'Kimberly Payes', NULL, '12-6-24 Kim wanted to review her membership. Her price is going from $344 to $419 and she pays $115 or so for Cloud Medical.  If she moves to Premium Care, it will be $285 and she can add HAB for $124 = $409. With the $70 reimbursement her new monthly cost is $339 which is better than her current membership.  I sent her the Premium Care overview and HAB brochure to review. She put on her calendar to call me by Wed of next week to make decision. She says she has no pre-x and didn''t seem concerned about losing HSA compliance. She''s trying to wrap her head around all of the benefits. She can use dental, vision, gym, labs, not necessarily mental health, not thermogram. She does mammograms.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-06 15:19:58', '2024-12-06 15:19:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153984053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133854002', 'Kristin Witzenman', NULL, '12.06.2024 Kristin was confused who charged her $655 on 11.20.2024. I looked her up in Admin123, and confirmed with here that it is us, charging for her membership. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-06 15:08:31', '2024-12-06 15:08:31'),
