  ('zcrm_1579374000153917099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447407', 'Elizabeth Friedlander', NULL, '12-6-24 Liz very interested in HAB and I priced out all 3 IUA''s She will probably stick with $1000. She wants to talk with her accountant today and will get back to me. She needs to decide if its worth losing the HSA. We would move her to Care+ $1000/$352 + $107 = $459, or $2500/$300+$107= $407 or Secure HSA $2500/$369+$107 = $476.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-06 13:22:34', '2024-12-06 13:22:34'),
