  ('zcrm_1579374000153917094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153961021', 'Patricia Lenz', NULL, '12-6-24 Patty is 53 in Jan. 2025. She''s healthy, works out and owns her own biz. She was referred by Kara Weld. They all live in Hood River, OR. Kara spoke very highly of her membership. Patty is currently with LHS but wants a membership more in alignment with her values. I explained Premium Care and HAB and she was thrilled. Patty did a mammo that needed a follow up but said that won''t be necessary again. All is well. She''s paying $399 with LHS now she thinks. For HAB she said Yes to everything except nutrition and vax. She takes some supplements as well. She decided to join Premium Care at $285 + HAB at $107 = S392.   She than called back to better understand how to manage hormone health for menopause. I''m inquiring with HAB about an IUD for preventive purposes or wellness and the Dr. visit for that. Waiting to hear back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-06 13:19:44', '2024-12-06 13:19:44'),
