  ('zcrm_1579374000153881230', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130437018', 'Jess Bennett', NULL, '12/6/24: Jess called needing to cancel. He''s joining employer insurance. I guided him to form online and asked if he''d be willing to leave a review - he said no :( AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-06 13:17:26', '2024-12-06 13:17:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153984031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120981009', 'Anne Steegman', NULL, '12.06.2024 3-way call with Zion regarding the status of the sharing request. Will help Kassie with assigning a processor, she did say the determinations are taking up to 3 weeks. Did confirm all the documents that are already submitted, are perfect. She did share there''s a 5-6 weeks to process, once they go over the documents, they take around 5-6 weeks more. 
Which then the member should receive guidance on the steps to take next. 
If the member''s balances are in crucial state (going past the due bill), member will share with entity that the bill is pending on the healthsharing process.
Zion usually would follow up via email, but if need of additional documents, they will call Kassie/member.
Kassie knows that the ball is on Zion''s court to let her know the next steps on the sharing request. The only thing the representative added was to double check on the cash pay amount for the xray that is now showing for $2200. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-06 13:15:21', '2024-12-06 13:27:39'),
