  ('zcrm_1579374000153984008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069770565', 'Andrew Miller', NULL, '12.06.2024 Therapy sessions with a psychiatrist. Is inquiring about getting his sessions covered. I explained we do have a service that offers therapy sessions, however it is different than traditional therapy talk. I went into the details of our MAP program, and how the process works, and the option to nominate a therapist. I sent him through the CRM email, the orientation of the MAP service and all the steps we discussed. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-06 11:15:56', '2024-12-06 11:28:19'),
