  ('zcrm_1579374000153881212', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152320002', 'Stephanie Watson', NULL, '12/6/24: Emailed Stephanie an updated Prescription Quote per her request including prices for other pharmacies in her area, mail order and progesterone on quote form. 

