  ('zcrm_1579374000153917052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153885249', 'Alexander Price', NULL, '12-5-24 John Price, Alexander''s dad joined the call to help. Alex is looking for a job with now. We put his income in at $27K with investment income. Once he gets a job, he will let me know and we will update the income or cancel his plan if he gets benefits. He also wants vision ins which I sent him the VSP options to review. Zip code is 80246', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-05 18:09:28', '2024-12-05 18:09:56'),
