  ('zcrm_1579374000153881202', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130958002', 'Erwin Clamor', NULL, '12.05.2024 Liliana called to learn how to proceed if her son needs to go to urgent care. They have not used our services/their benefits yet.
I coached her on all three parts of her plan, and reiterated that if it is not preventive it will be a cash pay visit.
I made sure they have the ARM card. I will double check to see if it is ok that only Erwin''s name is present and not hers.
I tried to register her with CirrusMD, but she used her email for her husband''s account. I sent in a support ticket to cirrusMD, asking them to resituate their credentials, in order for Liliana to have her own account. I sent the email from the Concierge Email.
I made a task to reflect that and sent her a review request. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-05 18:00:51', '2024-12-05 18:00:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153917042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134767002', 'Kara Weld', NULL, '12-5-24 Kara is interested in setting up her employer group but some live in WA state. So, I sent her the co-op info since that''s the only option at this time for WA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-05 17:56:19', '2024-12-05 17:56:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153881187', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120981009', 'Anne Steegman', NULL, '12.05.2024 ReOpening the CRM task for Anne to do a 3-way call with Zion tomorrow to confirm they received her request. She shared via Outlook email that she submitted it RIGHT before Thanksgiving.
I will call her tomorrow 12.06.2024 @ 2:30ET. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-05 16:35:56', '2024-12-06 13:15:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153917034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107486002', 'Julia Mickelson', NULL, '12-5-24 Julia is able to get the kids onto Medicaid, so we removed them from her membership. She was paying $480 for all three of them. When we removed the kids it was still going to cost her $300 for the Direct membership. So, I realized she doesn''t do mammo''s or colonscopies therefore we moved her to Care+ $1000/$273. She''s keeping her DPC. She wanted to cancel them too but the only way she can continue to see that Dr. is via the monthly membership fee of $110. It was $100 for 2024. She was thrilled to drop her price to the $273. That was submitted and Patti gave it the thumbs up.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-05 16:26:52', '2024-12-05 16:26:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153917029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155322082', 'Valerie Reynolds', NULL, '12-5-24 Valerie and Keith were Bev''s clients Their income is $50K between the two of them. She asked me to update the income sources but the total income is remaining the same into 2025. They are getting a $2706.34 APTC. They currently have the following and looking to review for new options:

