  ('zcrm_1579374000153917013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155863212', 'Hillary Thomas', NULL, '12-5-24 Tracy Matthews is helping Hillary Thomas, 54 with her health options. They came to me via Alicia Turbidy. Tracy is the sister in law of Alicia''s or something like that. Or Hillary is Alicia''s sister. They are all related somehow. Alicia has been super happy with her membership for all of these years. Tracy just had a throat biopsy or something. She just did her colonoscopy and is recovering. So, she didn''t want to talk too much. But she''s paying $3800 a month for her own family. She just had  appendicitis  last year and is still getting billed an additional $7K that they want after all the money she already spent. She understands cash pay since she saw someone pay $50 for a Dr. visit in cash many years ago. She sees how broken the system is and is totally open to new ideas and will teach Hillary. Hillary currently has BC/BS in CA. But, she''s moving her residence to FL! She pays for a private Concierge Dr already. She''s relatively healthy but takes some meds. She''s not sure what they are all for. She also takes supplements and can benefit from the 30% discount. Hillary like alternative drs. and uses them as well. I quoted for Hillary Premium Care $1000/$285 and HAB $124 - $70 reimbursement = $339. She likely wants a Jan. 1st start date. Tracy will share the video and written overview with Hillary and get back to me early next week.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-05 11:11:59', '2024-12-05 11:11:59'),
