  ('zcrm_1579374000153777032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, '12.05.2024 Kallie called in to inquire about sharing removal of wisdom teeth for her son, through Zion. I was a bit in the grey on this one, as wisdom teeth at times DO NEED to come out, due to lack of space. So we decided to pull Zion in and learn what they have to say.
