  ('zcrm_1579374000153758023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138597002', 'Bladimir Aviles', NULL, '12-4-24 Bladimir has stomach issues again and needs to go to Urgent Care. He needs to create his Need immediately from before and pay his first $1000 of the $5000. Then cost can be shared. But, until he pays his $1000 and submits the Need, nothing will happen. He will call MPB Concierge Team now to get the process started.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-04 13:44:03', '2024-12-04 13:44:03'),
