  ('zcrm_1579374000153758018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043462286', 'Bryan Baker', NULL, '12-4-24 Bryan is able to join his wife''s company''s ins and they company is paying for both of them. He was reluctant to cancel since he really likes his membership but it''s hard to say no to $0 for his ins moving forward. Plus they have a new baby and this will keep everything in one place. He reminded me that he''s part of the HMA membership and never knew how to login or use his account. He got logged in and sees his balance at $1102.50 and there was another balance that I missed but close to the same dollar amount. He joined on 3/23/23 so he''s been funding it for about 1 1/2 yrs.  He''s now to the point where he can start using it. He will contact HMA to updated his payment method if it''s debiting from his cc bc that''s about to  expire. He''s all set for now and super appreciative of my help. If anything changes he will be back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-04 13:22:59', '2024-12-04 13:22:59'),
