  ('zcrm_1579374000153722040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152485001', 'Todd West', NULL, '12.04.2024 Todd called following up on receiving his digital cards. He was expecting them on Monday, but has not received them. I know our administration is able to send those usually right away, once the member''s membership has started, so I told Todd, the party responsible for sending those out is currently at lunch. They will be able to send it out upon their return. If he has not received them in the next two hours, to call us back to rectify it.
I messaged Acelyn on Teams chat to let her know and let me know if the above plan may not be feasible. 
*************************************************************************
Kathleen ended up calling us as well, for the same purpose. I messaged Acelyn again via Teams, letting her know that Kathleen actually has an appt tomorrow and will get cancelled if she does not the information over to the facility soon. 
Acelyn was good about finding it and sending it over to both Todd and Kathleen, kathwest@yahoo.com. 
************************************************************************
Kathleen ended up calling back stating that the facility, Trinity Health - where she is having her colonoscopy at and the closest one to her, I believe, does not accept nor would interact with neither PHCS nor ARM. I called them, LVM for Cathy, she called back. I explained that ARM would cover the claim as long as it is coded preventive. She said what if it became diagnostic, and I responded with, "in that case Kathleen and I would have a different conversation where she would connect with her health sharing company". Cathy said "...this is something like medishare..." to which I responded with "something like that". She confirmed that is not something that they practice, and will not proceed from there, unless Kathleen is willing to carry the claim over to ARM. I called ARM to confirm that is ok, they were appalled at Trinity Health''s behavior, but did confirm with Kathleen proceeding in that matter.
I ended up talking to Kathleen again. I explained the "claims carrying to ARM" part to her. 

That is how Kathleen will proceed wit this colonoscopy. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-04 10:25:23', '2024-12-04 15:02:36'),
