  ('zcrm_1579374000153585168', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009850101', 'Elizabeth Spano', NULL, '11-26-24 Hello Elizabeth,

Health Access is made up of three key pieces that work together to provide you and your family with quality health care. These are your preventive care, primary care and prescription.

Below you''ll find your personalized Digital Membership Packet, which includes all the information you need to get started using Health Access.

Health Access Member ID: 522192776
Start Date: 12/01/2024

Primary Care
Status: Not enrolled.
When to Use: Your membership does not include any Direct Primary Care services.

Prescription
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your prescription service anytime you need to fill a prescription from a pharmacy.


Preventive Care
Status: Enrolled automatically!
When to Use: Use your preventive care service to get reimbursed for preventive medical services anytime you visit a lab or doctor’s office for dozens of tests and services.

You''re Done! How Easy Was That?
