  ('zcrm_1579374000153585108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153586130', 'Jane Pulliam', NULL, '12-3-24  Jane and her husband can get a huge APTC through C4, so they only have to pay $118.72 per month. They are at a much bigger financial risk but can fund the HSA to the max to protect themselves. The difference is about $7500 more annually if they stayed with MPB and C4. So, it''s worth going to C4 for both of them since her husband isn''t working. Their income is just under $80K. APTC is $2182.27.  She successfully cancelled MPB. Her husband may need help with Medicare in about 1 year. She was super nice and all set for now! She knows to double check with their payment method in 10 biz days.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-03 15:30:25', '2024-12-03 15:30:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153587088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144728036', 'Andrew Wilson', NULL, '12/3/24: Michelle called to see if her dr is in network. They have wellness checkups in January. We searched multiplan site and while there were lots of drs pulling up within the facility, we didn''t see theirs. Advised member to verify with provider if they are in the PHCS network and if not, to let us know and we can see if there is anything we can do. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-03 15:27:52', '2024-12-03 15:27:52'),
