  ('zcrm_1579374000153588008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899314', 'Timothy Sparrow', NULL, '12.03.24 Per Patti, Timothy has been provided the explanation and new price points by Wendy. If he wants to make any changes to his plan, he will have to submit a change form/cancellation. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-12-03 14:38:04', '2024-12-03 14:38:12');
