  ('zcrm_1579374000153585079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003413005', 'Jennah Synnestvedt', NULL, '12-3-24 Jennah decided to increase her IUA to $2500. I quoted her the CARE+ price of $205. However, I see the current membership price of MPB CareZ No MEC is actually $204 at the $2500 IUA. So, that won''t be a problem for her.  She will pass on HAB for now since money is tight. She was approved for NLG and we are sorting out her payment information for auto wd EFT.  I haven''t seen the document for her to sign again either. She also updated her address from FL to CO. Her husband got the free CO Connect plan. So, he''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-03 13:20:57', '2024-12-03 13:21:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153560098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128922010', 'Glen Randall', 'New Membership eff 1/1/25', 'Member &amp; Sp $5000 Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-12-03 13:20:07', '2024-12-03 13:20:07'),
