  ('zcrm_1579374000153585056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038076', 'Willow Aureala', NULL, '12-3-24 Willow is enrolling in Premium Care $2500/$234 since she has the $2500 IUA already. I tried to encourage the lower IUA but she''s happy. She had a cancer spot removed from her face this year. So, I shared the Pre-X clause with her. She fully understands. She was going to cancel altogether bc she can''t afford it.  She knows of the 6 month waiting period for mammo and colonoscopy. She already did her mammogram and no plans for colonoscopy.  Takes some supplments, so I let her know about 30% discounts. Willow is also interested in HAB w/ DPC for $124. She just wants to think about it. She knows the deadline is 20th of the month.  She pays $190 for her DPC. If she joins it''s $124 - $70 = $54 only. She will use Dental, maybe vision, labs, pap maybe, mental health maybe and it will protect her for the 3rd IUA. She doesn''t need gym since she gets plenty of exercise on her property.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-03 12:19:54', '2024-12-03 12:44:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153548163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098675002', 'Tony Costa', NULL, 'Member submitted cancelled eff. 12/31/24. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2024-12-03 12:17:47', '2024-12-03 12:17:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153587073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131969002', 'Simone Noble', NULL, '12/3/24: Simone called.  She''s has a mamm appt coming up and the provider says that Planstin is not in network so she wanted to check and see how that would work. I checked admin and she does indeed have P until Dec 31. Let her know that P uses RBP if provider is out of network and will still pay for services as long as provider will bill them directly. Advised her to have provider call number on card to verify benefits and where to send claim. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-03 12:16:49', '2024-12-03 12:16:49'),
