  ('zcrm_1579374000153518124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109785001', 'Piotr Kaczmarowski', NULL, '12.03.2024 Piotr called so I can help them make colonoscopy visits with a new physician. I was able to bring a physician in, and we made two appts for him and his wife on the 6th of February at 11. Doctor is on both lists for ARM and Planstin. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-03 11:55:43', '2024-12-03 11:55:43'),
