  ('zcrm_1579374000153560030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109175002', 'Laura Williamson', 'New Membership eff 1/1/25', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Premium HSA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-12-03 10:02:56', '2024-12-03 10:02:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153560025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109175002', 'Laura Williamson', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to change IUA &amp; Membership to $2500 Premium HSA eff 1/1/25.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-12-03 10:02:23', '2024-12-03 10:02:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153518078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887102', 'Shelley Sanner', NULL, '12.03.2024 Shelley called regarding the price increase and is inquiring about the detail changes with the new MEC. Shelley wanted to give her feedback first, saying with such a large change in someone''s health endeavor, it would have been more conducive and appropriate, if a comparing chart or bullets that frame new items in the new MEC was shared in that email, as well as their website link. I assured her that I will share this feedback with our administration for future correspondence.
We went over the differences between ARM and Planstin, price increase, ACE guidelines and how to proceed to preventive appointments, especially a physical annual (she''s having one done on the 9th of December, 2024).
