  ('zcrm_1579374000153474011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110552002', 'Sheryl Hadley', NULL, '12-3-24 Sheryl  has a new skin cancer Need to create. I gave her the # to call MPB. Her cost is just over $1000. She''s also considering HAB for wellness in addition to her MEC. She''s funding her HSA and really wants to keep that. So, it would be $419+$107 = $526. It''s still cheaper than ACA whic is about $600+ and crazy high ded.  She''s happy with her current membership so far but it is confusing. Her price already increased 3X! It started at $325 to $375 and now to $419. She started Feb. of 2023.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-02 11:56:26', '2024-12-02 11:56:26'),
