  ('zcrm_1579374000153474003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153885249', 'Alexander Price', NULL, '12-2-24 John Price called to help his 27 year old son Alexander Martin Price join health ins for the first time since he turned 26. Son lives in CO in 80246 and he thinks it in Denver County. DOB 5/25/1997. He''s healthy, no tobacco, no meds, no health issues. His income is somewhere between $40K-$50K. At $50K he gets a $75 APTC and at $40K he gets about $200. I will send him instructions and include John on the email as well. Price.John@hotmail.com.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-02 11:08:53', '2024-12-02 11:09:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153425078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133855011', 'Amy Myers', NULL, '12/2/24: Amy called asking which card to use for her preventive appt. She had one with her and her ex husbands name on it. Suggested she use the one with only her name on it as that''s how it appears in our system. She recently changed her last name back to her maiden name. Emailed form to get that updated. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-12-02 11:01:39', '2024-12-02 11:01:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153423038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117456002', 'Kelly Pieropan', NULL, '12.02.2024 Jennifer...feeling very nervous due Zion''s lack of reciprocation and sharing request determination.
