  ('zcrm_1579374000153423033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141321002', 'Joe Himrod', NULL, '12.02.2024 Joe and his wife called in to be guided for his upcoming annual physical. I shared the main points to adhere by: Code it preventive, stay preventive under the ACA guidelines, and bill ARM directly.
