  ('zcrm_1579374000153180055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089965012', 'Michele Palumbo', NULL, '11.27.2024 Michele messaged me to learn more about the MEC changes, and price increases. She is concerned about the pricing, and possibly wanting to increase her IUA to save monthly premium. I tried calling her via GoTo, but it went straight to VM, and it did not allow me to leave her a message. 

