  ('zcrm_1579374000153180037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135538001', 'Alison Johnston', NULL, '11.27.2024 Alison received an email on Monday, 25 sharing her membership changes: doing without the CoPay membership, and changing MEC companies. According to the email she received, she will be saving money. 
