Alison will allow the change to take place, and connect with Jane Kassel, her advisor, for additional details and pricing. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-27 15:46:26', '2024-11-27 15:58:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153180021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125115002', 'Kenneth Arnold', NULL, '11.27.2024 Julia messaged via Teams to make sure the Elizabeth received a Planstin card and a welcome call was sent out to them.
