  ('zcrm_1579374000153180011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149501002', 'Michelle Petrowski', NULL, '11.27.2024 Michelle initially called to get guidance on how to access her gym stipend membership $250. I asked her a few more questions, then realized that she is asking about Health Access Solutions, Health Access Benefits. I guided her based on the document Wendy had shared with me a while back, but urged her to connect with Jane Kassel for additional details.
