  ('zcrm_1579374000153032003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003413005', 'Jennah Synnestvedt', NULL, '11-26-24 Jennah applied for NLG Life Ins 20 YR Term $150K at Standard Non Tobacco. She got instant approval. No Yes'' on her application. Both parents alive, no meds, etc. She chose 8th of the month for auto wd. Sent illustration via email. On the app it showed male and I changed it to female and we adjusted spelling of her last name. Quoted at $30.36 and it should be cheaper once they give her the approval rating. Income at $50K and assets at $363K and household at $450K and husband Juan''s income at $18K.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-26 12:24:04', '2024-11-26 12:24:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153026003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112455002', 'Logan Waechtler', NULL, '11/26/24: Called Logan in regards to email he sent over:
"I’m very confused about how to use my health share plan for my annual vision exam. I have Planstin with the Zion Direct plan. Do I have to see someone who takes the Planstin coverage for my annual vision exam or can I go to anyone and submit it as a shareable expense? Any help is greatly appreciated!"

