  ('zcrm_1579374000152993131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742001', 'Abigail Chan', NULL, '11.26.2024 Via CRM, I sent Abigail a follow up email to ensure Ada''s sharing requests were successfully opened. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-26 11:56:37', '2024-11-26 11:56:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153012023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126854002', 'Rachel Johnson', NULL, '11/26/24: Rachel submitted appeal today to Zion presenting the case that the expenses were related to hormone and digestive issues and were long after her miscarriage - that they were necessary and not related to fertility. 
She also provided me with the following lab code 052215 in order to find chromosome analysis test in discount lab sites. Will perform another search. 
I advised that her appeal looked good and if she had a doctor letter explaining all of this, that would even be better.
AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-26 11:52:51', '2024-11-26 13:19:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152993121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060066173', 'Sherry Gaskins', NULL, '11.26.2024 Sherry called saying she is unable to complete a purchase from Full Script, Gi Synergy - Distributer by Apex Energetics. 
Doctor prescribed it for her
She found it on Amazon for $167 from a 3rd party - does not trust that.
$222 from Dr.
$70 from fullscript - she is getting a message that she needs authorization from MPB. 
*******************************************************************
I called Full Script and Jeiel was kind enough to guide me through this process to help our members:
If a member calls saying that they are trying to purchase supplements from the distributers; Apex Energetics or Ortho Molecular, and they claim that it is giving them a message saying “MPB needs to give you authorization”, let them know that they need to connect with their physician or dispensary who prescribed that supplement, to put those products on their plan (send it as a plan to the patient''s account) in order for the member to be able to purchase them from Full Script.  
Jeiel also said they can also use the request access button instead, but based on my experience with 2 members, when they try that, it gives them the stated message above, “MPB needs to give you authorization...etc”.
*******************************************************************
I called Sherry back but ended up leaving her a VM. 
*******************************************************************
Sherry called back and I shared the above, so confidently to learn that her physician is not going to call in to put it on her plan, because they''re going to want to make the profit instead and have her purchase it from them. 
I decided to do a 3-way call with Full Script, to see if there''s a way around it, but it was a dead end for Sherry. I did learn 2 more bullets:
•	At the beginning of the year, Apex Energetics and Ortho Molecular shifted to individual plans only, which means it is done through the physicians'' consent only*** 
•	Physicians who prescribe THOSE supplements need to be PART of Full Script, in order to put it on the member''s plan, for them to purchase.                NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-26 11:50:11', '2024-11-26 14:43:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153012018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038088', 'Lisa Campbell', NULL, '11/26/24: SalesIQ Chat with Lisa - provided credentials to member portal. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-26 11:49:50', '2024-11-26 11:49:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152998021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087734002', 'Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, '11.26.24:  Emailed Jocelyn the information I found (see notes below).  Also gave her pros and cons of each plan. Asked her to consider them and let me know her decision or we can schedule another mtg. to discuss the possibilities.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-26 11:40:39', '2024-11-26 11:40:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152993116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899314', 'Timothy Sparrow', NULL, '11.26.2024 Dave from ARM called, thought Karen was on with him.
