Leo called the number we have on file for Timothy, but it rang and it went straight to VM. I left a very detailed VM with reasons why he needs to call in order for us to move forward. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-26 11:34:01', '2024-11-26 11:34:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153001058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143217002', 'Lilian Lacson', NULL, 'Spoke to member she couldn''t get into her member portal, she was trying to change her password but she wasn''t receiving email to do so. She will be calling concierge to look into it. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-26 11:18:43', '2024-11-26 11:18:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153012013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123703011', 'Jordan Anderson', NULL, '11/26/24: Sent Jordan a followup regarding her opening a maternity request recently. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-26 11:15:11', '2024-11-26 11:15:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152986057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153005002', 'Jerod Walker', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure HSA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-26 11:14:27', '2024-11-26 11:14:27'),
