  ('zcrm_1579374000152993105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128863010', 'Angela Agenlian-Neuert', NULL, '11.26.2024 Emailed Angela via CRM to ensure opening both sharing requests for her hip and chest was flawless, and that she generated a communication line with Zion, regarding her determination on both requests. 
*************************************************************
Angela emailed back confirming her process of opening the sharing requests with Zion has been successful She  sent the info to Zion that they had asked her for regarding the IUA that she started for her chest issue. She''s hoping to fill out the paperwork for the other IUA this week or next.

Closed the CRM task.  NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-26 10:50:05', '2024-11-26 11:03:13'),
