  ('zcrm_1579374000153001028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438206', 'Brandon Pearce', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to send out QR life code to other child that is over 18. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-26 10:27:53', '2024-11-26 10:27:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153012003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083771001', 'Robert Godfrey', NULL, '11/26/24: Robert called bc his wife received a bill from her OB annual well woman visit and they thought this was supposed to be payed in full. I let him know if could be a few things that happened - either it wasn''t coded correctly by provider, or services fell outside ACA guidelines. Got them over to planstin to look into what might have gone wrong and let them know that if it''s not a simple fix, to please give us a call back and we can look into it further. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-26 10:17:06', '2024-11-26 10:17:06');
