  ('zcrm_1579374000152986042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144851002', 'Heather Walk', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request eff 12/24 citing employer benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-26 10:05:37', '2024-11-26 10:05:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152993087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046605028', 'Donald Spiegel', NULL, '11.26.2024 Lisette called again with Donald on the line. I was able to explain to Donald, and Lisette was there to understand as well, the process of the health-sharing experience with Zion, from opening the sharing request, uploading all the docs, fulfilling the IUA and maintaining communication within that 6 month deadline. 
