  ('zcrm_1579374000153004003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152999021', 'Patrick Brighton', NULL, '11-26-24 Patrick is 62 and Kim is 58. They were Bev''s clients. They are in CA to climb but they are both getting sick. Boohoo. They watched the video and were very intrigued. However, Kim  had 5 spine surgeries with the last one 9 years ago. But, she can''t work bc of the pain still. So, she needs to be on reg ins for sure. Somehow their cost is going down with their income set at $180K. He said last year he had an anomaly and made much more than than and will be paying a ton back in taxes. However, is we remove him from the equation the cost just for Kim is about $1050+. Then to pay for him it would be at least $1350 or so. They can save $500-$600 a month assuming he doesn''t earn too much. We pushed through their current plan. If he earns too much again, he will contact me mid year to let me know and we can make a switch at that time. They both need a colonoscopy is 2 years from now. So, Premium Care could be great for Patrick only. They live in Ouray County, 81403.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-26 09:29:42', '2024-11-26 09:29:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152986032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716004', 'Sorin Mititeanu', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 12/24 due to the fact that he no longer needs a HSA.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-26 09:20:15', '2024-11-26 09:20:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152986027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299094', 'Donald Thessen', 'Previous Sedera Membership', 'Member Only $5000 IUA Partially Self Directed 
1/1/23-11/30/24', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-26 09:08:58', '2024-11-26 09:08:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152986022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299094', 'Donald Thessen', NULL, 'I have received no further response from Misty and this member was billed for 2 memberships.  He called me yesterday and wanted to know why.  I told him that Sedera was not allowing this and he told me that Misty sent him her link to re-enroll.  I will cancel old membership and see what happens.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-26 09:07:20', '2024-11-26 09:07:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152993072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081599002', 'Bettina Eckerle', NULL, '11.26.2024 Received an email via outlook from Bettina, requesting a good time to have that welcome call.
Vanessa is locking in a time with Bettina, and will call her manually, since the system is not allowing her to book formally. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-26 08:56:36', '2024-11-26 08:56:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152986017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107379001', 'Richard Wright', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request citing Financial Reasons.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-26 08:53:10', '2024-11-26 08:53:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153001008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152413020', 'Stacie Rogers', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call after start date of December 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-26 08:34:42', '2024-11-26 08:34:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000153000003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136950002', 'Carla Powderly', NULL, '11/26
Called Planstin to see if everything was in order with this member. The rep informed me she was active and that the mammogram should be covered at 100%. I gave Carla a callback and advised her to present her Planstin card and to specify she want a preventative mammogram and that her provider send the claim directly to planstin AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-26 08:25:01', '2024-11-26 08:25:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152993031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899314', 'Timothy Sparrow', NULL, '11/26
Patti has successfully transferred him into admin 123. waiting for IT to send over members'' files to ARM however, they want to inform members of the price increases before doing so. We are waiting for Leo to inform the member. According to Patti, he is currently partially secure/RCI should have gone over to arm $728+75 should be 862.00+75 smoker fee. On stand by AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-26 08:07:12', '2024-11-26 08:07:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152993026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, '11.26.2024 Spoke with Denise again today, and she buoyantly shared that she was successful in opening all her sharing requests, feels confident moving forward and is now just waiting on the paperwork from the hospital. I closed the CRM task. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-26 08:04:53', '2024-11-26 08:11:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152993011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125086009', 'Richard Kramer', NULL, '11.26.2024 Lori called to make sure her daughter is set to go to the OBGYN with a card, process and the do''s and don''t''s at the appointment.
I guided her through the process. We searched for her virtual card in Richard''s email, and did not find it, so I transferred her AFTER our call to Planstin.
I explained the MEC changes in January, and told her to expect new information coming through in December with details and cards. I also offered to send her preventive information from our end, to give her a head start on details and researching her providers. Sent her a review us template. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-26 07:51:49', '2024-11-26 07:51:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152998008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136950002', 'Carla Powderly', NULL, '11.26.24 Carla called stating she is on her way for her preventive mammogram. She presented her Planstin card, but received an email stating she would still owe a few hundred dollars. She will call back once she is at her appt. I offered to call Planstin, but looking at her file, it looks like she was transferred over to ARM, need to get accurate info her provider. HA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-11-26 07:41:16', '2024-11-26 07:41:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152993003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939464', 'Krista Irmischer', NULL, '11.26.2024 Followed up with Acelyn via groups Teams Chat, regarding the next step for Krista. Acelyn shared the following actions ~"Krista called for insurance, and opening a sharing request. The task is to follow up and see if she went through with it. She has been sent two emails, and I''m giving her some time because she has a big diagnosis" (Cancer according to the CRM Task). NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-26 07:26:55', '2024-11-26 07:28:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152986003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098475010', 'Oscar Granados', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment Update Form I will update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-26 07:04:29', '2024-11-26 07:04:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152886171', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154678123', 'Kevin Falardo', NULL, '11-25-24 Kevin and Kelly came to me via Andrea. I don''t think she worked with them before but they found her. They have Cigna now and paying $930. They have a baby on the way and want to make sure that Children''s Hospital is in the network. Dr. Jeanne Oh Kim is not showing up anywhere. They don''t have a Ped yet and didn''t have any other names to try. They do want to keep their PCP Dr. Sarah Ruth Logan and Dr. Jessica Ridgley (sp?).  They will inquire about some of pediatricians and get back to me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-25 20:57:56', '2024-11-25 20:57:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152886166', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151418001', 'Chris Georgeton', NULL, '11-25-24 I had to separate his account from Barbara (Bobbi) Georgeton''s account bc I haven''t been getting paid by Cigna for his account. I''m still waiting for their response. Now they chose to have the same plan for 2025. All records are in Bobbi''s account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-25 19:46:27', '2024-11-25 19:46:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152886161', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038076', 'Willow Aureala', NULL, '11-25-24 Willow is panicked by the price increase and was almost going to cancel. I let her know I have other options which she was thrilled to hear. However, she missed our appt today. Hopefully I''ll hear from her soon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-25 19:42:10', '2024-11-25 19:42:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152886156', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153586188', '(Boyce) Ben Ford', NULL, '11-25-24 Ben has selected me as his agent in C4. We will connect Dec. 4th to discuss.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-25 19:41:03', '2024-11-25 19:41:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152886151', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156399233', 'Jennifor Neeson', NULL, '11-25-24 Andrea got her husband Tim set up with Medicare. He''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-25 19:37:52', '2024-11-25 19:37:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152886143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156399233', 'Jennifor Neeson', NULL, '11-25-24 Selected me as her agent on C4 today. She has Cobra running through Jan. 31st, 2025. So, we need to wait until Jan. to choose her new plan assuming she wants Cobra.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-25 18:02:32', '2024-11-25 18:05:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152886138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153173005', 'Peter Ernst', NULL, '11-25-24 Diane and Peter enrolled in CARE+ EF, $1000/$672. They were referred by Maggie Tolan. The will have a Jan. 1st effective date. They also want to enroll in HAB EF but my email wouldn''t work. I verbalized the the instructions and sent the link to enroll. They will let me know when it''s done. I also let them know to select Jan. 1st effective date. One child''s name is Logan and the other John (?).', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-25 18:01:09', '2024-11-25 18:01:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152925043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046605028', 'Donald Spiegel', NULL, '11.25.2024 Via CRM task reminder, I called Donald to follow up and make sure he has a sharing request open, given the call I received on Friday of him searching for cancer clinics. No one answered and the VM was full and did not let me leave a message. I will email him via CRM. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-25 15:50:37', '2024-11-25 16:01:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152925038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516180', 'Samer Alhallak', NULL, '11.25.2024 Called Samer to follow up on opening the medical need with Sedera. He said that he opened it on Saturday, and uploaded all his bills and documents. He received an email today stating that his need was received. I will close the CRM task. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-25 15:44:40', '2024-11-25 15:44:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152886133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054986001', 'Ken Trombley', NULL, '11-25-24 Ken is turning 65 in Dec. 2024. He started to work with Andrea until he was connected to a local person by someone in his family. He prefers to be close by working with a local. He''s in C. Springs. He was very nice. I cancelled his plan and he will make sure to cancel his pmt with Kaiser as well.

