  ('zcrm_1579374000152925033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120981009', 'Anne Steegman', NULL, '11.25.2024 Called Anne  to follow up on opening the sharing request with Zion. I ended up leaving her a detailed VM. I will close the CRM task. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-25 14:44:45', '2024-11-25 14:44:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152886128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152284778', 'David Spear', NULL, '11-25-24 Shelby got a note from Medicaid saying they all qualify for Medicaid. However, their C4 account still looks in good standing with Sophie on CHP+. When I look at the income chart I have, they are just above the threshold and therefore qualify for APTC which makes their plan in Dec. at $0 and for 2025 $3+. I let her know in 2025 no plans will be $0. They have to submit a pmt. She already set up her initial and auto pay and will keep an eye out if the $0 changes to $1+. But, we will let this ride since her acct looks accurate with C4.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-25 14:33:21', '2024-11-25 14:33:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152877137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152891012', 'Valarie Jarvis', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fame $5000 IUA Secure w/ARM', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-25 14:19:02', '2024-11-25 14:19:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152886123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '11-25-24 Bobbi called back bc she may need PT. However, she thinks she will be a bunch and it shows 20 visits allowed and they are $130 a visit. With Cigna she struggled bc they forced the provider to redo the paper work after every 5 visits. She doesn''t want to go through that again. So, she will stick with her newly chosen RMHP $0 ded for 2025. We found both Dr. Connor Graham and Dr. Jennifer Godberg in the networ. Their cost is #1165.69 and APTC of $445.48 with $180K estimate for 2025.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-25 14:12:57', '2024-11-25 14:12:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152877132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152854043', 'Justin Pizzullo', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-25 14:12:52', '2024-11-25 14:12:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152886118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163576188', 'Daniel McCarthy', NULL, '11-25-24 Daniel removed me as his agent thinking that was connected to MCS. He chose a regular ins plan. He will add me back as his agent now that he understands. He didn''t use anyone else. I have already coached him on everything. I should see him fix this later today.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-25 14:03:19', '2024-11-25 14:03:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152877127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152854002', 'Arlene Thomas', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $1000 IUA Secure w/ARM', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-25 13:44:07', '2024-11-25 13:44:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152877122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152806002', 'Michele Avrea', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 IUA Premium HSA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-25 13:38:46', '2024-11-25 13:38:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152893064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125284001', 'Marianne Ricciardi', NULL, '11/25/24: Marianne called to discuss an upcoming mamm. Her prev mamm screening came up with inconclusive results and they now want to perform an ultrasound. We discussed that the prev versus diagnostic coding would be the factor on how it is covered by plan. If it is prev, then it is billed to planstin. If it is diagnostic, then she submit as sharing request and anything over her IUA can be eligible for sharing. 
She asked if there is a benefit to sticking with current plan/MCS group for a second year - I said yes, the pre-ex phase in period and explained how that worked and what would happen if she had a pre-ex and switched to a differed MCS group.
AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-25 13:35:31', '2024-11-25 13:35:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152933005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087734002', 'Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, '11.25.24:  Recvd. an email from Jocelyn on 11/22 asking me to help her switch back to Zion. She said it''s really important she maintain the same member ID # that she''s had w/Zion for years so any ongoing conditions where she has met her IUA remain covered. Said she doesn''t have the wherewithal to deal with any confusion.  Asked me to let her know what information we need from her for a successful transition. She wants the Zion  $1500 IUA option w/ DPC membership. Her DPC is Helen Tackitt w/Mebane Direct Primary Care. Said she tried signing up with our link but this practitioner is not listed. The office called Zion and she''s definitely on their list. Asked if I could help her with all this as her partner has been struggling a lot (has cancer) and she''s so overwhelmed. 
I checked the following info.:

The Zion plan she wants is:  Primary Care+ Healthshare
For age band 30 - 49 @ $1000 IUA for a MO, the monthly share fee is $298
- Consists of DPC and MCS  only
- No high cost preventive care screenings
- No Teledoc
- No Rx discount program w/Zion - DPC offers a limited discounted Rx program
- No mental health services
- No Concierge services

MPB Plan:  Direct
For age band 30 - 49 @ $1000 IUA for a MO, the monthly share fee is $300
- Consists of:  Telemedicine w/continuity of care, 24hrs. per day/7 days a week 
- Member Assistance Program, including mental health counseling sessions, life/work assistance and resources
- Concierge Assistance to research highest quality, fairest priced providers, labs, imaging and deepest discounted presciription medications and general membership guidance navigating med. needs
- Zion Preventive Care Program, including annual visit to any provider and high-cost screenings at their scheduled 

Jocelyn does not want to change her membership ID #, but, if she cancels her MPB Secure plan and switches to Zion''s Primary Care+ Healthshare plan, she will have to have a different membership ID # because she''ll be on a different platform w/Zion.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-25 13:31:58', '2024-11-26 11:38:32'),
