  ('zcrm_1579374000152805046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516180', 'Samer Alhallak', NULL, '11.22.2024 Omar had an IV infusion $19K in October when he ended up in the ER and was diagnosed with Myasthenia Gravis an immunocompromised disease.
