  ('zcrm_1579374000152766043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351133', 'Brian DeCamp', NULL, '11-22-24 Left Brian a vm for our call now. They are paying $806.50 now and looks to be increasing to $868 for 2025.  When we talked he shared that they are DPC members with Dr. Tusek with Cloud Medical. They just moved to Salida but still plan to use their local providers and Dr. Tusek''s services. He wanted to know if there were any reimbursements for his DPC. I shared HAB with him and the prices which I sent to him as a follow up are as folows:
