  ('zcrm_1579374000152730057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904687', 'Mike Gardner', NULL, 'Members mother called in and told me that her son had passed away out of the country and she wanted to cancel.  She also asked about the Zion end of like benefit.  I directed her to contact Zion to ask about the timing of the cancellation in relation to this.  I will send her the cancellation request.  Mothers email ccgardner22@gmail.com', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-22 11:54:03', '2024-11-22 11:54:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152730052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742001', 'Abigail Chan', NULL, '11.22.2024 Abigail called to  for guidance on how to break down the events that most likely will need sharing via Zion. The requests unfortunately are for the newborn, Ada-Born 9/17. Ada, right after being delivered, she was admitted to the Special care unit to get help in oxygen. There, she was diagnosed with a heart murmur, and needed to get an EKG - which from what Abigail was sharing, will be ongoing.
Now Ada, was also in a breach position, and that resulted into an ultrasound, xray in 4 months, to screen for hip dysplasia.
I was unsure if the heart murmur incident would be a separate IUA or included in the maternity sharing request, so I explained the max # of IUA''s in a rolling year and urged her to repeat her question to Zion to gather 1st hand accurate information to her sharing needs.
I did ensure her that the 3rd item is definitely a separate IUA, and explained how and where she can open her sharing requests from. Abigail was receptive and informative, and ready to speak with Zion. I transferred her. I will create a ticket. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-22 11:48:40', '2024-11-22 12:02:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152730047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109179002', 'Corey Vincent', NULL, '11.22.2024 Corey called to get help accessing CirrusMD to get his wife set up and get her eye drops of some sort. I explained that Christie, his wife, needs to log in herself. I sent her a registration link, and it turns out she is already registered. That was perfect, I told him, and that all she needs to do is get on their website or app, and change her passcode. They will ask all the appropriate questions, and I confirmed with him that they do ON OCCASION prescribe refills, as long as the meds are not controlled meds, and they prefer that the patient is being seen in person by someone.
Corey did ask about weight loss shots, and I shared that Zion does have it in their guidelines to share up to $3000, AFTER the IUA (Corey''s IUA is $5000) per sharing request.
He is considering lowering the IUA, but will speak to Analisa Cleland first, his advisor. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-22 11:37:08', '2024-11-22 12:11:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152766028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009850101', 'Elizabeth Spano', NULL, '11-22-24 She decided to join HAB for Dec. 1st, 2024. She knows of the new cancellation and reactivation policy since she was asking about when she''s allowed to cancel. She is excited to use it for mental health and all of the other items.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-22 11:32:55', '2024-11-22 11:32:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152731038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131650002', 'Michael Weigand', NULL, '11/22/24: Member called needing help scheduling her mammogram. I walked her through how to search PHCS network. We found a list of options for her. She says she never got ARM card. Will put in request and create task for Acelyn. Let member know it would be probably be Monday before getting the replacement card to her -  otherwise, it should be in her email under the subject line "Access Your Benefits". She said that''d be fine. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-22 11:28:55', '2024-11-22 11:28:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152716033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122052002', 'Ankur Patel', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR life code cards to members. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-22 11:25:21', '2024-11-22 11:25:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152731033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126854002', 'Rachel Johnson', NULL, '11/21/24: Rachel called, very upset, confused, and scared about a recent Zion determination. She''s not clear on what her plan covers and has been through a couple miscarriages at this point. She vented on the phone about the issue for a while. I let her talk it out and then offered a solution that we could help her with:
1. Appeal to Zion, Fill out PHI form, and allow us to help through the process and speak to Zion on your behalf. 
2. Let us perform a search for the tests and labs her midwife is suggesting she needs to provide the best price/place options
3. I will personally provide a comprehensive overview of her plan info so she knows exactly what is available to her. 

Rachel agreed to this plan, and is on board. I brought Zion in on the call and coached Rachel on how to fill it out, and provided her with the lab quote form via email. I left a message for Walter (Zion determination officer) to give me a call back so I can obtain his contact into to discuss Rachel''s sharing request. 

Emailed lab quote form
Emailed Plan Overview and Member Handbook
Received info from her to help consult her on appeal process. 
Spoke to Walter at Zion who offered the following advice:
Determined not eligible bc it''s related to fertility. If member can point towards other symptoms like pelvic pain etc then there is a possibility expenses could be shared as a separate sharing request. 
AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-22 11:04:46', '2024-11-22 14:32:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152730039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125086002', 'Susan Konya', 'Decline of 12/24 Share Amount', '11/22-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm not a good number
