  ('zcrm_1579374000152766003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153586188', '(Boyce) Ben Ford', NULL, '11-22-24 Ben is 48 now and a contractor. He will review his taxes again but he thinks he makes about $46K MAGI. DOB 9-5-76. He will be claiming his youngest daughter, Phoebe on his taxes for 2025. His older daughter will be on her mom''s taxes. Youngest is on CHP+. He wants to be able to see a dermatologist, do well checks but mostly healthy. There are some super cheap bronze plans and reasonably priced silver plans. He also wants to review 1dental. His dentist Dr. Michael Christopher is in the Dental Access network in Longmont at Mtn View address.  He will call C4 to login to his account, select me as his agent and we''ll proceed. He will do that over the weekend or today. He wants to get it all done. No meds, no tobacco.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-22 10:48:19', '2024-11-22 10:49:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152716013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000147520065', 'Zachary Asatani', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member filled out form to update address and submitted. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-22 10:27:47', '2024-11-22 10:27:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152730034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133844002', 'Alex Woelfel-Smith', NULL, '11.22.2024 Alex called to learn how to proceed to use the benefits for a maternity journey. His wife, according to a home test is 5 weeks conceived. They have their initial visit, 1st week of December appt to verify all the factors.
