  ('zcrm_1579374000152731013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122615027', 'Sean Conroy', NULL, '11/22/24: Sally called to find a place to get a mammogram. We searched PHCS network and I emailed her a list of options from search. Also let her know that Planstin will pay for in or out of network, so if there is a place she is familiar with and the provider will bill planstin directly, then that is fine too. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-22 09:44:00', '2024-11-22 09:44:00'),
