  ('zcrm_1579374000152731008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, '11/22/24: Called - unable to reach. Emailed Kristen apologizing for recent billing error and letting her know that a refund has been processed. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-22 09:26:52', '2024-11-22 09:26:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152720003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, '11.22.24 Wendy submitted a ticket that Kristen was charged 2x. 1st for her old plan (Secure) and 2nd for her new plan (Care+). A refund has been processed, IT notified to double check records to make sure this was an isolated incident. Concierge will contact Kristen with an apology. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-11-22 09:09:13', '2024-11-22 09:09:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152716008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047033001', 'Robert Meyerson', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after start date of December 1, 2024. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-22 09:05:40', '2024-11-22 09:05:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152666026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130072002', 'Noel Khan', NULL, '11/21/24: Called Noel to deliver results I found out about the doctor she emailed to us. LVM. AM

She wanted to know if he is in network. When searching, I never found that exact drs name ( Damian J. Bass - 6370 West Union Hills, AZ - 85308) in PHCS network, however all other drs that work in that office and hospital (Arrowhead Hospital) were listed in the network. Called the office to confirm, and while the front office attendant couldn''t give me a specific answer, she said they would call and verify how to send claim prior to appt. 
