  ('zcrm_1579374000152601041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152571065', 'Debra Nehlig', NULL, '10-28-24 Deb came via Dr. Mary Ellen Francescani. She''s losing her benefits Jan. 1st. Lives in PA, healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco. Yes for mammo, colonoscopy, vision, derm, etc. She teaches yoga and pilates. She will be a DPC member at Middleway Wellness. Choosing Care+ $352 and HAB $124 = $476 - $70 for DPC = $406 plus $125/$25.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-21 12:07:15', '2024-11-21 12:07:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152621013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091063002', 'Melissa Primmer', NULL, '11.21.2024 Melissa called to get help accessing her Zion member portal. We did a 3Way call and spoke to Illana, who helped her all the way through. Melissa was good to go. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-21 11:53:54', '2024-11-21 11:53:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152601028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152571038', 'Ian Fallenius', NULL, '11-21-24 Ian is a long time client of Bev''s. He and his parents were her clients. He''s 35, healthy, no tobacco,  just meds for anxiety and sleep such as prazalam and prazadone. He had looked at Anthem Off Mkt Bronze and Silver plans for $565 or $515. He was very happy to learn about MCS and is thrilled to join Premium Care $285+HAB$107 = $392 with 10x better benefits than the Anthem plans with a $7200 MOP. He joined for Jan. 1st, 2025 start for both. He does wellness 1x, dental 2x, skin maybe, gym monthly $30, flu vax, full labs and 3rd IUA as bonus. He''s all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-21 11:43:41', '2024-11-21 11:59:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152562038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065985001', 'Denise Uhlig', NULL, '11/21/24: Denise called asking what her plan is to verify pricing. We then discussed how to change IUA and what an IUA is and how it works. I did a quick RX quote for her over the phone for NP Thyroid and offered to see if it can be sourced internationally as well. Emailed Tommy to see. Emailed Denise Member Change form in case she wants to change IUA. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-21 11:39:20', '2024-11-21 11:39:20'),
