  ('zcrm_1579374000152621008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046605028', 'Donald Spiegel', NULL, '11.21.2024 Lisette from cancer facility called to confirm eligibility of treatment and pain management for Donald. I went through the HIPAA compliance, and gave her general information. I urged her to connect with Donald to have us in the picture, in order to move forward in the right steps with a sharing request through Zion.  Will create a task for this. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-21 11:32:32', '2024-11-21 11:32:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152621003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075132176', 'Mary Marchwinski', NULL, '11.21.2024 Maddie called to get her MPB portal credentials, and to confirm the payment went through, cz it was not showing in her bank statement at all. I checked for both, and we both tried her MPB portal log in successfully. After sharing about the MEC change, it quickly turned into a "IDK if this is the right membership conversation....."....etc. 
I was trying to help her be proactive, cz she''s a Planstin member, and shared the change to ARM soon in Jan. She was not aware of the MEC change. I looked at her emails in the CRM, and the LAST one that shows for me that she received is back in 2022 (snippet attached). The last one she sees in HER inbox, is this last April, I think. She has not received any of the new information regarding MEC, MPB app, Price Increase.....etc. So  it''s fair to say, I threw her a robust curveball, when attempting to make her aware of just 1 of those items.
I reached out to the team in Teams group chat, and tagged Kelly in hopes she can get information out to her. 
************************************************************************
Travis reached out to Maddie via email guiding her in the process of changing her MEC portion with us. Maddie did sign up under Planstin directly, so she will need to cancel that first and re-enroll with us, using the appropriate dates. Travis coached her on that in detail via email, and Cc''d her advisor.
I additionally shared a message in the Sale Group Chat that offers Travis additional insight.
"I hope Maddie (Mary), will find that information useful, and definitely connects with you for guidance. She needs it.  
 She mentioned a concern regarding her longevity she''s accumulated so far, and any diagnosis that she''s been getting treatment on.
I''m sharing this to share, that I think she has too many moving pieces in her current membership (use of services that is), that is causing her some anxiety, when hearing she needs to change." NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-21 11:24:10', '2024-11-21 13:17:14'),
