  ('zcrm_1579374000152601008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038124', 'Isabelle Laak', NULL, '11-21-24 Isabelle chose to drop the MEC since she doesn''t do traditional wellness screenings. She''s a health coach, body worker and chooses alternative care. They only used the membership 1x since inception for her husband''s shoulder injury. He just needed an injection about 3 years ago and he''s been good ever since. She thanked me to my services bc it allowed her to quit her corporate job and now do the works she''s passionate about. She was initially upset by the price increase fro m$561 to $633. But, once I let her know she can drop the MEC which will bring her contribution down to $510 a month, she is thrilled!  She has an HSA account already from a previous job. I let her know she can fund it in 2024 and not in 2025. She was fine with that as well. Doesn''t sound like she''s funded it since her other job.  She and her husband are both 61. She was incredibly appreciative and thankful! So, so nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-21 10:28:52', '2024-11-21 10:28:52'),
