  ('zcrm_1579374000152562003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108605009', 'Stephany Cecelia Mandryk', NULL, '11/21/24: Stephany called. Her daughter broke her arm playing on playground and she wanted a refresher on how to handle doctors appointments. I advised to present as self pay, make sure she collects itemized statements and bills for all visits, all prescribed treatment relating to the injury can be put under this request. She''s going to open a request today and is familiar with process from her recent maternity request. Let her know we would follow up but please reach out if she has any other questions or issues. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-21 07:21:01', '2024-11-21 07:21:01'),
