  ('zcrm_1579374000152441059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '11-20-24 Their son Kyle has had a nightmare year with some new health issues that nobody could figure ut until recently. They''ve spent about $70K with only about $7 in reimbursement from Zion!!! OMG! He had to come home from Indiana University bc his health was too bad. Zion isn''t paying for many labs, ER visits, etc., etc. They shared for about an hour explaining the nightmare. I asked Michael to send me the communications to see if I can help at all. They submitted everything on time. They have seen the most qualified drs. who are Harvard Trained and work at John Hopkins, etc.  They now think he has micro-plasma pneumonia. Hilary suspects it''s from the 2 covid vax but no real way to prove it. It all started shortly after he got them. He now has autoimmune problems, neuro inflammation, etc. Zion is not treating them well. They already appealed and were told after one appeal there''s nothing more they can do. They are contemplating switching to reg ins for Kyle and possibly for the entire family. Hilary and Micheal are both retired. They set their income to $125K. I think they are living off investments. They might get a decent APTC for the family if they have to move in that direction.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-20 21:53:48', '2024-11-20 21:53:48'),
