  ('zcrm_1579374000152389041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141229002', 'Jessica Giles', NULL, '11/20/24: Jessica called wanting to know how to submit bills. I let her know that I''m not familiar with the Health Access Benefit Guidelines but would do a little research and email her to let her know. She asked if she could submit her bills to Zion as a sharing request. I advised that yes, she could if they weren''t 6 months old and all related to a specific incident, as each incident is subject to an IUA. She said they are all related to a gut issue. I educated her on how to start a sharing request and trans to Zion to open member portal. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-20 10:04:48', '2024-11-20 10:04:48'),
