  ('zcrm_1579374000152389006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083369001', 'Melanie Lamere', NULL, '11/20/24: Melanie called saying that she got an email from America''s Pharmacy saying they are gong out of business and wants to know if there are other options? I said I don''t know - and am unaware of that but will do some digging and reach back out to her via email.
