  ('zcrm_1579374000152326200', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151170108', 'Lynn Thomas', NULL, 'Member called and spoke to the Concierge letting them know that she was recently on a Zion membership with her husband who will be cancelling eff 11/30 due to getting VA benefits.   She enrolled w/Sedera prior to knowing that she now needs hip replacement surgery.  Due to the fact that the surgery would be totally out-of-pocket she wants now to enroll with Zion.  Leo helped her with the change form and she will be filling out the Advisor Change form.  I have re-enrolled her in the Secure membership and cancelled her enrollment w/Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-19 13:46:21', '2025-01-23 10:25:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152227111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151170108', 'Lynn Thomas', NULL, '11/19/24: Lynn called with a few questions relating to an upcoming hip replacement surgery she needs to have. She is worried about it being flagged as pre-ex since she is now on a new plan and not her husbands. 
