  ('zcrm_1579374000152298130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152284778', 'David Spear', NULL, '11-18-24 Shelby called bc her account was working finally except the family groups were messed up. It wouldn''t allow them to be in the same group. I figured out their addresses were set to an old address for Shelby and Sophie. I fixed their addresses to be the same as David''s and it worked. Looks like Sophiie may qualify for CHP+ which she believes is true. So, they will apply for just David and Shelby for Dec. 2024 and then again for Jan. 2025. There are some great plans at $0 for them for 2024. She will choose and send me an email when she''s done. I will check on it all. I told her to wait 10 days and contact them to make payment. All set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-19 11:58:17', '2024-11-19 11:58:17'),
