  ('zcrm_1579374000152238104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142370033', 'Michael Llerandi', NULL, '11.19.2024 Valerie put in a script request. However, additional details are needed in order to proceed. I called Valerie on (720) 552-0879, and left a details message to call us back and what it is regarding. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-19 09:34:16', '2024-11-19 09:34:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152238099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212047', 'Luther Setzer', NULL, '11.19.2024 Picked up a SalesIQ chat from Acelyn for Luther Setzer regarding the breakdown on the MEC charges from Planstin to ARM.
