  ('zcrm_1579374000152297013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144180003', 'Robert Hogan', NULL, '11.18.2024 Robert called needing to submit his bills from a surgery he had last month. I asked him if he has all of his documents on hand, but he was not sure. I told it is ok. His first step is to open a member portal with Zion, and from there he will have the option to open a sharing request. Within the sharing request he will be able to fulfill that $1000 IUA, if he has not done so. 
