  ('zcrm_1579374000152268003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605213', 'Allison Lemke', NULL, '11.18.24 - Received a response from Sedera stating her medical release form is incomplete. Updated the form requirements (expiration date and authorized party), forwarding back to the Concierge to reach out to Allision to finish completion.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-11-18 09:26:36', '2024-11-18 09:26:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152227028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099710012', 'Shane Lebsack', NULL, '11/18/24: Linda called. Her husband is going to end up needing carpel tunnel surgery and wondering if their IUA restarts at beginning of calendar year. I explained that it doesn''t. We also discussed going ahead and submitting the need, what can go under this issue, 12 month rolling period. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-18 09:21:16', '2024-11-18 09:21:16'),
