  ('zcrm_1579374000152227023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101128002', 'Christine Altamuro', NULL, '11/18/24: Followed up about Christine''s issue with showing as cancelled through Zion. Zion wouldn''t give me any info over the phone (of course) and I sat on hold for too long trying to get in touch with Planstin. Sent Kaitlyn and email asking for an update. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-18 08:22:56', '2024-11-18 08:22:56'),
