  ('zcrm_1579374000152246003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000147691008', 'Michelle Aguirre-Stevens', NULL, 'Spoke to member she needed to reschedule welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-18 08:06:41', '2024-11-18 08:06:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152227008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120816002', 'Michael Lam', NULL, '11/18/24: Alyssa called wondering if she can use Cirrus for quick care with her plan. I explained yes, she can use it 24/7 - it''s included in the plan and she doesn''t have to pay for visits through it. She was worried about how they will know she''s part of MPB. I assured her it''s fine - that they have her records from us and will be able to recogize her based on her name and MPB membership ID number. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-18 07:19:42', '2024-11-18 07:19:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152227003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132899338', 'Larry Parsley', NULL, '11/18/24: Retha called over the weekend - kind of frantic bc Larry was in the ER and she states that their membership number is not right and they never got a new card. Called back and LVM for Retha to call us. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-18 07:17:29', '2024-11-18 07:17:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152147040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438013', 'Drew Cifrodelli', NULL, '11-15-24 Drew must keep Redirect to meet the mandate in NJ. HAB does not help on that front. I let him know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-15 21:53:33', '2024-11-15 21:53:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152152076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146489002', 'Anna Nadasdy', NULL, '11.15.2024 Spoke with Anna today and addressed her scripts concerns. She attempted telehealth to get additional 4 packages of LEVONORGESTREL-ETH ESTRADIOL and a refill of Valacyclovir. The telehealth doctor at the time was not confident in increasing Anna''s LEVONORGESTREL-ETH ESTRADIOL''s script, even with the guidance she offered. I suggested that she start a chat while I was on the phone with her, and use specific verbiage to assure them that she is being monitored by another physician and she did. The telehealth doctor TODAY, prescribed her what she needed and I clipped a coupon for her and sent it via CRM. She will connect with us when she is ready to clip a coupon for Valacyclovir. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 17:31:14', '2024-11-15 17:31:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152147035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152189003', 'Sheri McCrone', NULL, '11-15-24 Sheri accidentally lost her 2024 APTC when she tried to update her info for 2025. So, I put her employment and income back in at the $38K she had. That gave her the APTC back and her cost will be $97.77 for Dec. For Jan. 1st onward we put her income in at $22K bc she doesn''t want Medicaid and is hoping to have a new job by April of 2025. So, this is her best estimate for now until that changes. Her APTC is $1018.  She chose these plans for 2024 and 2025.

