  ('zcrm_1579374000152157074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079912009', 'Stephen Wetterling', NULL, '11.15.24:  Emailed Elizabeth, informing her of a less expensive alternative to her DIRECT plan. Asked to schedule some time to discuss this plan if she is interested.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 15:29:14', '2024-11-15 15:29:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152184003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143070002', 'Christopher Darling', NULL, 'Patti notified me the Christopher is cancelling. I called him, left a message to call me back. I will try again on Monday.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-11-15 15:26:53', '2024-11-15 15:26:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152152037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212047', 'Luther Setzer', NULL, '11.15.2024 Called Luther to let him know that the app is up and running. He was driving, so he could not do the trial test with me. He said he will attempt it later and call us if he had any issues. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 15:16:05', '2024-11-15 15:17:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152152032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122246010', 'Mikaila Cameron', NULL, '11.15.2024 Mikaila called to confirm if her sharing request application went through, since she did not receive anything back from Zion. I asked if she would like me to stay on the phone with her, she said it''s ok to go ahead and transfer her. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 15:13:23', '2024-11-15 15:13:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152157069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091292', 'Carl Cheetham', NULL, '11.15.24:  Emailed Carl to suggest we schedule a mtg. to discuss pricing and other plan options he may find that are a better fit for him and his family. Asked him to let me know his availability. JSP', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 15:10:32', '2024-11-20 14:03:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152157064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101128002', 'Christine Altamuro', NULL, '11/15/24: Called Christine back letting her know that Planstin is reaching out to Zion to address the issue. It might take a day or two for the files to officially transfer, but to not worry - it will all be fixed prior to her surgery. Will followup on Monday. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 15:01:11', '2024-11-15 15:01:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152147019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974202', 'Sarah Mandell', NULL, '11-15-24 Sarah and I went over her membership again. She had a recent procedure and maybe another one soon for skin/dermatological purposes. Her current bill is just over $1000. I told her to call the MPB Concierge for help and gave her the #. She will do so. She lives in Carbondale and is a perfect candidate for HAB. She prefers alternative drs. thermograms and she just called a nutritional health counselor for help on that front! She will hold off until Dec. 1st to move forward with that. She does everything on the list for HAB she said. She will pay $459 total CARE+ $350 2024 then $352 2025 +$107. If she remained on Secure HSA it would be $419. It''s a no brainer for her. Sounds like she never really used Planstin. She didn''t know about CirrusMD. I will email her about supplements as well. I forgot to remind her of that.  She dropped MEC on change form and enrolled in HAB for Dec. 1st, 2024 EO. She hasn''t funded an HSA yet. I let her know she could fund it up until Dec. 1st if she wants to.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-15 14:48:58', '2024-11-15 14:50:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152157051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119464002', 'Sandra Chase', NULL, '11/15/24: Sandra called wanting to change IUA and access member portal. Provided her credentials and navigated her to form to update IUA. She asked what the 2024 prices would be to change IUA - transferred to Patti. I do not have old price sheets. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 14:43:12', '2024-11-15 14:43:12'),
