  ('zcrm_1579374000152157031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590075', 'Jason Adams', NULL, '11/15/24: Dawne called asking where to go to get a colonoscopy. I guided her to the PHCS network, and how to search for a colon surgeon through the list. Also advised her that she could get a recommendation from her PCP since this is a routine procedure that they likely recommend to many people - since Planstin will pay for in or out of network, she has some freedom when it comes to choosing a place to have it done. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 14:16:50', '2024-11-15 14:16:50'),
