  ('zcrm_1579374000152157003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176659017', 'Candace Lucas', NULL, '11.15.24:  Called Candace. Discussed her current needs. I recommended the Premium Care plan, since she said they wouldn''t need the HSA option. I explained each service of this plan, Sedera''s pre-x schedule  and the features of Sedera''s MCS program. I didn''t have the 3 Rx quotes ready for her so I told her I would send them when they were available. She said she likes this plan and thinks it would suit their needs. I quoted monthly fees at $500, $1000 and $1500 IUA amounts and told her I would email her my website so she and her husband could review the plan details. She said she''d get in touch once they''ve discussed the plan.  Emailed her my site.  JSP', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 13:24:28', '2024-11-20 14:08:24'),
