  ('zcrm_1579374000152152003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101128002', 'Christine Altamuro', NULL, '11.15.2024 Showing cancelled in Zion''s system. Is having surgery in 2 weeks. 
spoke with William at Planstin, who pulled her up in their system, and shared that it might be an integration file issue that cancelled her account. 
