  ('zcrm_1579374000152147003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143664002', 'Mary Ellen Francescani', NULL, '11-15-24 Wendy,

This is Nora Francescani Skinner - I''m Mary Ellen''s sister.  Mary is here with me and asked me to write to you from her computer.

There''s been a terrible accident - last Tuesday night, Jerry died suddenly while riding a bike at night.  Mary Ellen wanted to get in touch with you so that you can contact the insurance company to let them know what''s happening and also to stop the insurance payments effective immediately.

You can call Mary Ellen, and/or call me - I''m at 917-304-8475.

Thanks very much, Wendy,

-Nora

I''ve notified Patti and she requested the change form to be filled out. I sent that to them to complete before Nov. 19th so the billing is updated on time. So brutal!!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-15 12:45:30', '2024-11-15 12:46:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152111018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070370083', 'Earl Thibault', 'New Membership eff 12/24', 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-15 12:33:13', '2024-11-15 12:33:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152111013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070370083', 'Earl Thibault', NULL, 'Member submitted request to increase IUA to $2500 eff 12/1 due to the 2025 price increase. I will process &amp; notify Planstin', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-15 12:32:14', '2024-11-15 12:32:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152124003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152070028', 'Delia Gray', NULL, '11-15-24 We went over the illustration via video conference. Delia applied for NLG 30YR Term $150K with bank draft on the 13th of every month. We need to authorize it first. She had a perfect application with no pre-x, no meds, nothing. The only reason it didn''t auto approve is because her mom passed away at age 54 from a stroke/aneurysm. Her dad died sooner around age 52 from a drunk driver hitting him. She landed in foster care. She''s very sweet and happy. We will wait for the response from NLG and get close to $25. At Standard it''s only $28.51 or so. She understands the value of life insurance bc she and her sister had to pay off her mom''s debts into adulthood bc she didn''t have a life ins. policy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-15 12:20:46', '2024-11-15 12:53:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152031056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120543002', 'Alex Friedman', NULL, '11/15/24: Alex called. He recently was in hospital for stroke and wondering how it''s all going to work. I explained the basics of opening a sharing request and how Zion issues funds. He is going to give us a call back once he receives the bill. Let him know about 6 month deadline. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 12:19:07', '2024-11-15 12:19:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152111008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133945002', 'Gary McIntyre', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation eff 12/24 due to getting Employer Benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-15 12:14:26', '2024-11-15 12:14:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152111003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152049236', 'Julia Starr', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 IUA Premium HSA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-15 12:10:02', '2024-11-15 12:10:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152034086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108036002', 'Julia Starr', NULL, 'Member will be cancelling this membership and will be re-enrolling in the Premium HSA eff 12/24.  I will process &amp; let Planstin know', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-15 11:59:46', '2024-11-15 11:59:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152084038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109089002', 'Ralph Holding', NULL, '11.15.2024 Ralph called to learn how to proceed with his preventive appointments he would like to attend soon. I explained that his membership is purely for large medical bills only. We talked about Healtcare Bluebook, and I sent him the resources to have on hand. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 11:53:24', '2024-11-15 11:53:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152034081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106407002', 'Maria Faria', NULL, 'Member''s spouse called in and asked about the 2025 price increase.  I advised that since that had not had a price increase in 2024, price was going up now.  Member then went direct to Zion and of course got a cheaper price.  After speaking with Leo he submitted cancellation eff 12/24.  I will process.  Member also requested deletion of Payment Methods.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-15 11:39:44', '2024-11-15 11:39:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152034076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126261002', 'Matthew Turner', NULL, 'Member called in and wants to add newborn to membership.  I will send out Change Form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-15 11:39:20', '2024-11-15 11:39:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152084028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135601021', 'James Todd Neill', NULL, '11.15.2024 Todd called to make sure his membership has been cancelled. I assured him, based on Patti''s notes that he indeed is cancelled. He asked if he could get reimbursed for partial of November, which I''m not familiar with such practice with MPB, so I reached out to Patti via Team''s group chat........NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 11:31:18', '2024-11-15 11:31:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152031051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080945002', 'Macay Hunter', NULL, '11/15/24: Macay Hunter called to ask about price increase. He also wants to change the primary account holder to his wife. Let him know I would research how to do this and email him with what I find out. 
Emailed Macay letting him know that to switch primary, he would need to cancel his membership and re-enroll with wife as primary. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 11:27:06', '2024-11-15 14:53:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152031046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128525010', 'Paula Lueske', NULL, '11/15/24: Paula emailed with the following question:
I noticed that my monthly contribution increased in Oct from $334 to $360.  Why the price increase in Oct?
Replied to Paula letting her know the price fluctuation is reflects her annual $25 membership fee and her contribution for November will go back to $334. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 11:26:06', '2024-11-15 11:26:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152058063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151016001', 'Candice Worthan', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call after start date of December 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 11:17:34', '2024-11-15 11:17:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152031041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109168010', 'Robert Robison', NULL, '11/15/24: Robert called to discuss rate increase. I let him know his new rate. He found it upsetting but let him know it''s beyond our control. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 11:17:02', '2024-11-15 11:17:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152058053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151140002', 'Jane Wise', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to schedule welcome call after start date of December 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 11:12:44', '2024-11-15 11:12:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152084020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021903103', 'Jodi Anglin', NULL, '11.15.2024 Jodi called to learn if her membership would decrease in premium is one of her dependents exits, and if that dependent is able to open their own membership, now that he is turning 26. I did ask the group in teams chat to share the price list, but I did not hear back prior to Jodi hanging up with me.
I did refer her to speak to her advisor on the financial details and qualifications of a member with a MEC membership. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 10:50:00', '2024-11-15 10:50:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152034071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109662001', 'Kim Kuhljuergen', NULL, 'Member called in because he needs to cancel because he has other coverage eff 1/1/25.  I advised him to submit after 12/1 and contact Jane.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-15 10:30:19', '2024-11-15 10:30:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152034066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109000002', 'Ronald Ware', 'New Membership eff 12/24', 'Member Only $ 2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-15 10:23:42', '2024-11-15 10:23:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152031036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109090013', 'Clinton Sexton', NULL, '11/15/24: Clint called unable to access member portal. Emailed credentials and form to update address as he said he''ll be in Florida for the time being. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 10:19:18', '2024-11-15 10:19:18'),
