  ('zcrm_1579374000152084003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286167', 'Catherine McGee', NULL, '11.15.2024 Catherine called to get clarification on the max amount that can be offered for an existing medical condition with her knee. She''s planning to have the knee surgery after her membership anniversary, Feb 2nd, with will reach her cap of sharing on pre-X conditions to $125K, according to Zion''s Rep.
