Opened her own account on February with Zion. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 10:11:48', '2024-11-15 11:01:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152034053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568091', 'Caterina Savino', NULL, 'Member call in and wanted to change her membership due to price increase.  I will send her out the Change Form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-15 10:11:08', '2024-11-15 10:11:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152031026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131784019', 'Nicolle Mackey', NULL, '11/15/24: Returned Nicolle''s vm. She had questions about vendor changeover. Explained that she didn''t need to do anything with the previous form and that is will auto switch effective jan 1 and to expect a new card digitally and through the mail. Also explained to Nicolle how to find providers using multiplan search PHCS/Prac and Anc. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 10:03:11', '2024-11-15 10:03:11'),
