  ('zcrm_1579374000152031016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123828002', 'Patricia Buchek', NULL, '11/15/24: Patricia called super confused about her plan and how to use it. I educated her on the major aspects of her plan - Zion, Cirrus and other ancillary benefits plus what to do in case of emergency and went over MANY other circumstances. Introduced her to quote forms and appointment setting.
