  ('zcrm_1579374000152035003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123883002', 'Kiya Wiedis', NULL, '11/15
KIya called to ask why her t dap shot was not covered I informed her that through Planstin only shots with in the ACA guidelines are covered. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 07:36:28', '2024-11-15 07:36:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152034003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130667002', 'Sarah Mclaren', NULL, 'Member emailed in and told me that they now have healthcare thru spouse''s employer.  I sent het the cancellation link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-15 07:34:20', '2024-11-15 07:34:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152031008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '11:15.24:  Texted Jessica haven''t received her invite and asked if we''re still on for our mtg. today at 11:30 a.m. EST. Suggested a phone call if she prefers.
Called Jessica.  She said she will go with whatever I suggest as she trusts my judgement. We discussed her only option (in CA) is to stay with Secure HSA (Zion) and transition from Planstin MEC to ARM MEC. I told her that her new monthly fee will be increased from $300 to $419/mo. due to the 2025 Zion price increase and her transition into the 50-65 age band.  She said she was ok with that.  I confirmed w/Patti that Jess doesn''t have to fill out any change forms - that this transition will be automatically managed by MPB as of 1/1/25.  Emailed Jess and relayed that to her. Told her to contact me with any questions about ARM, etc.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 07:28:54', '2024-11-15 13:32:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000152031003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '11:08.24:  Jessica emailed. Wants to meet on Friday, 11.15.24. @ 11:30 a.m. Said she''d send an invite to do a video chat. I  responded ok, I''d look for her invite.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-15 07:27:23', '2024-11-15 07:29:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151836217', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154481201', 'Tammy Steele', NULL, '11-14-24 Playing phone tag with Tami. She is Bev''s client.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-14 21:21:50', '2024-11-14 21:21:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151836212', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152189003', 'Sheri McCrone', NULL, '11-14-24 Sheri''s C4 account looks wrong. She''s earning $25K and no APTC. It''s asking more questions which I need her answers re self-employment. I left her a vm to call me when she''s free. This is Bev''s client.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-14 21:19:08', '2024-11-14 21:19:08'),
