  ('zcrm_1579374000151836202', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163967002', 'Alicia Thompson', NULL, '11-14-24 Alicia is looking to retire in June and wants to know possible price range for budgeting purposes. She was referred by Pam Buderus. She''s already been looking at Zion and Sedera prices online. She doesn''t want mental health. She''s 63 or will be by June, 2025. She had $250 in mind at the $1000 IUA from poking around Zion. I told her the range could be up to $400 depending on what she chooses for wellness and such. We''ve scheduled an appt for April 25th at 1:00 already. I need to transfer it to my new calendar when I get it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-14 21:06:38', '2024-11-14 21:06:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151836197', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819577', 'Nanci Alpert', NULL, '11-14-24 Nanci Alpert is interested in HAB. She has CARE+ CV with Sedera and No MEC. She''s a member with Cloud DPC. So, she can pay $124 and get reimbursed $70 per month, so its only $54 for the rest of the wellness not offered by Cloud, dental, vision, labs, mammo, etc. She will make a final decision very soon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-14 20:19:46', '2024-12-10 16:19:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151818138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146489002', 'Anna Nadasdy', NULL, '11.14.2024 Rcvd an email from Anna via Outlook stating a variety of requests that revolve around telehealth, and several prescriptions. I found her email to be unclear, and called her to break the email down and confirm a few items on the medications she mentions. I ended up leaving her a detailed VM. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-14 17:03:31', '2024-11-14 17:03:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151836184', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151966021', 'Lucas Normand', NULL, '11-14-24 Lucas Normand is an employee of Ironwood Marketing with Tyler Fritz. Tyler will reimburse him $200 per month for his membership with MPB.  He''s healthy, no tobacco, no smoking, just wellbutrin med for mental health. He''d like to go to counseling 2x per month, if possible. He watched the video which was super helpful bc Tyler tried explaining and he was confused. He is happy with Premium Care $237/$1000 and HAB $107 since he wants the mental health, wellness, dental, vision, skin check (he''s red head with pale skin he said), gym, vax. The only thing he said no to is nutritional health. Also, he likes  IUA protection. He lives in NH and no mandate there. He joined both successfully. He did HAB on his own bc he had to get his checking account info which is now complete. I did not receive his welcome email. Now I see why bc Karen Torsoe is wrongly getting credited for his account. I''ve submitted a ticket to resolve ASAP.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-14 16:20:33', '2024-11-14 16:41:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151818133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138128002', 'Justin Caid', NULL, '11.14.2024 Justin called to open two sharing requests with Zion and add two more dependents onto the plan, and get help accessing his MPB Portal. 
Sharing requests are for:
-son had a minor surgery ear tubes chronic ear infections - august initial appt 8/14, then surgery 8/28
-daughter fell Sunday afternoon - hit her head - vomiting - no head injuries.
We did a 3-way call with Zion first and spoke with Ulysees, who sent Justin an invitation link to open a member portal with them. Justin receive that successfully, and was confident in moving forward with the process for both children.
Ulysees let us go, and I proceeded to assist Just to access his MPB Member portal, and find where to fill out the form to add two my dependents. They do not need the membership till January though, so he does have time. I did coach him to fill out the form now, and just indicate the date he wants them to start/ I will start a CRM task to follow up on opening those sharing requests. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-14 15:58:04', '2024-11-14 15:58:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151969003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176659017', 'Candace Lucas', NULL, '11.14.24:  Candace emailed me back. Said she can do 1:30 p.m. on Friday, the 15th and I said ok. She included 3 Rxs and several provider names for us to research for her: 
1.	Alprazolam. .25 mg. 3x/day
2.	Testosterone. 1.62%. 3 actuations / day
3.	Zeposia. .92 mg / day

Drs:
Keith Johnson MD Venice
Kelly Ann Shedd MD Sarasota
James Amontree MD Port Charlotte
Jasmine Dukandar MD Sarasota 

Also, would like info on dental and vision.
For both, exclusions and wait periods for preexisting, if they apply.  JSP', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-14 15:09:20', '2024-11-20 14:08:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151836179', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165341', 'Janis Carey', NULL, '11-14-24 She removed me as her Agent. Looks like I worked with her 8 years ago. I just left her a vm to see if she still wants help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-14 14:50:08', '2024-11-14 14:50:08'),
