  ('zcrm_1579374000151831058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141579020', 'Jonathan Smith', NULL, '11/14
Mary started a chat with us in Sales IQ asking how to send claims from a provider, she then gave us a call and I proceeded to guide her to find her new ARM card in her email. I explained we no longer use RCI and to discard that card.I also told her to have her provider send that claim directly to ARM. ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-14 14:23:34', '2024-11-14 14:23:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151818111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006639', 'Ashley Semidey', NULL, '11/14/24: Ashley called stating she never received a new ARM card. Asked Acelyn about it and she resent the old card with co-pays on it. Called member back to explain - Ashely also stated her youngest daughter Mackenzie is not listed on the MEC. I verbally passed info to Laurie at ARM. Dave sent over corrected card along with confirmation that Mackenzie is active in their system. 
