  ('zcrm_1579374000151818106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145822001', 'Angelika Hellmer', NULL, '11/14/24: Angelika called stating her need with Sedera has been determined unshareable due to it being a pre-ex condition. She had several questions about what to do now and said she is not hearing back from Sedera. Brought them into phone call and Harley explained that yes - the need is not shareable, however, they will be able to start sharing into it October 2025. Member can still use Savvos and submit bills for them to negotiate, they just can''t share into them. Angelika is going to proceed with her current payment vouchers and decide if she wants to postpone or continue with further treatment of her meniscus tear and set up a call with the senio lead team member (Matt) that''s assigned to her case. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-14 14:06:19', '2024-11-14 14:06:19'),
