  ('zcrm_1579374000151836169', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138751080', 'Fritz Gearhart', NULL, '11-14-24 All of Fritz''s meds are covered on his current Cigna Connect Flex Bronze $0 plan according to C4 but Descovy is not covered on the rest of the plans. Valtrex isn''t showing up for any carrier but he can pay cash for that one at around $14-$30. I called and left him a vm as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-14 13:59:42', '2024-11-14 13:59:42'),
