  ('zcrm_1579374000151818083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, '11.14.2024 Per the CRM task, I reached back out to Denise to make sure she can open that sharing request for her ER visit. She had not, and will today by calling Zion directly. She was not able to do that on the phone with me, as she was at work.
