  ('zcrm_1579374000151818078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140532002', 'Mary Covarrubias', NULL, '11/14/24: Mary called. She took a cologuard test and it came back positive and now wants to get a colonoscopy. I helped her find providers within PHCS and advised her to use her MEC for billing. If they do happen to pull a polyp, she can then submit the bill as a sharing request and it would be subject to her IUA. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-14 11:53:24', '2024-11-14 11:53:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151836154', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725004', 'Richard Zimmerman', NULL, '11-14-24 I left Ann a vm bc she received a marketing email from MPB to enroll but Travis discovered she''s already a member with me. He passed her along.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-14 11:52:18', '2024-11-14 11:52:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151836149', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152572016', 'Emily Cope', NULL, '11-14-24 Emily wants to join CARE+ $2500/$364 and HAB $200 = $564. She will get most or more of the $200 back with well checks, dental, vision, labs and gym. So, this is better than the ACA plans where she could get a $328 APTC at $90K as self-employed hair stylist. Looking at those plans the MOP is still $9200 individual or $18,400 family vs $5000 with the above method. Plus she can keep her drs. None of the drs. were showing up in the network.  Centennial Valley Pediatrics with Dr. McClosky, Dr. Rubner and Foothills Midwives with Paige Swales and another person were not showing up in C4''s system for any carrier. She will be doing surrogacy next year for a family. She will make sure they will get her a separate insurance for the maternity since this does not include that. It sounds like she needs special ins for that. We will meet again on Nov. 21st to enroll for Jan. 1st. This will give her time to also have the $125 enrollment fee available.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-14 11:43:51', '2024-11-14 11:43:51'),
