  ('zcrm_1579374000151818023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120816002', 'Michael Lam', NULL, '11/13/24: Alyssa called to go over a large bill she received from a provider. It had a ton of labs she states she didn''t ask for. We brought Planstin into the call to learn which ones were preventive versus diagnostic and why. I advised Alyssa to reach out to her provider - she can either dispute the coding and ask if they will code preventive and resubmit, or dispute the claim altogether if she believes the labs were taken in error for no reason - if she didn''t bring up an issue that prompted the labs to be taken. 
Also let her know if she hits a brickwall with the provider and wants us to help speak to them, we can try that. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-13 11:50:12', '2024-11-13 11:50:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151836101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008372009', 'Adrianne Middleton', NULL, '11-13-24 Adrianne didn''t receive my email, so I read it to her with my response. She''s now has no immune system bc of covid and the covid vaccine. She doesn''t know of any other solutions according to her dr. other than the IV Gammaplex mentioned above. I suggested that she talks with her Dr. again to see what options she has and to keep her Cigna plan since they did pay for the Gammaplex once after trying to deny it. I also suggested for her to check out GoldCare.com since this is an area of expertise for them. She will check that out as well. I told her to let me know what she wants/needs as she digs further.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-13 11:46:55', '2024-11-13 11:46:55'),
