He forgot to add more to his payment this past year. He needs to do so, to keep his plan operating best. I''ll encourage the above suggestion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-12 15:30:23', '2024-11-12 15:30:23'),
