  ('zcrm_1579374000151756043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, '11.12.2024 Denise called concerned she might be having a heart attack, on her way to the ER, and wanted to know how to proceed with presentation. I guided her NOT TO WORRY about anything other than getting to the hospital safely and presenting as a cash pay patient. Denise will call us back once she is back home and settled. TASK created. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-12 11:30:02', '2024-11-12 11:30:02'),
