  ('zcrm_1579374000151786008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123703011', 'Jordan Anderson', NULL, '11/12/24: Jordan called in needing assistance with 2 issues. She is pregnant and wants to know how to start maternity request. She is also high risk for Ovarian cancer and wants to explore BRCA testing. I guided her through how to open first sharing request, collecting a global package and submitting through Zion member portal. Reviewed ACA guidelines for BRCA testing and called planstin to clarify. According to William, planstin only pays for BRCA counseling, but not testing according to literature on ACA. Emailing Jordan what what planstin said about BRCA. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-12 10:40:54', '2024-11-12 10:40:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151786003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146308012', 'Veronica Escosar', NULL, '11/12/24: SalesIQ Chat: Veronica requested new cards for her and husband. Messaged Kelly and Acelyn to request new cards. Also emailed Dave from ARM to send physical copy. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-12 10:37:26', '2024-11-12 10:51:06'),
