  ('zcrm_1579374000151756035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108041009', 'Tommy Jenkins', NULL, '11.12.2024 Tommy called to check in on the progress of accessing MPB app and the member portal. I reached out to the IT team to for updates, and the MPB app is still down, they are working on getting a new app. The members can access their MPB Portal via the e123 link. I called Tommy back and guided him with the above information. He asked what to do is CirrusMD will be messaging him via the MPB app, and I said to go ahead and download THEIR app, and they should be able to message him there too. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-12 10:34:14', '2024-11-12 11:09:51'),
