  ('zcrm_1579374000151756003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129740002', 'Dana Weddle', NULL, '11.12.2024 Through Teams chat, generated further details on Dana Weddle, including his advisor Christine Corsini. 
Certain details were not matching up. So both Acelyn an I spear headed the situation to do our own research. 
Acelyn found that America''s Pharmacy shares the same address as MyFree Pharmacy, but not the same phone number.
Googling "bank statement showing america''s pharmacy" shows that America''s Pharmacy is a program branched out of Sam''s Club.
I emailed MyFree Pharmacy to confirm that Dana indeed is or IS NOT one of their members, and to proceed according either way. Presently waiting to hear back from them, to call Dana and clarify to him WHO America''s Pharmacy really is that is extracting from him bank account, since he does not know, and to help him cancel........
*********************************************
End of the shift, and have not heard from MyFreePharmacy regarding Dana''s possible membership with them. Will attempt the next steps tomorrow with "America''s Pharmacy". NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-12 08:41:03', '2024-11-12 15:05:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151747013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149171017', 'Dylan Owens', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member is on the road a lot so he just wanted me verbally to go  over plan with him. Sent emails with resources as well. If any questions with setting up his accounts I said he can always reach out to us. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-12 08:21:39', '2024-11-12 08:21:39'),
