  ('zcrm_1579374000151659003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105234001', 'Brianna Krampetz', NULL, 'Brianna contacted me today re getting reinstated.  And she has questions about maternity and if that''s "covered".  Sent her the Zion and guidelines and the maternity guidelines.  Told her NO on reinstatement and the pre-existing conditions clock is re-set in her case.  She''s not happy about and I suspect it''s because she is pregnant; when I asked her directly, she would not answer.  Told her we''ll gladly accept her as a NEW member again; I''m enrolling now for a 12/1 start.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-11-11 13:53:24', '2024-11-11 13:53:24'),
