  ('zcrm_1579374000151603072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144155002', 'Bethany Walsh', NULL, '11.11.2024 Bethany called to cancel her membership and to follow protocol, I suggested that she speak to an advisor from Wiley Long first. Bethany was receptive and took their number down to call. I suggested that she call me back by tonight, 8pm ET, if she did not hear back from someone. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-11 12:43:42', '2024-11-11 12:43:42'),
