  ('zcrm_1579374000151603061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149298036', 'Jessica Koch', NULL, '11.11.2024 Jessica called with a variety of questions about her memberships.
We covered:
The preventive portion on do''s and don''ts and services and resources. Sent her the preventive services.
Welcome orientation call with Vanessa: Resent welcome link.
What to do if cash pay visits turn into bigger situations, or if preventive become diagnostic.
We went through the member portal page (main not personal) to find where the services are and where to find the forms.
She''s interested in changing her IUA, and possibly removing her son (he might get insurance through employment). We talked about making sure all financial influencing decisions are made by the 19th of any month, for the next month. 
Requested Acelyn to send Jessica another ARM''s card. I called ARM and spoke with Dave to send Jessica her ARM''s card. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-11 12:06:17', '2024-11-11 12:27:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151643003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '11-11-24 Suzy wants to move to HAB and drop Redirect but use chiro this month before she drops it. She didn''t even know about CirrusMD. She''s been using Redirect''s app for virtual visits. Suzy is well aware of the corruption in health care and wants to be part of the solution. She loves her membership and shares it with many people, friends, colleagues, acquaintances, etc. She wants to come on board to help spread the mission. She used to work for a Senator and would love to work wtih RFK JR. She''s been meaning to each out to me for years. She learned that Redirect is hiring. But, her super power is talking with people, educating and prefers sales! She''s not interested in insurance at all, only MCS. She lives in Denver. She has a great story about a dr. in TX names Kendall Stuart or Stewart who has helped her friend''s son get his life back after being diagnosed with bi-polar. Once this dr. ran some tests, he discovered the 20 year old was low in glutathione and used some nasal spray and perhaps one other small tweak. He has come full circle back to his vibrant, happy self. She was hoping the tests that this dr. run would be shared, but I let her know it''s doubtful. She believes allopathic care is in its dying days and quantum energy healing is the way of the future. We will talk further. But, she wants to test out HAB and drop Redirect for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-11 12:03:11', '2025-02-13 11:55:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151602028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108608002', 'Victor Espericueta', 'New Membership eff 11/24', 'Member Only $2500 Premium Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-11 11:51:21', '2024-11-11 11:51:21'),
