  ('zcrm_1579374000151603023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136950002', 'Carla Powderly', NULL, '11.11.2024 Carla called to get guidance on how to move forward with a mammogram under Planstin. I guided her to find her card. She found it in her mail, AND her email.
