  ('zcrm_1579374000151345013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148837002', 'Ariel Dilamani', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to send out welcome packet. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-08 08:13:09', '2024-11-08 08:49:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151318006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082047009', 'Marianne Leman', NULL, 'Member has submitted cancellation eff 12/24 citing finding other coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-08 07:16:02', '2024-11-08 07:16:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151253100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899089', 'Mateusz (Mat) Piasta', NULL, '11-7-24 Darrell Porter wants to help Mat with upgrading his plan to SECURE HSA. I responded like this, "If he wants to include the ACA compliant annual wellness screenings and HSA compliance, then he will need to move to the SECURE HSA membership which is $336 at the $1000 level in the 30-49 age group.&nbsp; We will just need to have him submit a change form. Let me know and I can help."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-07 19:57:38', '2024-11-07 19:57:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151253095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624001', 'Rachel Holden', NULL, '11-7-24 Zion rejected sharing Germaine''s new prostate cancer Need calling it pre-x from a previous lab test! He''s moving over to regular insurance for 2025. So brutal!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-07 17:57:55', '2024-11-07 17:57:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151253090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165383', 'Tyler McMahon', NULL, '11-7-24 Tyler wants to join HAB. He''s in Nepal now until Jan. I sent him the application to complete with instructions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-07 17:45:40', '2024-11-07 17:45:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151253085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099710012', 'Shane Lebsack', NULL, '11-7-24 "It appears as though the payment was charged to Linda Lebsack by the system this morning, but I processed a refund. Their enrollment has been canceled.

​
Best Regards,

CATALINA MARIN"

All set with cancellation of HAB. They realized that they won''t use enough of the benefits to make it financially viable.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-07 16:27:51', '2024-11-07 16:27:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151253077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134794006', 'Jonathan Martinez', NULL, '11-7-24 He asked for cancellation form which I sent to him. I just left a vm to see if he ran into troubles or to help him. He sent a curt email requesting cancellation. I''m not sure what went awry. But, they have a baby on the way. So, just want to make sure they are all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-07 15:53:53', '2024-11-07 15:53:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151253072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050504120', 'William Madsen', NULL, '11-7-24 Phone tag. He''s ready to enroll for him and son.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-07 15:51:00', '2024-11-07 15:51:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151253067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120814004', 'Reid Collins', NULL, '11-7-24 Reid had a terrible bike accident and landed in the ER with a messed up jaw and teeth.  He has about $100K in medical bills now. He needs an implant and oral surgery. He went to St. Anthony''s Medical Hospital in Frisco, CO.  He sadly only joined Redirect and bypassed MPB by accident, not knowing what he was signing up for. So, he didn''t have any true accident, injury, illness bene''s beyond Redirect''s Everyday Care. He will earn about $24K and earns just slightly over Medical''s limit for Medicaid. Elizabeth has already paid about $10K of the $100K and they are going on a payment plan. The hospital is a non-profit. He should qualify for the Debt Dismissal program within Essentials.  He joined for Dec. 1st, 2024 for help with those bills.

Then he wants a good medical plan moving forward. He''s in CA, so he needs SECURE HSA to be compliant in CA. UDPATE - we looked at CoveredCal and he could pay as little as $11 per month with the APTC covering most of the cost at his current income. If/when he earns more he will update the income or he could switch to Secure HSA, if that makes sense at the time. I also shared LifeBySpot with his mom Elizabeth in case that helps protect him until Jan. 1st, 2025.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-07 15:41:57', '2024-11-07 15:58:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151253062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486166', 'Elizabeth Collins', NULL, '11-7-24 Liz had a terrible experience with Sedera only sharing half of the cost of her 2nd knee surgery bc she went to Steadman''s which they deemed an inflated rate even though they gave her the best cash price. She''s paying about $31K for all things included. I suggested that she sends her information to me and I''ll send it up the chain. Her surgery was April 13th 2023 and she fought endlessly for assistance and they threatened cancelling her membership at the time. So, she''s till paying it off. She earns too much to qualify for debt dismissal and it was too long ago.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-07 15:40:14', '2024-11-07 15:40:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151253054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132050', 'Elizabeth Longbotham', NULL, '11.07.2024 Saw a task come into the concierge email for Elizabeth inquiring about a TB test. I picked up the task and called the number on the profile, a man answered and said she has a different number and offered that number, which I included in the task.
I called Elizabeth to let her know that her TB screening can be included under the ACA guidelines, as long as she can do it during her annual physical. I asked if she''s had an annual physical yet, and she said no.  I said that is perfect and let her know it can be covered that way.
Elizabeth was not happy to hear from me, and kept talking over me, making statement as:
"I don''t like this insurance" "I''ll just pay out of pocket" "This insurance is so stupid"....She was very unhappy, and I apologized for that and tried to see if she needed anymore assistance, but she was not receptive and then hung up. 
I called Leslie, and we connected. I had thought Leslie put in the task and wanted to update her and make sure I did not miss anything, given Elizabeth''s lack of ease. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-07 15:04:06', '2024-11-07 15:26:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151228061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082047009', 'Marianne Leman', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to cancel.  I directed her to speak to Karen and I will send her the cancellation', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-07 14:49:51', '2024-11-07 14:49:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151228056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139729018', 'Raeanna Clarke', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to update her pmt info.  I will send her out link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-07 14:40:24', '2024-11-07 14:40:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151228051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151262002', 'Kristin Bernstein', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $1000 IUA Secure w/ARM', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-07 14:20:47', '2024-11-07 14:20:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151253046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133732002', 'Megan Keyser', NULL, '11.07.2024 After receiving an email ticket from Rachelle Valencia, regarding Megan losing her wallet. I called Planstin to have them resend her the cards, both virtually and physically. I then called Megan and left her a detailed message. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-07 14:17:46', '2024-11-07 14:22:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151263003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132050', 'Elizabeth Longbotham', NULL, '11.07.24 - Elizabeth called inquiring about TB tests since her and her husband are thinking of moving into an assisted living facility due to his stroke. Advised to fill out a Custom Labs/RX Quote request and advised this would be an out-of-pocket expense. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-11-07 14:06:46', '2024-11-07 14:06:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151253041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128033014', 'William Arons', NULL, '11-7-24 He called back bc C4 is requesting proof of income. His income is from investments, so he''ll read through it carefully and supply documents showing his $50K income estimated for 2025.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-07 13:21:04', '2024-11-07 13:21:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151253036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128033014', 'William Arons', NULL, '11-7-24 Bill is choosing to keep the same Cigna Connect Flex Bronze.

