  ('zcrm_1579374000151228046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123845002', 'Jarrett Lambert', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to add newborn to membership.  I will process &amp; notify Planstin', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-07 12:29:25', '2024-11-07 12:29:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151228041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114056002', 'David Mell', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update his address.  I will process &amp; notify Planstin', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-07 12:15:12', '2024-11-07 12:15:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151253026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121162002', 'Todd Occhiuto', NULL, '11.07.2024 Called Todd to reassure him, he still has Planstin until January 1 - 2025. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-07 12:03:03', '2024-11-07 12:03:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151228036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111531001', 'MARIA Colon-Gonzalez', 'New Membership eff 12/24', 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-07 11:55:50', '2024-11-07 11:55:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151228031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111531001', 'MARIA Colon-Gonzalez', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to raise IUA from $1000 to $5000 eff 12/24.  I will process &amp; notify Zion', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-07 11:53:58', '2024-11-07 11:53:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151253018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149278018', 'Jean Garcia', NULL, '11.07.2024 Put in a ticket request via Outlook. Per Julia''s request via Teams chat. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-07 11:35:07', '2024-11-07 11:35:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151253013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491580', 'Francis Lanzano', NULL, '11-7-24 Francis was curious about HAB for past stuff he''s already done this year. I explained how it works. Then was was interested in the mental health benefits. He saw a counselor 9X this year and was hoping that was reimbursable. I let him know it''s very unlikely but he can at least call the Concierge Team to help find out if he''s in their private network. He''s not interested in doing more sessions now. He''s all set on that front. He''s a member with New Med and did some labs, immunizations, etc. with them already. Joy, his mom, wants him to get an echocardiogram. I told him to have Concierge Team help him price that out in his local area. He''ll call them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-07 11:21:33', '2024-11-07 11:21:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151253008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152070028', 'Delia Gray', NULL, '11-7-24 Delia started with The Hope Institute of America on Oct. 11th and is making about $46K. She''s on Access which is AZ''s version of Medicaid. To stay on Medicaid her income can''t exceep $33,600. She will be bumped off any time now. However, she was convinced to have a mastectomy since she has the Bracka 2 gene. Now she wants/needs reconstructive surgery and her previous ACA plan won''t pay for it. She''s hoping Medicaid will pay for it but they''re dragging their feet. MCS won''t pay for it since it''s pre-x. She''s in a tough spot, hence why she wants to delay joining Secure HSA to see if she can have this done before Jan. 1st. She used to work for MeMD before it was bought by WalMart. Now WalMart ran it into the ground and it no longer exists. She''s healthy, no smoking, no drinking, no meds, no chronic issues. However, her dad was killed by a drunk driver and her mom died from a stroke at age 54. So, she was put into foster care at the age of 12.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-07 11:12:02', '2024-11-07 11:12:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151181075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149278018', 'Jean Garcia', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. CirrusMD no records found. Sent info over to Julia. Put in request to Aceyln to resend out digital ARM card. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-07 11:02:09', '2024-11-07 11:37:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151181062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084176', 'Stephanie Raymond', NULL, 'Spoke to member. She needed to reschedule welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-07 10:33:27', '2024-11-07 10:33:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151253003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142967002', 'Robert Miller', NULL, '11.07.2024 Called Robert again on (831) 331-9174, and left another detailed message regarding opening a medical need and/or uploading the appropriate documents. 
I''m unable to view the permission form he filled out to give his wife permission, b/c it is archived in an area the concierge cannot see. Therefore I could not leave his wife, who is helping him, the message. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-07 10:25:20', '2024-11-07 10:25:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000151181052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149298019', 'Jeremy Pevahouse', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-07 10:21:27', '2024-11-07 10:21:27'),
