  ('zcrm_1579374000151181036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148657002', 'Alex Kelloff', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR life code card. Member filled put form to update address to a P.O. Box. I also changed it in the CRM. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-07 09:50:43', '2024-11-07 09:51:29'),
