  ('zcrm_1579374000151075188', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '11-6-24 Suzy is interested in HAB. She''s paying $425.78 for PDHC and wants more benefits for all the money she''s paying. She could drop Redirect and add HAB  $1500 IUA / $329 + $107 = $436 instead and lose chiro but gain the many other benefits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-06 17:41:47', '2024-11-06 17:41:47'),
