  ('zcrm_1579374000150966031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152284778', 'David Spear', NULL, '11-5-24 Shelby came to me via Bev Garretson. Shelby just got kicked off Medicaid 10/31/24. Her husband makes $34K working PT and no benes. Their 17 year old daughter just started working and is making $330 per week which is about $16.500 per year. That brings the household income to $50,500.  Bev is showing as Inactive on her account erroneously. He account is totally broken with an crazy error message I''ve never seen. This happened when she and I tried to apply for 2024. He account seems to be ok for 2025 but she needs 2024 coverage first. I sent a note to Broker Support at C4. Bev is working on her end to correct the broker connection issue for her past months commissions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-05 14:17:09', '2024-11-05 14:17:09'),
