  ('zcrm_1579374000150966006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160567018', 'John Bayne', NULL, '11-5-24 John is 57, wife Christine 44 and daughter 8. They live in Littleton, CO and came to me via Andrea. They''ve been clients of Andrea''s for about 10 years. He thought he wanted to get out of C4 bc the networks are so slim. However he will get over $1000 APTC in 2025 and pay only $434 for his current Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 0.  He got his PCP back in network but another Dr. is no longer in network. After reviewing his plan options via phone he agreed to keep his current plan. We''re keeping his income at $85K until he knows it''s more.  We can adjust it at that time. Otherwise, it won''t allow for the auto renew and he''d have to set it all up again. He will make sure his payment comes out successfully in Dec. and Jan. He''s all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-05 11:43:32', '2024-11-05 11:43:32'),
