  ('zcrm_1579374000150954012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114230002', 'Mary Jo Mooring', NULL, '11.05.2024 Mary Jo called after she was told by a Zion rep that she needs to call MPB to learn how to proceed with her preventive appointment. Mary Jo is showing up in their system, just NOT FOR THE PREVENTIVE portion of her membership.
I attempted a call into Planstin, but no one answered, as their lines were busy.
I offered Mary Jo that I would put in a ticket with our IT dept, and call Planstin again later in the day to clarify the mishap. 
I went ahead and put in a formal task via CRM in order to follow up that way, and offered Mary Jo a call back, once it has been resolved.
Mary Jo is not in a hurry, but did make a phone call to the doctor in the attempt to start her scheduling process. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-05 09:16:44', '2024-11-05 09:35:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150969003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148858973', 'Karl Hill', NULL, 'Spoke to member he needed to reschedule his welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-05 09:03:53', '2024-11-05 09:03:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150947003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109660008', 'Larry Essex', NULL, 'This member was transferred to me by the Concierge was very wants to cancel and refuses to fill out a cancellation form.  He says that Zion told him they would pay his hospital bill and then did not.  Lumps us in with Zion.  Also per previous notes had the usual bad experience with the HMA.  I will cancel eff 12/1/24.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-05 08:28:44', '2024-11-05 08:28:44'),
