  ('zcrm_1579374000150837031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144055012', 'Kate Wasserman', NULL, '11/4/24: Kate sent in a lab quote request for 16 labs. Started pricing out options for her and building a cart to contain all of these labs. Emailed Kate letting her know we received her request and that we will have her a custom quote in the next 24-48 hours. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-04 17:20:58', '2024-11-04 17:59:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150771043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000150772201', 'Adlai McMahon', NULL, '11-4-24 Adlai came via Maria Hennessey. He''s been on group plans his entire life and his employment and insurance ended 10-31-24. He watched the video and said it will take time to wrap his head around. But, he won''t be earning much for a little bit. In Dec. he expects $80K and in 2025 he expects $150K. With either income, he''s still getting a big APTC! So, it makes more sense to go with C4 for now unless he exceeds $150K which he might. They live in Crested Butte and Adlai is 48, wife is 46 and kids are both 12. Adlai takes Adderall and muscle relaxors tezanadine. Wife takes mild anti depressant generic esctitalopram. They could also benefit from HAB if ever choose MCS. They do all of the following, wellness screenings, vax, labs, dental, vision, gym, nutrition, mental health, etc. With CARE+ $672 and HAB $250, total is $922 in 2025 or $635+$250 = $875. He''s more concerned about physical therapy co-pays and first dollar benefits right now. With RMHP we found every Dr. except Donna Beddingfield. Drs. include, Dr. Eric James Thorson, Dr. Laura Villanueva, Dr. William Scott Timothy, Dr. Amanda Elizabeth Hill, Dr. Joy MCelyea, PT Timothy Poppe. Nurse Janelle Walek is not showing up and she''s connected to Dr. Donna Beddingfield. Their practice is not in network. With APTC in 2024 their cost is $713 or so at $80K and $680 at $150K. It doesn''t make sense but that''s what I''m seeing.  He''s uploading his End of Employment/Cobra notice. Employment ended 10/4/24 and insurance ended 10/31/24.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-04 17:06:04', '2024-11-04 17:41:42'),
