  ('zcrm_1579374000150771008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163406017', 'Jane Snyder', NULL, '11-1-24 Jane is 39 and came to me via Dr. Mary Ellen Francescani. She is a partner with Mary Ellen. She could go onto her husband''s ins but the ded is way too high, more than $7-$8K. She doesn''t know the price though. She lives in PA which means NO Sedera. I explained Care+ and HAB. She doesn''t seem to use Middleway Wellness. She had a meniscus tear in Dec. 20th of 2023. She had a hip surgery in Dec. 2022 and final PT in April of 2023. She had a labral tear and had chronic pain. But, that is resolved!  She''s thinking of waiting until 24 months have passed to join Care+, ie. May  of 2025. She pondering joining HAB on its own for now bc she really likes the idea and needs many of the benefits, including mental health, gym, etc. She will review it all and ponder. Quoted her CARE+ $273/$1000 IUA, + HAB $107 = $380, $125/$25. Possibly Dec. 1st for HAB.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-11-01 16:46:58', '2024-11-01 16:46:58'),
