  ('zcrm_1579374000150725015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601108', 'Kevin Fechtmeyer', NULL, '11/1/24: Sarah called super frustrated because she hasn''t quite grasped the details of how to use her plan, her onboarding has not been smooth, and MPB and her advisor told her she has Sedera as MCS instead of Zion. I apologized and attempted to correct Sarah''s immediate concerns, provide enough education to get her through the next tasks on her list, and provide followup with additional help for her.
