  ('zcrm_1579374000150733003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144944028', 'Taylor Smith', NULL, '11/1
Taylor called to initiate a sharing request regarding her hospital bill. I explained that in order for her to proceed, her bill would need to exceed her Individual Unshared Amount (IUA) of $5,000. During our conversation, she mentioned that her emergency room visit occurred back in May, while she was still under her parents'' membership. She expressed a desire to file the sharing request under her mother’s plan, as it has a lower IUA.

I clarified that she could not open a sharing request under her mother''s plan, as she is now enrolled in her own health plan. To ensure she received the best possible guidance, I reached out to Patti for further insights on the matter. Patti advised me to refer Taylor to Zion Health for additional assistance, as they would be better equipped to help her navigate this situation.  ACE', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-01 13:31:13', '2024-11-01 13:31:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150637066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142967002', 'Robert Miller', NULL, '11.01.2024 I called Robert on  (831) 331-9174, to follow up on where he is on his recovery, and getting his finances all squared away. I ended up leaving a detailed message. While I was leaving that message, I loud ring came through the call, and I''m unsure what platform it generated from. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-01 13:17:14', '2024-11-01 13:17:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150632029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005544245', 'Bethany Schaap', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to cancel.  She had not spoken to Andrea as yet.  I will send out link and copy Andrea.  Asvised Member I can cancel eff 12/1/24', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-01 12:07:19', '2024-11-01 12:07:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150637018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044571065', 'Anna Menz', NULL, '11.01.2024 Anna called to get a better understanding about her membership and all that is involved. I gave her a refresh rundown of the Essential services and reiterated that everything else will be a cash pay visit, and that how she needs to present herself. 
We went through each service to log in and have access. She did a HCBB search with while on the phone. She took my suggestion to speak to Wendy to learn of other plans, since hers is very old. 
***********************************************************
After hanging up with Anna, I learned from Patti via Teams Group Chat that Redirect IS THE PREVENTIVE PORTION of the plan and all the appointments are handled through them for the members. It is important to send the members that way to complete their preventive appointments.  I called Anna back to clarify that misguidance. It turns out she spoke with Wendy and Wendy helped her with that information. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-11-01 12:03:48', '2024-11-01 13:12:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150632024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078592091', 'Alan Fraughton', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to know what exactly she had because she had logged into the Zion website and noticed the rates.  I went over the MPB Siute of Services that she gets with us and not Zion and she was unaware of most of them.  I suggested that she do a refresher Welcome Call and sent her the link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-11-01 11:56:40', '2024-11-01 11:56:40'),
