  ('zcrm_1579374000150552179', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125287001', 'Deena Patel', NULL, 'Spoke to member she needed to reschedule welcome call. Sent email to do so. Put in request to Kelly to send out welcome packet to member. Showed her form to fill out to update address on our website. Also got her in her MPB member portal. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-10-31 10:43:35', '2024-10-31 11:15:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150538041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120181002', 'Destiny Schoon', NULL, 'Destiny called.....had some Qs about her new MEC that appears to be effective 11/1. She is going to call the Concierge to figure out where the info is re the card and instructions for use.  She''s happy.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2024-10-31 10:10:31', '2024-10-31 10:10:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150552164', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146488002', 'Kurt Jones', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-10-31 10:06:12', '2024-10-31 10:06:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150586011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117650002', 'Paul Copeland', NULL, '10/31/24: Susan called asking if a specific bill will be paid for by her plan. Her son had an ankle injury and went to an orthopedic doctor. I explained that this type of bill would fall under the healthshare bucket of their plan and explained their IUA, when to submit a sharing request, 6 month deadline and to be sure to call us anytime they need assistance on how to best use their plan. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-10-31 09:47:58', '2024-10-31 09:47:58'),
