  ('zcrm_1579374000150586006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044058', 'Samantha Midler', NULL, '10/31/24: Samantha emailed in saying she hasn''t received her new ARM card yet. Acelyn will be sending her card out today. Responded to Samantha letting her know when to expect her digital and physical card. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-10-31 07:40:34', '2024-10-31 07:40:34'),
