  ('zcrm_1579374000150575003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000150571023', 'Robert Reese', NULL, '10-30-24 Bob enrolled in Premium Care for Dec. 1st, 2024 $1000/$285 and only $25 start up bc ASHI member. He joined HAB No DPC $107 EO for Dec. 1st as well. He''s all set to go and super nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-30 15:42:30', '2024-10-30 15:42:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150545071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, '10.30.2024 Maurine called to get her sharing request taken care of today, since they (her and Zion) will get that 10% off if paid by tomorrow.
We did a 3-way call with Zion and spoke Eden who guided her to pay her IUA via her Zion member portal.
NEW UPDATE for Zion''s Sharing Request Fulfillment:
-Go to Zion''s member portal
-Refresh page on Maurine''s end
-Go to the sharing request > there it should allow you to pay for the IUA in there.
Eden refreshed on her end to make sure it shows up for Zion''s end, and went to check with her supervisor (b/c this is a new feature, she wanted to make sure all went well) to make sure she can see it on her end as well.
After coming back, Eden''s findings were that it was still showing pending, and her supervisor shared that it does take around 10 minutes, at times, to process. On top of that, Maurine''s processor Derrick/Eric has left for the day, and so they will reconvene tomorrow to process it all. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-10-30 15:32:19', '2024-10-30 15:38:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150545066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145372007', 'Amy Kopf', NULL, '10.30.2024 Amy called asking about vaccines. She has Health Access Benefits with Wendy. So I visited that brochure to help guide her. I confirmed she has benefits for vaccines but was unsure as to how they want their members to proceed to get them. So I suggested that she speak to them directly and gave her their ph#. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-10-30 15:08:43', '2024-10-30 15:08:43'),
