  ('zcrm_1579374000150513051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122138001', 'Chandler Kubas', NULL, '10/30/24: Called (unable to leave message - call dropped). Sent email reminding member to book welcome call. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-10-30 13:34:57', '2024-10-30 13:34:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150552046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411262', 'Michael Hicks', NULL, 'This member never submitted the Change Form to me to add his dependent.  Since he spoke to Sedera 1st they added his dependent and billed us for MF coverage while we continued to collect MS monies.  Over the last month there was some reason that the dependent was removed from the membership by Sedera and that''s how this came to light.  Member has agreed to pay the difference of $1869.70 for the 10 months that he was billed incorrectly and submit the Change Form.  I let him know what his price would be moving forward.  Member ok with this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-10-30 13:33:45', '2024-10-30 13:33:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150538011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087734002', 'Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, '10.30.24:  Called Jocelyn and left a message explaining that I''m trying to contact her to determine what her decision is about her health plan and give her information that may help her make an informed decision.  Also, if she intends to cancel her MPB plan, she needs to fill out a cancellation form by 10/31. I asked her to let me know what she''d like to do.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-10-30 13:25:47', '2024-10-30 13:25:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150513046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122227001', 'Mary Jane Morris', NULL, '10/30/24: Left detailed message and email reminding member to book welcome call. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-10-30 13:17:29', '2024-10-30 13:17:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150545046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117926002', 'Karen Wedul', NULL, '10.30.2024 Karen visited SalesIQ requesting help finding preventive resources for facilities for mammography and providers for OBGYN.
I sent her both lists, and resources, including lab discount sites, via the CRM. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-10-30 13:16:59', '2024-10-30 13:16:59'),
