  ('zcrm_1579374000150545026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137105002', 'Christopher Ferritto', NULL, '10.30.2024 Rcvd note in Members Issues and Calls spreadsheet, that Christopher is unable to register for CirrusMD. I put in a ticket to CirrusMD at 1:28 CT, TODAY. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-10-30 12:28:59', '2024-10-30 12:28:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150545018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144723002', 'Robin Huber', NULL, '10.30.2024 Robin called asking about vaccines, preventive services and how to proceed. I made sure to guide her through the process of finding a preventive provider, how to confirm they are still in network and to make sure to get her vaccines during THAT appointment, and NOT at the pharmacy. I went ahead and sent her the Preventive Resources email to glance at all the prev services she can attain prior to going. Especially the vaccines part. 
We also went over the M&S EAP program, briefly, on how to connect with them, how they function as a service and what to expect. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2024-10-30 12:10:52', '2024-10-30 12:18:43'),
