  ('zcrm_1579374000150338023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121162002', 'Todd Occhiuto', NULL, '10.29.2024 Lab requests order:
Hello Todd,
Such a pleasure working on this for you! It''s a fairly new service to the members, and I''m finding it resourceful and rewarding for both parties. Thank you for filling out the RX, Labs & Imaging Custom Quote Request Form, to help you with your search.

NOTE: Please, use these sites for any requested blood-work, other than the following tests:
Standard lipid panel
Cholesterol test/lipid panel
Screening for Type 2 Diabetes and Gestational Diabetes
Hep B and C screening
HIV screening
Anemia screening for pregnant women or if the patient is under the age 18.
I went ahead and screened a few of them and shared my findings down below. Jason Health and Laboratory Assist seemed to be the lowest. Walk-in Labs prices were extremely high.
We are here to guide you through them, should you have any questions. 
Discounted Lab Sites:
https://www.jasonhealth.com/
https://www.ultalabtests.com/
https://www.walkinlab.com/categories/view/all-products
https://laboratoryassist.com/
https://www.healthlabs.com/
NOTE: 
Patients living in NJ, RI & NY - Discounted Lab-sites are not recognized if you live in the following states: NJ, RI, & NY - EXCEPT for the site Laboratory Assist. 
Laboratory Assist is the ONLY site that serves all 50 states, except for NO Labcorp in NY.
Basic Steps for maneuvering a discounted lab-sites search:
Enter your Zip Code Area to find a lab near you
Choose the lab tests that you need
Pay online with a CC
Each site has a different flat fee to use the site. Note that in your budget.
Each site''s prices differ in savings. I suggest opening them next to each other and plugging the lab code in all of them to see the price.
Doctor visits and insurance is not needed
Go to the chosen lab, walk in is acceptable in most places
Get your results online within 1-3 business days, via email
Most labs are open Monday - Friday, many are open on Saturdays. Most are open early, some are open late. Check for working hours for each lab.
Jason Health Cart:
(Screen shots showing him a total of $99)
Laboratory Assist Cart:
I could not generate a cart here, but they do look like they could be a bit less expensive than Jason. Not by much though. I''ve included a few snapshots of the process. I decided not to consent on your behalf, which is why it did not allow me to move forward.

Thanks again for reaching out. If you would like more guidance, please reach out again at the concierge line, 800-519-2969. We are here M-F, 9-8pm, ET
Nahla Tebcherany
MPB Health
Concierge Consultant
800-519-2969

* Disclaimer *
This email is intended solely to provide supplementary information to our valued members and is not a personal point of contact.
If you have additional questions or concerns, please call the Concierge at 1-800-519-2969.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-29 09:02:20', '2024-10-29 09:13:27'),
