  ('zcrm_1579374000150321111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023155119', 'Timothy Cook', NULL, '10.28.2024 Timothy called to learn of the changes in networks with ARM vs Planstin. He assured me that he did choose Practitioners and Ancillary.
I needed additional guidance on this, so I 3-way called ARM.
According to ARM:
- It is always the provider''s individual decision
- Meaning, if the rest practice is not on board of the network, they do not count
- Any employees under THAT provider who chooses, needs to be under their tax ID to count as preventive.

If the firm is already contracted with the network, then they would know who would be in charge to add other providers. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-28 15:38:56', '2024-10-28 15:38:56'),
