  ('zcrm_1579374000150321011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082058002', 'Andrea Andersson', NULL, '10.28.2024 Rcvd note from advisor Wendy, to attain verbiage that shows Andrea''s son is a dependent on her membership, for his school.
I called Planstin and spoke with Caitlyn, and she generated that letter on the spot to send out by today. Should be out to Andrea with both their names on it. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-28 10:54:28', '2024-10-28 12:41:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150321003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000147691008', 'Michelle Aguirre-Stevens', NULL, '10.28.2024 Rcvd note from advisor, that member is seeking to have a new card issue to her. This took place on the 25th. When searching for the member, nothing would come up. Dayra did some research on her end, and got back to me this morning with the following full name to search in the CRM: Michelle Aguirre-Stevens. 
I will be contacting Michelle''s TPA to request another insurance card for her. 
I called ARM to proceed with the request, but Dave shared that he''s waiting on her SSN. It is NOT in the system. I hung up with Dave, and called Michelle immediately, but ended up leaving a detailed message. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-28 10:39:11', '2024-10-28 11:31:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150316008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085539002', 'Carl Harris', NULL, '10-28-24 Left vm on both #''s. The mobile # has AI and it was tough to leave a vm. We will see how well it worked...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-28 10:14:48', '2024-10-28 10:14:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150304046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149209292', 'Brenda Kuehn', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online the welcome call after start date of November 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-10-28 10:06:01', '2024-10-28 10:06:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150316003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138754002', 'Melissa Osika', NULL, '10-28-24 Lisa got a new job with benefits. Her job started today 10/28 and her benefits begin today with her new employer.  She submitted the cancellation form. I''ll check in about HAB.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-28 10:04:04', '2024-10-28 10:04:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150300013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107622002', 'Roy Bryhn', NULL, '10/28/24: Lisa called and stated that her husband has been having abdominal pain that is worsening. Lisa is a PCP and gave her husband an ultrasound. They are now considering having him get a colonoscopy. I explained that Planstin will pay for it as long as it is preventive, however, if they pull polyps, then it is diagnostic and will become a sharing request. 
This is a somewhat sticky situation because it is a diagnostic issue, so if they go into the appt leading with that, the provider could code it diagnostic from the very beginning. If they simply schedule a preventive colonoscopy then they can use their planstin MEC.
We also discussed the steps for submitting this as a sharing request. IUA, 6 month deadline, Member portal. collecting itemized statements, and how payment works. 
Lisa said she believes she already has her member portal set up with Zion, and will call back if they decide to submit this as a sharing request. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-28 09:53:19', '2024-10-28 09:53:19'),
