  ('zcrm_1579374000150300008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093328002', 'Craig Anderson', NULL, '10/28/24: Lisa called asking if dermatology is covered with her plan. I explained no, but a general dermatology look over will be covered when she moves to the new MEC vendor. We also discussed the 3 major aspects of her plan - MEC, Cirrus and Zion and how it would work if she had a major expense and needed to submit a sharing request. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-28 07:47:03', '2024-10-28 07:47:03'),
