  ('zcrm_1579374000150185018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129054009', 'Jana Leija', NULL, '10.25.2024 Jana called wanting to know how to get covered for her flu shots. She also wanted to know, since she already had her annual physical, will she have to pay for the actual visit. I consulted with Caitlyn in Planstin on that, and she said IT DOES have be with the annual physical, so getting it done afterwards would cost the visit, UNLESS the doctor is willing to code it preventive. Jana will check with her doctor. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-25 15:34:46', '2024-10-25 15:34:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000150185013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779212', 'Timothy Gustafson', NULL, '10.25.2024 Julie called to learn more about the membership increase that''s taking place in December, and how the details of her membership: IUA, date it will take place, the actual amount. We went over all of it, I clarified the membership annual fee with the team and Julie was happy she called. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-25 15:06:26', '2024-10-25 15:06:26'),
