  ('zcrm_1579374000149935003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138751080', 'Fritz Gearhart', NULL, '10-24-24 Your health and/or dental insurance plan is ready for renewal. Your current plan will be offered in 2025, with the name Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 0. We estimate your 2025 advance premium tax credit will be $696.19 which will lower your new monthly premium to $227.39, starting January 1, 2025.

You can view your renewal options in your account from November 1, 2024 through December 1, 2024. Starting November 1st, review and update your information to make sure you are accessing all the savings that you qualify for.

After December 1, 2024, we will automatically renew you in your current plan(s), and the insurance company will bill you for the January 2025 premium, unless one of the following occurs: you select a different plan, you cancel the renewal plan(s), or your 2024 plan ends before December 31, 2024. Your 2024 enrollment(s) must stay effective until December 31, 2024, for you to automatically renew in your current plan(s).', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-24 12:19:36', '2024-10-24 12:19:36'),
