  ('zcrm_1579374000149765041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, '10.23.2024 Brandi called concerned about a moved spleen and wanted the resources to search for care. I offered to send her the HCBB and Healthgrades with a generated list, and then I asked her if she is in so much pain that she needs to go into the ER or urgent care. She was thinking more ER, so she can be cared for FULLY right then and there. 
I sent her the resources regardless, and we agreed that she will call us back to go through the process of using HCBB to find a good specialist with us. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-23 15:13:31', '2024-10-23 15:13:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000149748067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762035', 'Traci Hoops', NULL, '10/23/24
Traci called wanting to know the process of opening a sharing request for her biopsy for skin cancer. I explained she is responsible for the first 1000$ and after that she could open a sharing request', 'Acelyn Calderon', 'Acelyn Calderon', '2024-10-23 14:51:09', '2024-10-23 14:51:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000149748062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079059075', 'Jon Hancock', NULL, '10/23/24
I have called and emailed Jon again and still have not received any feedback from him regarding his urology.

Jon reached out to us on 10/16/2024 for a urology appointment. While attempting to book his appointment I came across several issues. Most places will not see him there is a 6 month waiting period and he has requested to be seen in the first weeks of November. In an attempt to accommodate his request, I searched for all urology providers within a 100-mile radius. For those urologists who could fit him in, they requested Jon have a referral to book ( he does not have one). Julia also helped me search and she found some available nurse practitioners. I then emailed Jon to update him on his options and he responded with some links to his preferred clinics and asked if I had called them. I then called his preferred clinic and they informed me that they do not have a urology but a primary care physician would be able to see him. I booked an appointment at his preferred clinic and I am awaiting response on how to proceed', 'Acelyn Calderon', 'Acelyn Calderon', '2024-10-23 14:48:16', '2024-10-23 14:48:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000149748057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141096012', 'Matt Eytcheson', NULL, '10/23/24
