  ('zcrm_1579374000149730105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095967002', 'Vickie Jan Felan', NULL, 'Member was transferred to me by Planstin.  She had questions about the possibility of her employer paying for her membership.  I told her that we do not invoice for our billing, that the employer would have to submit Payment Update from with their payment information and we would draft every month.  I directed member to the website and told her to get the form there.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-10-23 12:50:31', '2024-10-23 12:50:31'),
