  ('zcrm_1579374000149765018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146332002', 'Peter Muerset', NULL, '10.23.2024 A mental provider''s office called on behalf of Joshua wondering if his Transcranial Medic Stimulation (TMS) treatments would be covered. I looked up the Zion''s guidelines to see if one of the alternative therapies was craniosacral, and it is. I asked the lady on the phone if they are the same, she said they are very similar.
Although Zion does not offer MPB member mental wellness sharing, this could POSSIBLY go under the realm of alternative therapies in a sharing request.
So I asked her to have Josh call  us, after they speak, so him and I can 3-way call Zion to ask them the following questions:
1- Is TMS an alternative therapy that can be shareable?
2- Can the referring doctor by a psychiatrist?
Waiting to hear from Joshua. I will give him till Thursday afternoon, if I don''t hear from him, then I will call him. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-23 12:12:23', '2024-10-23 12:12:23'),
