Ranjini called she has another cholesterol screening (she already had one in March labs came back high ) and she wants to know what she has to do so that it is covered. I informed her that has turned diagnostic and will not be covered. she insisted it should covered so I offered to do a three-way call with Planstin so that she could hear it for herself. 
The Planstin rep advised her it would not be covered at 100%, that she could still use her card for that appointment and she would get a discount, rep also advised her to use her deductible and also advised her that she could use it for larger medical expenses ex. hospital. 
I tried reaching out to her again to clarify the miss information the plastin rep provided.
she should present as a self pay patient at her new cholesterol screening to get an actual discount (not at the insurance rate)', 'Acelyn Calderon', 'Acelyn Calderon', '2024-10-23 11:09:42', '2024-10-23 11:10:21'),
