  ('zcrm_1579374000149733003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177716', 'John Kline', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR life code cards. Kelly also resent out digital ARM cards. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-10-23 07:57:01', '2024-10-23 08:08:00'),
