  ('zcrm_1579374000149696016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177716', 'John Kline', NULL, '10/23/24: John called unsure of how his welcome call is going to take place but it was for 9:30. I went ahead and transferred to Vanessa since it was just 2 minutes till. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-23 07:32:43', '2024-10-23 07:32:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000149696008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113310002', 'Laura A Talley', NULL, '10/23/24: MSEAP called to verify Laura''s membership. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-23 07:16:14', '2024-10-23 07:16:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000149696003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243295', 'Brooke Spencer', NULL, '10/23/24: Brooke called and LVM about needing to set up a telehealth appt. Called back and was able to get her set up with CirrusMD. She also asked some general questions about setting up a need and how broad an issue can be. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-23 07:09:46', '2024-10-23 07:24:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000149616023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '10/22/24: Kristen called. She has a wellness visit tomorrow and unsure about Planstin and if anything has changed with the PHCS network. She said she remembers having a conversation about Planstin possibly moving away from the PHCS network. 
I let her know that they do indeed still use the PHCS network but offer in and out of network benefits so as long as the provider codes the services as preventive and bills planstin directly, they will pay for it. 
Kristen has two cards and was unsure which one was most current. One has PHCS listed on it and the other does not. I said I wasn''t sure, but if the claims address and numbers are the same, either should work. I offered to connect with planstin and verify the cards, but she said it''s fine. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-22 17:06:18', '2024-10-22 17:06:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000149684020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149171001', 'Damrong Trairatnobhas', NULL, '10-22-24 Hello Wendy, 

Looks like they got him added in this morning. I went ahead and added the note for his tenure. 

Please let me know if there is anything else I can assist you with. 

Best Regards,
Ashley R.

Sedera Member Services
855.973.3372

Dom''s original start date was 12-1-18', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-22 17:02:17', '2024-10-22 17:02:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000149616018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113310002', 'Laura A Talley', NULL, '10/22/24: Laura called tyring to connect with MSEAP. Provided her with phone number and transferred over. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-22 16:21:15', '2024-10-22 16:21:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000149616013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116236002', 'Lisa D''Onofrio', NULL, '10/22/24: Lisa called wanting to make sure she is doing the right thing for her wellness checkup tomorrow. I advised her to present her Planstin card for billing, make sure everything is coded as preventive and stays within the aca guidelines. If they want to run labs other than a standard lipid panel, please get the order and call us back so we can help find savings on those. 
Lisa also asked about her open sharing request wondering what will happen next. She explained that it says it''s pending IUA. I let her know that she would have to speak to ZIon for details, but it sounds like she needs to prove she''s paid her IUA and asked if she submitted any receipts or was it just the bill. Ended up transferring to Zion. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-22 15:41:02', '2024-10-22 15:41:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000149616008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111068002', 'Patrick Burns', NULL, '10/22/24: Cathy called stating that her monthly bill increased by about $80 and wondering why. Reached out to Patti about her situation letting her know Cathy would be giving her a call Wednesday morning. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-22 15:32:41', '2024-10-22 15:32:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000149684015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123382001', 'Erik Rubin', NULL, '10-22-24 Erik called bc he got new benefits with a new job. The benefits have already kicked in. I showed him how to complete the cancellation form and he started completing it while we were talking. He was very appreciative and will proceed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-22 15:30:02', '2024-10-22 15:30:02'),
