  ('zcrm_1579374000149602008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165383', 'Tyler McMahon', NULL, '10-22-24 Tyler is very interested in HAB for annual wellness, skin check, colonoscopy, mammo for wife, dental maybe, vision, gym for running races or mt biking races or swim membership in the winter, nutrition maybe, labs yes and open to using mental health. It''s $200 additionally. They are paying $493 now but will be moved to Direct (I''m guessing) for Jan. 1st which is $540. They could switch to Care+ for $461 and HAB $200 = $661 for Nov or Dec 1st start date. He plans to decide right away once he talks with his wife.  He will decide by Friday for Nov. 1st effective date. We can''t change his current membership until Dec. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-22 11:32:13', '2024-10-22 11:32:13'),
