  ('zcrm_1579374000149563299', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243567', 'Tanya Dueri', NULL, '10.22.2024 Tanya put in an imaging (breast bilateral MRI) request. I sent her  the following: "Dear Tanya,

We received your request to search for an imaging center for:
MRI Breast Exam: Bilateral - with and without contrast.
I''m glad I was able to generate a couple of lists for you. I was unsure if this was a preventive or diagnostic, so I will lay out the options below.

Diagnostic Procedures:
Feel free to connect with the following facilities I found via HCBB (hyperlinked). Healthcare Bluebook offers you fair pricing and quality care from your providers and facilities in your area. You CAN plug in these entities in the MultiPlan Link, to find out if they indeed are in network, and can use them for preventive purposes. Here''s the snapshot of what I generated. Anything after the last one was, was over $3k.


Preventive Screening via PHCS-Specific Services Network in MultiPlan Link https://www.multiplan.com/webcenter/portal/ProviderSearch?SiteId=84477:
I generated a list of mammography facilities, should your interest be for preventive screening. 
I''ve included the link I used, just in case you were curious if the ones generated in Healthcare BlueBook were in network as well. 
Please note the pdf form attachment.

Please do not hesitate to contact the concierge line, if you wish for additional guidance. We are here M-F, 9-8pm, ET.

Yours in health," NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-22 09:40:22', '2024-10-22 09:40:22'),
