  ('zcrm_1579374000149563040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145560002', 'Stephanie Thompson', NULL, '10.22.2024 Collaborated with Julia via Teams chat over what more steps we can take with our new member Stephanie and her out of network physicians. Julia guided me to correspond with Dave Mitchell at ARM, to proceed with negotiations with the facility/physicians that Stephanie has appointments with next week. I sent him the following email, via Outlook, and Cc''d Julia:
