Would you be able to shed light on Stephanie''s next steps from here to insure coverage for her appointment next week? If there''s anything we can do from our end, at this point, please let us know. I''d be glad to fill that gap.

Cheers! To new beginnings...." NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-22 08:42:00', '2024-10-22 08:42:00'),
