  ('zcrm_1579374000149500018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109512002', 'Gabrian McPhail', NULL, '10.21.2024 Followed up with Gabe on her email she sent me on the 13th, before I saw the notes that she spoke with Acelyn. It appears she was guide exactly as I would have guided her, so now we will wait  to see when ARM covers her mammogram appointments. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-21 16:33:34', '2024-10-21 16:33:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000149500013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146332002', 'Peter Muerset', NULL, '10.21.2024 Josh called inquiring about the membership covering superbills by a therapist. I told him the short answer to that is no, but the members in our memberships do receive mental wellness sessions via Mazzitti and Sullivan company. I gave him their number and hours they are open, and brief guidance on what to expect and what questions he could ask. I sent him a resourceful email on our MAP program via Outlook. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-21 16:11:01', '2024-10-21 16:11:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000149500008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117456002', 'Kelly Pieropan', NULL, '10.21.2024 Jennifer had called while I was on vacation and left a VM. She called again today, while I was at lunch. I called her back, but ended up leaving her a VM, to call back. Her initial message was that she uploaded all of her documents to the sharing request for Zion to decipher and make a determination. She also requested to know where to get the PHI form to speak on behalf of Kelly''s medical concerns. I was unsure what exactly she was referring to, so I will learn what that is, when she calls back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-21 16:01:02', '2024-10-21 16:01:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000149500003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006532067', 'Reena Gajjar', NULL, '10.21.2024 Reena called to get guidance on how to proceed with her preventive appointment, both OBGYN + Annual Physical mixed in one.
