  ('zcrm_1579374000149440003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919812', 'Mary Beth Hassett', NULL, '10/21/24: Mary Beth called about a recent wellness visit bill that wasn''t paid for. I asked her was it an EOB from Planstin or a bill from the provider. She didn''t have it on hand. She said that she already spoke to planstin. Somewhere along the way, someone told her she doesn''t have benefits. 
