  ('zcrm_1579374000149386011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081634027', 'Julia Bolz', NULL, '10.21.2024 Julia called concerned about an old address, showing up in the billing receipt she received via email. I checked CRM and Admin123, but both platforms had the correct address there. I checked with Patti''s teams group chat, and she said "The receipts are generated out of our payment processor FTNI and I have had this before where sometimes the address reverts back to the previous one.  I will look at this after lunch". NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-21 10:52:52', '2024-10-21 11:06:46'),
