  ('zcrm_1579374000149198014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143456001', 'Enock Freire', NULL, '10.18.24 Had an extensive conversation regarding plan details. Explained the IUA, and provided real life examples, MEC and RBF given that he does not have providers in the area. Enock was concerned about the amount of work he would need to do to obtain care, especially given the price point. Will follow up with an email explaining the MEC, he says he has his WC call scheduled with Vanessa on Monday. Connected to MSEAP so he could look at mental health providers in the area. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-10-18 14:43:36', '2024-10-18 14:43:36'),
