  ('zcrm_1579374000149243137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133237002', 'Colin Orffer', NULL, '10/18/24: Colin called trying to verify that a provider is in PHCS network. They are showing up in Multiplan but Planstin or PHCS isn''t listed on website. I advised him to call the provider and verify that they are contracted with PHCS, but also informed him that regardless of what they say - Planstin will still pay for in or out of network services and the provider can call us or Planstin directly if they have any questions about billing. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-18 13:50:55', '2024-10-18 13:50:55'),
