  ('zcrm_1579374000149257031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114123001', 'Narit Trairatnobhas', NULL, '10-18-24 Dear Laura,

We have received your request to cancel your Sedera Membership.  

Your membership will be discontinued at 11:59 p.m. CST on 10/31/2024.

A couple of things to note:

Medical expenses incurred prior to that time can be submitted to the Sedera Community for sharing, as long as they are submitted from 6 months of the last day of active membership.

Any medical expenses incurred after your membership ends will not be eligible for sharing. 

If you change your mind and want to continue your membership with Sedera, please notify Member Services (1-855-973-3372 or memberservices@sedera.com).

Should you want to re-join the Community at any point in the future, we welcome you to re-submit an enrollment form.

We’re sorry to see you go, but wish you all the best.

We would value your input on a short survey that will help us better serve our Community.

Team Sedera', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-18 12:00:34', '2024-10-18 12:00:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000149208046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758269', 'Michael Pennavaria', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request eff 11/24 due to going on spouse''s employer plan direct w/Sedera.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-10-18 11:53:10', '2024-10-18 11:53:10'),
