  ('zcrm_1579374000149243018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516180', 'Samer Alhallak', NULL, '10/18/24: MANCHESTER OBGY/ 09:32 AM/(860) 649-1120 - called regarding Heba''s upcoming surgery. I advised providers office that in this instance, Heba is a self-pay patient and will work with her medical cost sharing group to pay for the surgery, but she will need to personally submit the request and to have her please call us for assistance. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-18 08:46:43', '2024-10-18 08:46:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000149243013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608685', 'Christian Hager', NULL, '10/18/24: Christian called needing 2 things:
