  ('zcrm_1579374000149148104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109598015', 'Steve Wilson', NULL, '10/17/24: Steve called asking if he needs to do anything about his plan. He was talking to William about the planstin re-enrollment process. I explained that the MEC vendors will be changing due to policy changes, but there is nothing he needs to do and that he''ll receive communication regarding that soon. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-17 13:24:17', '2024-10-17 13:24:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000149167028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110457002', 'Christine Carlo', NULL, 'Member called in very confused about the changeover to the new MEC she did not get any information form advisor about this and was surprised that the price was going up.  I have advised her to get in touch with Lou and submit forn prior to tomorrow ahead of billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-10-17 13:09:48', '2024-10-18 08:23:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000149168008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118133001', 'Stephen Hultquist', NULL, '10-17-24 Steve just lost his job Sept. 30th. He''s not sure if he lost his benefits Sept. 31st or will lose them Oct. 31st. Either way, he wants a Nov. 1st start date. He is looking for another job and is also working on consulting and coaching. With consulting and coaching, that gives him a $30K income and huge APTC of $963 for his wife Terry who was recently diagnosed with Parkinsons. Her DOB is 2/16/61 and his is 4/18/61, zip 80503. Steve sees his functional medicine dr. every other week for preventive measures/supplements, etc. No pre-x. He also sees a chiro for preventive maintenance. He is a great candidate for Health Acccess. Yes for wellness, dental, vision, nutrition, skin check and mental health. No for shots and has his own gym in his house. Copper pays for his ski pass, so no cost on that front. 
Back to Terry, she see Dr. Alexander Baumgartner, and Jessica Barr PA. She takes Carbidopa and levodopa (10 mg/1; 100 mg/1). Looks like Cigna CO Option Silver is best with $1000/$100 and $0 for her with the APTC for Nov and Dec.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-17 13:09:33', '2024-10-17 13:09:33'),
