  ('zcrm_1579374000149011003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161633002', 'Daniel Tomkinson', NULL, '10-16-24 Daniel has an interview at 2:00 today for a job. If they give him the job he will have benefits starting Nov. 1st. He likely won''t know until too late for our deadline. He can keep his Health Advisors/Freedom Health for Nov. So, we''d have a Dec. 1st start date if he doesn''t get the job. He''ll keep me posted.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-16 10:06:15', '2024-10-16 10:06:15'),
