  ('zcrm_1579374000148965023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131740002', 'Anzhelika Siloyan', NULL, '10.16.24 Peter has a colonoscopy scheduled a few days from now. He presented his card, however is still receiving a bill for $800 that he says he has to pay before the procedure. The CRM states that he has ARM as the MEC provider. ARM did not have them in their system and put him manually and sent the new cards. Upon checking with IT, Peter is still on Planstin, we are to check Admin 123 for accurate information moving forward. Vinnie will cancel his Planstin plan effective immediately. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-10-16 09:41:34', '2024-10-16 09:41:34'),
