  ('zcrm_1579374000148918036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148917016', 'Herman Kirby', NULL, '10-15-24 Brianna Graner called via Andrea Hinman. They are getting crushed by paying $1400 for RMHP and only a $360+ APTC with 2 tax households and 3 kids. Kayne is in his own group as a separate tax filer bc his mom claims him on her taxes but Brianna and Herman have been paying for his plan. When I remove him from their household since he''s Not on their taxes, their APTC increased to $771. She tried applying for Medicaid and was denied. I''m not sure why since it continues to show they possibly qualify for the kids. I suggested that she calls C4 to remove Kayne from the account and re-run the calculation. This "should" immediately apply to their account with the active RMHP. I told her to keep me posted on the outcome. This should help pretty significantly. Herman is getting $1700 a month for SSI - disability and she earn between $1200-$1700 month. Their account is showing $54K. I ran it at $56,400 which I used her income at $1500 as an average. That''s what gave the $771 APTC. She might get a slightly different result if she keeps it at $54K. Zip code is 80015.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-15 15:07:31', '2024-10-15 15:15:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148911019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095670002', 'Arsalan Ashraf', NULL, '10/15/24
