  ('zcrm_1579374000148918026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115984002', 'Colleen Patrice', NULL, '10-15-24 Colleen got a new job with benefits. I left her a vm in case she is getting a stipend, I can help her keep her membership. If not, I just sent her the cancellation form and let her know the deadline of noon on the 18th for no further billing to take place.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-15 14:22:37', '2024-10-15 14:22:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148855076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068021', 'Ryan Donovan', NULL, '10/15/24: Ryan called wondering what plan he had with Zion. Reason being is that Zion sent an email alerting members that their prices are going up. I explained that he has access to the Zion Essentials through MPB and unless the email came directly from MPB, that email wouldn''t immediately affect him since he pays MPB directly. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-15 14:20:44', '2024-10-15 14:20:44'),
