  ('zcrm_1579374000148856086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148858973', 'Karl Hill', NULL, '10-14-24 Karl joined Premium Care $1000/$285 for Nov. 1st and HAB $107 = $392. He knows to schedule his welcome call. He knows to wait 6 months before his colonoscopy. He can submit for his next season of hockey in 2024 and again in 2025. He''s pleased and set to go for Nov. 2024. Note Added by Wendy', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-10-15 13:45:48', '2024-10-15 13:45:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148856081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148858973', 'Karl Hill', NULL, '10-11-24 Karl Hill is 60 and plays hockety 2x week, exercises every day, skis, etc. No meds, no tobacco, yes for wellness, 1x yr blood draw. He did a colonoscopy at 50, so needs another one again this next year or so. Wellness he also does skin checks, dental, vision, gym for hockey and skiing, nutrition he''s super knowledgable about already and maybe for mental health wellness. He pays for supplements and sees a chiro. $285/$1000 Premium Care and HAB $107 = $392 which is perfectly within his budget. Note added by Wendy', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-10-15 13:45:14', '2024-10-15 13:45:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148855071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073555182', 'Bradley Cook', NULL, '10/15/24: Bradley called wanting to change his membership to the $49 one. 
After asking a few more questions, it looks like he was just worried about receiving a check from Zion for his last sharing request. It is for $2000 and has been cancelled/restated multiple times. We called Zion and Dasha verified that the latest check was sent Oct 1 and should arrive in 2-4 weeks. 
Bradley missed his last payment and his membership has been cancelled, although I let him know that wouldn''t affect this request or check since it''s already been processed. 
