  ('zcrm_1579374000148918021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, '10-16-24 Karen wants a break down and costs. She has selected a lower IUA of $1000 down from $1500. I called Patti to let her know. Patti said they can''t change their IUA until the entire group''s enrollment period in March for an April 1st effective date. Patti will vie for 2/21-3/20/24 changes allowed for 4/1/24 effective. Therefore, their new monthly is $737.65 + $315 = $1052.65 EF.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-15 12:24:40', '2024-10-15 12:24:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148856061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148499386', 'Grace Johnson', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation prior to start due to the fact that she is now pregnant.  I will process cancellation &amp; notify Planstin', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2024-10-15 12:01:27', '2024-10-15 12:01:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148918016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199026', 'Jayna Hart', NULL, '10-15-24 Jayna Hart married Thomas Lastick since we last talked. He earned about $300K in 2024 but more like MAGI at $200K. Jayna just lost her job and benefits. To add her to his employer benefits would cost $900 for just her!  They have many kids, she has 3 and he has 2, I think she said. Ellery is included on the app for now. If they earn a tax credit they will get it at tax time. She has some new doctors and she has been with Cigna. So, I recommended that she calls them to make sure they are in the Cigna Connect plans. She will do so. She''s looking at the Cigna Connect Flex Bronze $0 Ded for Nov and Dec. Hopefully this will be a renewable plan for 2025.  It''s $508.34. She will review it and will let me know if she has any questions. I showed her how to upload her Cobra letter. She will keep me posted as to her decision. She needs Nov. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-15 12:00:55', '2024-10-15 12:00:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148880088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148733002', 'Lauren Laqua', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to book online welcome call after start date of November 1, 2024. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-10-15 11:38:52', '2024-10-15 11:38:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148880078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130446002', 'Sarah Downs', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2024-10-15 11:22:08', '2024-10-15 11:22:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148918011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118383002', 'Ruth Bailey', NULL, '10-14-24 Ruth and I reviewed her membership. She''s only 1 1/2 years away from Medicare. I explained the price increase from $265 to $352. I offered her Premium Care to bring her price back down to $285 in the 30-64 age group. She''s super healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. But, she feels more comfortable likely to stay with her current membership and just pay the higher amount. She''s already done her colonoscopy and mammo. She doesn''t need those. I explained HAB and that was interesting to her. She perked up with the thermogram option and skin check as well as gym, dentist, etc. She will read over Premium Care and HAB and decide if she wants to switch or add HAB.  She knows the deadline is Friday, the 18th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-15 11:19:56', '2024-10-15 11:19:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148919008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148305002', 'Donald George', NULL, 'Spoke to wife Alysa 49 and Donald 51 notified what their membership entails told them Medical Cost Sharing is not included wanted a quote for a membership that includes the cost sharing sent via email', 'Travis Cannata', 'Travis Cannata', '2024-10-15 11:18:05', '2024-10-15 11:18:05'),
