  ('zcrm_1579374000148815043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109743011', 'Jared Fisher', NULL, '10/14/24: Member LVM Friday afternoon requesting a call back. GoTo system is experiencing an outage at the moment, so I left the following email:

Thank you for reaching out and leaving a voicemail with MPB Health on Friday. I wanted to inform you that we are currently experiencing a phone outage, and we’re uncertain when our system will be back up and running.
In the meantime, I’d be happy to assist you with any questions you have via email. As soon as our phones are operational again, we will reach out to you.
Regarding your daughter’s ER visit, I’m truly sorry to hear about her experience, and we hope she has a swift recovery.
You will be presenting as a self-pay patient at the hospital. Once you receive the bill, please give us a call back—we can help you upload it to your member portal. Just ensure you obtain an itemized statement from the hospital. You have up to six months from the date of service to submit the bill as a sharing request to your Medical Cost Sharing group (Zion). After the sharing request is processed and you''ve paid your IUA, Zion will issue a digital credit card for the remaining balance.
Thank you for your understanding, and we look forward to assisting you.
AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-14 08:16:44', '2024-10-14 08:16:44'),
