  ('zcrm_1579374000148768003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148858973', 'Karl Hill', NULL, '10-11-24 Karl Hill is 60 and plays hockety 2x week, exercises every day, skis, etc. No meds, no tobacco, yes for wellness, 1x yr blood draw. He did a colonoscopy at 50, so needs another one again this next year or so. Wellness he also does skin checks, dental, vision, gym for hockey and skiing, nutrition he''s super knowledgable about already and maybe for mental health wellness. He pays for supplements and sees a chiro. $285/$1000 Premium Care and HAB $107 = $392 which is perfectly within his budget.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-12 16:36:57', '2024-10-12 16:36:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148712013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107134002', 'Thomas Beaudin', NULL, '10.11.24:  I responded to Thomas'' email suggesting we meet Tues., the 15th at 11 a.m.EST.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2024-10-11 15:11:47', '2024-10-11 15:11:47'),
