  ('zcrm_1579374000148656123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116236002', 'Lisa D''Onofrio', NULL, '10/11/24: Lisa called upset bc Zion sent a determination flagging her daughter Eliza''s condition as pre-ex. 
We called Zion and spoke to Abby and Jaden (judicator on request).
The pre-ex determination was bc Dr. Stillwagon put in her notes that Eliza complained of having allergy symptoms for a year. 
However the asthma diagnosis and allergy testing wouldn''t be considered shareable whether or not is pre-ex bc it goes against Zion''s guidelines and any ER visit is considered acute, not related to allergy and would be shareable. 
After learning this piece of info Lisa felt better and that she understood where the sharing request stands. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-11 10:45:39', '2024-10-11 10:45:39'),
