  ('zcrm_1579374000148623018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', NULL, '10.10.2024 Steven''s experience with CirrusMD was not positive back on the 4th of Sept.
She was not receptive - did not do video chat - gave him a BRAT diet - told him to rest. Did a video call for 2 minutes then disconnected them. Then went back to chatting instead. Then closed the chat without telling them. 
"You sound a bit sick. Would you like to do a video chat" then went back texting. 
Recommended nausea medication and stay warm? Tyra Frances.
Steven was shaken so badly that he could not text and could barely verbalize his condition.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-10 16:55:00', '2024-10-10 16:55:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148616023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, '10-10-24 Emily is all set with Medicare person for her husband. They are working through the process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-10 16:37:46', '2024-10-10 16:37:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148623013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, '10.10.2024 Christine called to confirm the mammography facility she used to go to in Denver''s location, can still be part of the PHCS network in Boulder''s location. It turns out, it is not. Only the one in Denver is.
I generated a new list for her today for the boulder zip code and emailed it with other preventive resources via Outlook. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-10 16:10:28', '2024-10-10 16:10:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148616018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, '10-10-24 Christine is going to pass on HAB for now.  She''s already done many of her wellness visits for this year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-10 15:20:58', '2024-10-10 15:20:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148616013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012010011', 'Elizabeth Wood', NULL, '10-10-24 Elizabeth wants to drop MEC and add HAB when allowed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-10-10 15:19:59', '2024-10-10 15:19:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148623008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123285011', 'Adam Rafael Allina-Turnauer', NULL, '10.10.2024 Although Adam shows that he''s completed a welcome call in the past, it is wise to refresh and give him the new knowledge of his membership. So I called to help set up the welcome call. Left a detailed message and sent the scheduling link via CRM email. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2024-10-10 14:58:47', '2024-10-10 14:58:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148571033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077181001', 'Andrea McDonough', NULL, 'Listened to the calls that took place on May 28th. Andrea did not mention that she wanted to add the baby to the plan. There is not change form on file with the information either. Will email her the form and inform her that the bill will be her financial responsibility, since the baby was not insured at the time. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2024-10-10 14:44:29', '2024-10-10 14:44:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148585688', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132140018', 'James Smith', NULL, '10/10/24: Left detailed message and email reminding member to book welcome call. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-10 14:34:42', '2024-10-10 14:34:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148585678', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133860002', 'Jenilee Vander Elst', NULL, '10/10/24: Left detailed message and email reminding member to book welcome call. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-10 14:32:15', '2024-10-10 14:32:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148585663', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140565001', 'Joshua Hartman', NULL, '10/10/24: Called and spoke to Liz - Josh''s mom, who would like to have a welcome call refresher - sending her a link to her email. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-10 14:24:34', '2024-10-10 14:24:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148571028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077181001', 'Andrea McDonough', NULL, '10/10/2024
Andres called because she took her newborn to their annual visit and presented the planstin card at the dr office. She is now getting a bill for the visit and wants to submit or be reimbursed for that money. The Problem is she never added the baby to her plan. She claims she did but no records have been found', 'Acelyn Calderon', 'Acelyn Calderon', '2024-10-10 14:20:31', '2024-10-10 14:20:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148585653', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133844002', 'Alex Woelfel-Smith', NULL, '10/10/24: Left detailed message and email reminding member to book welcome call. AM', 'Angee Montgomery', 'Angee Montgomery', '2024-10-10 14:18:43', '2024-10-10 14:18:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000148571023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146376012', 'Abhi Tej Banka', NULL, '10/10/24
a dermatology office called on his behalf to see how the appointment would be covered. I advised that it would be self-pay. The fort office lady insisted on knowing more info on how the plans work and if the member would be fully reinbursed. I informed the dermatology office that I would personally call the member and explain how his plan works. I then called the member and informed him that is MEC portion only covers what the ACA mandates as preventative and that doesn''t include dermatology. His visit would be out of pocket', 'Acelyn Calderon', 'Acelyn Calderon', '2024-10-10 14:16:15', '2024-10-10 14:16:15'),
