  ('zcrm_1579374000148607136', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129064002', 'Kellie Galligan', NULL, '10.10.2024 Called Kellie to help set up the welcome call. I ended up speaking to her and sent the scheduling link via CRM email. 
